<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.620" end="00:00:04.070" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.250" end="00:00:05.530" style="s2">This boat is mine now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.820" end="00:00:06.500" style="s2">Get off.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.190" end="00:00:08.000" style="s2">Giles Barrett!</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.110" end="00:00:09.130" style="s2">Are you even human?</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.290" end="00:00:10.520" style="s2">We agreed on fifty-fifty.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.660" end="00:00:12.290" style="s2">I put in $120,000!</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.480" end="00:00:13.540" style="s2">Now that we&#39;re making money,</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.670" end="00:00:14.660" style="s2">you use a fake contract</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.710" end="00:00:15.510" style="s2">to kick me out?</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.000" end="00:00:17.090" style="s2">You say it&#39;s fake,</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.630" end="00:00:18.400" style="s2">got any proof?</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.510" end="00:00:19.680" style="s2">Your fingerprint is on it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.790" end="00:00:20.690" style="s2">Even if you go to God,</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.740" end="00:00:21.840" style="s2">this boat is still mine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.270" end="00:00:23.130" style="s2">For the past year,</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.250" end="00:00:24.350" style="s2">I found all the fishing spots!</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.490" end="00:00:25.100" style="s2">Without me,</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.270" end="00:00:26.250" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t even know</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.300" end="00:00:26.830" style="s2">where to sail!</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.830" end="00:00:27.650" style="s2">I kept you around</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.680" end="00:00:28.650" style="s2">because you were useful.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.950" end="00:00:30.240" style="s2">Now I know the routes,</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.350" end="00:00:31.330" style="s2">why share the cash?</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.450" end="00:00:33.260" style="s2">Morgan, blame yourself for being dumb.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.260" end="00:00:34.510" style="s2">Why would you ever trust me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.550" end="00:00:36.130" style="s2">Fine, I&#39;ll remember this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.300" end="00:00:37.090" style="s2">The way you kicked me</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.130" end="00:00:37.860" style="s2">off the boat today,</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.030" end="00:00:38.740" style="s2">sooner or later,</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.880" end="00:00:39.260" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.310" end="00:00:40.270" style="s2">give the boat back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.060" end="00:00:42.030" style="s2">Worry about how</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.070" end="00:00:43.040" style="s2">you&#39;ll feed yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.060" end="00:00:43.840" style="s2">Without the SeaRunner,</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.990" end="00:00:45.530" style="s2">you are nothing. Set sail!</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.770" end="00:01:23.210" style="s2">Take it!</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.360" end="00:01:25.000" style="s2">Take it all! Stay away!</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.270" end="00:01:31.000" style="s2">Ding! First feeding successful.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.110" end="00:01:32.670" style="s2">BeastBond Protocol activated.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.850" end="00:01:34.490" style="s2">Saltwater Crocs live in estuaries,</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.610" end="00:01:35.500" style="s2">mangroves, and</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.550" end="00:01:36.510" style="s2">shallow coastal waters.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.640" end="00:01:38.250" style="s2">Once bonded, you can communicate,</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.370" end="00:01:39.880" style="s2">and its strength, speed,</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.950" end="00:01:42.030" style="s2">endurance, and adaptability will increase.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.150" end="00:01:43.030" style="s2">Initiate bonding?</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.030" end="00:01:43.910" style="s2">Beast bonding?</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.370" end="00:01:45.670" style="s2">It ate all the fish anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.670" end="00:01:46.200" style="s2">Bond!</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.570" end="00:01:48.940" style="s2">Saltwater Croc successfully bonded.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.340" end="00:01:51.460" style="s2">This two-legged beast is so generous!</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.780" end="00:01:53.530" style="s2">He gave Finn all his food!</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.730" end="00:01:55.900" style="s2">Just a bit too little, I&#39;m still hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.520" end="00:01:57.560" style="s2">My whole day&#39;s pay</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.580" end="00:01:58.870" style="s2">went right into your belly.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.040" end="00:02:00.200" style="s2">And you&#39;re complaining?</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.200" end="00:02:01.970" style="s2">Since you gave me all your food,</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.180" end="00:02:03.830" style="s2">you&#39;re my boss from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.930" end="00:02:05.520" style="s2">Boss, there&#39;s a good spot ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.600" end="00:02:07.020" style="s2">It&#39;s full of things with big claws</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.040" end="00:02:07.680" style="s2">and long whiskers!</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.800" end="00:02:08.650" style="s2">Hop on, Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.820" end="00:02:09.770" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you to catch them.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.770" end="00:02:11.300" style="s2">You can carry me out to sea?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.330" end="00:02:11.960" style="s2">Of course!</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.170" end="00:02:13.850" style="s2">I&#39;m full of energy right now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.050" end="00:02:15.830" style="s2">As long as you hold on tight, Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.980" end="00:02:17.040" style="s2">I&#39;ll definitely get you there</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.100" end="00:02:17.900" style="s2">safe and sound!</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.870" end="00:02:30.210" style="s2">This croc is so fierce!</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.500" end="00:02:32.100" style="s2">Faster than a fishing boat!</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.900" end="00:02:38.830" style="s2">This is awesome! Faster, Finn!</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.210" end="00:02:45.330" style="s2">Creamback Crabs!</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.470" end="00:02:46.630" style="s2">And Royal Lobsters!</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.060" end="00:02:48.620" style="s2">The entrance is full of hidden reefs.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.820" end="00:02:50.260" style="s2">Normal boats can&#39;t even get in.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.360" end="00:02:51.790" style="s2">This is an absolute treasure trove!</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.000" end="00:02:53.290" style="s2">This is Finn&#39;s turf.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.390" end="00:02:54.180" style="s2">These guys used to</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.270" end="00:02:55.460" style="s2">always fight me for space.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.610" end="00:02:56.840" style="s2">Now that you&#39;re here, Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.990" end="00:02:58.020" style="s2">catch as many as you want.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.180" end="00:02:59.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll drive them out for you!</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.200" end="00:03:00.220" style="s2">Just one Creamback Crab</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.260" end="00:03:01.510" style="s2">can sell for $100!</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.610" end="00:03:02.710" style="s2">And Royal Lobsters this big</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.750" end="00:03:03.460" style="s2">are worth even more!</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.580" end="00:03:05.060" style="s2">Finn, we&#39;re gonna be rich!</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.157" end="00:03:07.857" style="s2">A Creamback Crab over a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.367" end="00:03:09.177" style="s2">Quality like this,</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.487" end="00:03:10.737" style="s2">can sell for a hundred bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.797" end="00:03:12.257" style="s2">How many do you need, boss?</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.507" end="00:03:13.997" style="s2">I&#39;ll flush them all out for you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.137" end="00:03:15.487" style="s2">Today we&#39;re gonna get</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.557" end="00:03:16.157" style="s2">these two buckets full.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.997" end="00:03:23.367" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.767" end="00:03:25.067" style="s2">This one came right to us.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.427" end="00:03:26.787" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.937" end="00:03:27.997" style="s2">That counts as your catch.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.997" end="00:03:29.097" style="s2">You dare pinch Finn?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.327" end="00:03:30.257" style="s2">You&#39;re getting sold soon</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.287" end="00:03:31.487" style="s2">to make my boss some cash.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.937" end="00:03:33.107" style="s2">This hole goes straight through.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.457" end="00:03:34.717" style="s2">Go around and splash gently.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.887" end="00:03:35.607" style="s2">I&#39;ll catch them here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.837" end="00:03:36.987" style="s2">Watch this, boss!</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.947" end="00:03:43.067" style="s2">At least three pounds each.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.557" end="00:03:43.977" style="s2">Just these two</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.037" end="00:03:44.997" style="s2">can sell for two grand.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.847" end="00:03:46.877" style="s2">You&#39;re amazing, boss!</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.297" end="00:03:48.277" style="s2">I only splashed twice,</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.587" end="00:03:49.597" style="s2">and you caught them all!</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.717" end="00:03:50.457" style="s2">You helped too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.847" end="00:03:51.327" style="s2">Keep looking.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.917" end="00:03:53.297" style="s2">Fill it up and I&#39;ll buy you fish.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.087" end="00:03:55.527" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.687" end="00:03:56.847" style="s2">There&#39;s another nest here!</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.437" end="00:04:04.237" style="s2">This batch of goods</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.267" end="00:04:05.667" style="s2">can sell for at least four grand.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.707" end="00:04:06.467" style="s2">Mom and Dad&#39;s shop</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.487" end="00:04:07.517" style="s2">can finally stay afloat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.637" end="00:04:08.177" style="s2">Giles Barrett</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.647" end="00:04:09.497" style="s2">You stole my boat,</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.877" end="00:04:11.037" style="s2">thinking you&#39;d ruined me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.757" end="00:04:12.637" style="s2">But now with Finn,</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.007" end="00:04:14.347" style="s2">I can still go out to sea and make money!</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.397" end="00:04:15.037" style="s2">Get on, boss!</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.307" end="00:04:16.507" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you and the catch back!</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.107" end="00:04:21.567" style="s2">A croc&#39;s in the harbor!</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.877" end="00:04:23.567" style="s2">And Morgan&#39;s riding it!</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.437" end="00:04:26.217" style="s2">Wait for me in the water.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.307" end="00:04:27.587" style="s2">I&#39;ll buy you fish when I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.587" end="00:04:27.977" style="s2">Okay!</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.147" end="00:04:29.267" style="s2">Just call for me, boss,</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.337" end="00:04:30.177" style="s2">and I&#39;ll come right over.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.797" end="00:04:32.337" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.797" end="00:04:33.387" style="s2">Why are you riding</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.427" end="00:04:34.267" style="s2">a croc back here?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.297" end="00:04:35.607" style="s2">You told me to find my own way back.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.997" end="00:04:36.817" style="s2">Walking was too slow,</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.497" end="00:04:38.267" style="s2">so I found a ride.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.337" end="00:04:38.987" style="s2">Holy crap.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.257" end="00:04:40.217" style="s2">This is unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.667" end="00:04:43.197" style="s2">Look at this massive Royal Lobster!</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.257" end="00:04:44.257" style="s2">This catch was found</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.357" end="00:04:45.277" style="s2">right near the SeaRunner.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.437" end="00:04:46.297" style="s2">It belongs to the ship.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.317" end="00:04:50.467" style="s2">When you kicked me off,</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.537" end="00:04:51.107" style="s2">all you threw at me</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.137" end="00:04:52.057" style="s2">were a few trash fish.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.347" end="00:04:53.187" style="s2">Now you see good stuff,</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.237" end="00:04:54.027" style="s2">you suddenly want to call me</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.067" end="00:04:54.847" style="s2">your deckhand again?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.257" end="00:04:57.337" style="s2">Anyone who buys his catch,</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.917" end="00:04:58.737" style="s2">don&#39;t even think about</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.757" end="00:04:59.997" style="s2">getting fish from the SeaRunner!</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.867" end="00:05:01.877" style="s2">If they won&#39;t buy it,</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.047" end="00:05:02.477" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.267" end="00:05:07.957" style="s2">Bring the scale.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.337" end="00:05:13.647" style="s2">42 pounds of Creamback Crabs.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.727" end="00:05:15.437" style="s2">Two lobsters, 6.7 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.567" end="00:05:16.157" style="s2">Plus the conches,</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.287" end="00:05:18.437" style="s2">that&#39;s $5,980 in total.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.437" end="00:05:20.017" style="s2">Morgan was kicked off the boat just half a day ago,</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.077" end="00:05:20.657" style="s2">and he rode a croc</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.707" end="00:05:21.767" style="s2">and made nearly a thousand dollars!</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.767" end="00:05:22.527" style="s2">Maris Dalton!</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.657" end="00:05:23.477" style="s2">If you buy his catch,</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.707" end="00:05:24.117" style="s2">the SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.137" end="00:05:25.197" style="s2">will never supply you again.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.617" end="00:05:26.337" style="s2">Your trash fish</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.437" end="00:05:27.267" style="s2">I can get anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.387" end="00:05:28.487" style="s2">But live lobsters like this</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.517" end="00:05:29.327" style="s2">are hard to come by.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.357" end="00:05:30.137" style="s2">If you don&#39;t supply me,</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.307" end="00:05:31.917" style="s2">it saves me from picking through your garbage.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.147" end="00:05:34.007" style="s2">Bring your good stuff directly to me from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.297" end="00:05:35.467" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay based on quality.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.237" end="00:05:37.347" style="s2">Thanks, Ms. Dalton.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.567" end="00:05:39.067" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.587" end="00:05:40.667" style="s2">What happened to your forehead?</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.167" end="00:05:42.127" style="s2">Let mom take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.194" end="00:05:44.204" style="s2">Mom, it&#39;s just a scratch. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.294" end="00:05:45.204" style="s2">Giles took the boat</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.404" end="00:05:46.584" style="s2">and left me on Crab Isle.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.664" end="00:05:47.484" style="s2">Luckily, I found</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.524" end="00:05:48.304" style="s2">another way back.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.304" end="00:05:49.024" style="s2">They said you rode</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.064" end="00:05:50.084" style="s2">a crocodile back.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.264" end="00:05:51.034" style="s2">Is that true?</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.034" end="00:05:52.504" style="s2">We saw it ourselves!</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.674" end="00:05:54.154" style="s2">That croc carried Morgan and</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.254" end="00:05:55.284" style="s2">two buckets of catch</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.484" end="00:05:56.614" style="s2">safely to the dock.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.994" end="00:05:58.424" style="s2">Morgan told it to go back,</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.884" end="00:06:00.304" style="s2">and it just swam off.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.664" end="00:06:01.114" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.434" end="00:06:02.754" style="s2">That&#39;s a saltwater crocodile.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.794" end="00:06:04.494" style="s2">They can live in estuaries and coastal waters.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.644" end="00:06:05.604" style="s2">I fed it a few fish</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.664" end="00:06:06.604" style="s2">when I was on the island.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.754" end="00:06:07.944" style="s2">It got used to my scent</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.284" end="00:06:09.624" style="s2">and is willing to listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.914" end="00:06:10.434" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.814" end="00:06:11.574" style="s2">I won&#39;t play around</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.624" end="00:06:12.404" style="s2">with my life.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.504" end="00:06:13.864" style="s2">As long as you&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.374" end="00:06:15.484" style="s2">My son is very capable.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.624" end="00:06:16.654" style="s2">Even without the SeaRunner,</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.764" end="00:06:18.204" style="s2">you can still make money from the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.254" end="00:06:19.114" style="s2">But wild things</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.144" end="00:06:20.184" style="s2">are wild after all.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.254" end="00:06:21.524" style="s2">If you ride it out to sea again,</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.614" end="00:06:22.634" style="s2">don&#39;t be careless.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.634" end="00:06:24.664" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;ll remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.774" end="00:06:25.464" style="s2">If I&#39;m not sure,</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.704" end="00:06:26.534" style="s2">I won&#39;t risk it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.664" end="00:06:27.444" style="s2">Giles Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.554" end="00:06:28.244" style="s2">When we were partners,</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.374" end="00:06:29.604" style="s2">you came to my house every day.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.644" end="00:06:30.834" style="s2">Calling me &quot;Uncle&quot; all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.914" end="00:06:32.154" style="s2">Now that the boat is making money,</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.364" end="00:06:33.494" style="s2">you kicked my son off.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.644" end="00:06:34.734" style="s2">Have you no conscience?</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.734" end="00:06:36.454" style="s2">Uncle, that was before.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.574" end="00:06:37.584" style="s2">Now the boat is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.644" end="00:06:38.994" style="s2">Morgan has nothing to do with me anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.054" end="00:06:41.484" style="s2">By the way, he was short of 30,000 dollars for his share.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.584" end="00:06:42.484" style="s2">You borrowed it from me,</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.614" end="00:06:43.954" style="s2">using the seafood shop as collateral.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.064" end="00:06:45.184" style="s2">If you can&#39;t pay it back in ten days,</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.284" end="00:06:46.694" style="s2">the shop and the back room are mine too.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.694" end="00:06:48.394" style="s2">You already took 120,000 dollars from Morgan,</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.624" end="00:06:49.984" style="s2">and now you&#39;re squeezing us for 30,000?</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.154" end="00:06:51.084" style="s2">You&#39;re pushing us too far!</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.084" end="00:06:53.314" style="s2">The boat is one thing, the debt is another.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.464" end="00:06:54.674" style="s2">The fingerprint on this IOU</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.944" end="00:06:56.164" style="s2">wasn&#39;t put there by me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.904" end="00:06:58.474" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay back the 30,000 dollars in ten days.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.574" end="00:07:00.174" style="s2">As for the boat and the 120,000 dollars,</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.274" end="00:07:01.164" style="s2">we&#39;ll settle that score later.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.224" end="00:07:02.514" style="s2">When the time comes, take the money</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.584" end="00:07:03.464" style="s2">and get out of our shop!</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.464" end="00:07:03.904" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.484" end="00:07:05.884" style="s2">Got lucky once riding a crocodile,</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.984" end="00:07:07.714" style="s2">and now you think you&#39;re the king of the sea?</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.934" end="00:07:08.804" style="s2">I&#39;ll be waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.504" end="00:07:13.704" style="s2">Tell me if it hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.984" end="00:07:15.964" style="s2">Stop acting tough in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.274" end="00:07:18.314" style="s2">It really doesn&#39;t. You guys eat too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.494" end="00:07:19.944" style="s2">Stop saving the best for me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.154" end="00:07:21.774" style="s2">You&#39;ve been out at sea all day.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.884" end="00:07:22.834" style="s2">You need to eat up.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.904" end="00:07:23.744" style="s2">Listen to your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.064" end="00:07:24.634" style="s2">If you don&#39;t eat,</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.984" end="00:07:25.824" style="s2">she&#39;ll grab that bowl</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.844" end="00:07:26.714" style="s2">and chase you down the street.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.334" end="00:07:29.264" style="s2">Hahaha.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.804" end="00:07:32.164" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.224" end="00:07:34.764" style="s2">Mom, let&#39;s fix the freezer first,</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.874" end="00:07:35.794" style="s2">and buy some food.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.974" end="00:07:37.334" style="s2">We&#39;re opening the shop tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.334" end="00:07:38.314" style="s2">We can manage.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.924" end="00:07:40.504" style="s2">Keep this for nets and buckets.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.954" end="00:07:42.534" style="s2">You need some starting capital.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.844" end="00:07:45.994" style="s2">Mom, to help me get that boat</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.054" end="00:07:47.134" style="s2">you spent all your savings</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.174" end="00:07:48.114" style="s2">and mortgaged the shop.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.264" end="00:07:49.484" style="s2">Now that the boat&#39;s gone,</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.734" end="00:07:51.164" style="s2">I can&#39;t let you shoulder this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.164" end="00:07:52.784" style="s2">I know you&#39;ll earn it all back,</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.114" end="00:07:54.734" style="s2">but you matter more than the shop.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.784" end="00:07:56.464" style="s2">Don&#39;t risk your life out at sea.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.474" end="00:07:57.614" style="s2">I know what I&#39;m doing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.404" end="00:07:58.884" style="s2">This family</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.904" end="00:08:00.124" style="s2">you&#39;ve protected it for years.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.604" end="00:08:01.634" style="s2">Now it&#39;s my turn.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.004" end="00:08:05.424" style="s2">City Grill needs them by tomorrow night.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.514" end="00:08:06.654" style="s2">They want a batch of large Abalone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.704" end="00:08:07.184" style="s2">Big enough.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.284" end="00:08:08.064" style="s2">Alive and uninjured.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.144" end="00:08:09.864" style="s2">You can make at least $10,000 on this order.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.464" end="00:08:13.464" style="s2">Why ask me first?</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.464" end="00:08:14.754" style="s2">Others can&#39;t reach the deep reef.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.954" end="00:08:16.264" style="s2">You can ride a crocodile there.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.354" end="00:08:16.974" style="s2">In this whole dock,</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.114" end="00:08:18.314" style="s2">only you can take this job.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.504" end="00:08:23.644" style="s2">Son, if you&#39;re sure, go for it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.884" end="00:08:25.504" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait for good news at home.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.694" end="00:08:26.574" style="s2">Take your food.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.324" end="00:08:28.724" style="s2">Don&#39;t push it if you can&#39;t find them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.814" end="00:08:30.074" style="s2">Be sure to come back before dark.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.394" end="00:08:32.234" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Mom and Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.444" end="00:08:33.774" style="s2">When I bring back the Abalone,</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.014" end="00:08:34.554" style="s2">our shop</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.714" end="00:08:35.804" style="s2">will reopen tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.004" end="00:08:37.414" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.584" end="00:08:38.794" style="s2">Under that big rock ahead</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.874" end="00:08:39.384" style="s2">there are a bunch of</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.414" end="00:08:40.604" style="s2">those stone slices you wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.604" end="00:08:41.564" style="s2">They&#39;re called abalone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.934" end="00:08:42.874" style="s2">We found a lot today.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.004" end="00:08:44.004" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you a treat later.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.004" end="00:08:44.994" style="s2">Hold tight, Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.134" end="00:08:45.874" style="s2">I&#39;ll dig out all</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.904" end="00:08:46.884" style="s2">the biggest ones!</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.304" end="00:08:58.334" style="s2">Nearly a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.434" end="00:08:59.464" style="s2">The shell is intact.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.954" end="00:09:00.774" style="s2">Ms. Dalton&#39;s order</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.834" end="00:09:01.904" style="s2">is pretty much secured.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.364" end="00:09:09.374" style="s2">Boss, over here!</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.454" end="00:09:10.534" style="s2">There are two fat ones!</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.694" end="00:09:11.454" style="s2">I didn&#39;t touch them,</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.484" end="00:09:12.564" style="s2">afraid they might shrink back in.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.564" end="00:09:13.984" style="s2">You&#39;re using your brain this time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.104" end="00:09:14.934" style="s2">You guard the back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.114" end="00:09:15.734" style="s2">I&#39;ll pry them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.404" end="00:09:21.714" style="s2">These two are over a pound each.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.834" end="00:09:23.444" style="s2">They alone can sell for 700 bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.834" end="00:09:25.864" style="s2">I found them!</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.674" end="00:09:27.764" style="s2">I&#39;ll credit you for it!</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.084" end="00:09:29.894" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you two extra fish when we get back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.714" end="00:09:35.844" style="s2">Boss, come quick!</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.934" end="00:09:37.574" style="s2">There&#39;s a whole bunch of fat ones here!</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.054" end="00:09:50.344" style="s2">At least 30 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.604" end="00:09:52.164" style="s2">This bag alone is worth a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.404" end="00:09:54.034" style="s2">It&#39;s my secret spot!</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.174" end="00:09:55.804" style="s2">Of course it has the best stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.804" end="00:09:56.574" style="s2">We still have time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.754" end="00:09:58.334" style="s2">Let&#39;s find a few more over a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.514" end="00:10:00.034" style="s2">Then today&#39;s order is locked in.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.664" end="00:10:07.144" style="s2">Over 30 pounds of big abalone.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.254" end="00:10:08.264" style="s2">Not a single one damaged.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.374" end="00:10:09.604" style="s2">Today was totally worth the trip.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.854" end="00:10:10.964" style="s2">Let&#39;s leave the catch here for now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.224" end="00:10:12.404" style="s2">The current won&#39;t reach this pillar.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.654" end="00:10:13.864" style="s2">And the rope won&#39;t come loose.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.284" end="00:10:15.314" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.644" end="00:10:16.924" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep watch right here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.504" end="00:10:18.204" style="s2">Even the waves</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.324" end="00:10:19.434" style="s2">won&#39;t take a single one!</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.404" end="00:10:25.634" style="s2">Something&#39;s snagged underneath.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.304" end="00:10:33.774" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.174" end="00:10:34.994" style="s2">It&#39;s that old guy</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.014" end="00:10:35.694" style="s2">with the big shell!</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.084" end="00:10:37.834" style="s2">He&#39;s getting dragged down by that broken trap!</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.914" end="00:10:41.064" style="s2">The abalone is secure.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.274" end="00:10:42.514" style="s2">Finn, come down with me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.584" end="00:10:43.864" style="s2">You bite onto the trap&#39;s rope,</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.954" end="00:10:45.064" style="s2">and I&#39;ll cut the net off him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.064" end="00:10:45.924" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.074" end="00:10:46.994" style="s2">Once I bite down,</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.174" end="00:10:48.044" style="s2">I won&#39;t let go!</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.818" end="00:10:51.938" style="s2">Hurry up, boss!</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.048" end="00:10:53.618" style="s2">This stupid cage is heavy as hell.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.528" end="00:11:00.058" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.338" end="00:11:01.398" style="s2">I haven&#39;t let go!</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.708" end="00:11:02.868" style="s2">Keep going!</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.298" end="00:11:16.328" style="s2">You&#39;re pretty quick, old buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.818" end="00:11:17.708" style="s2">We just saved you,</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.848" end="00:11:18.998" style="s2">and now you&#39;ve saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.728" end="00:11:22.678" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget me!</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.148" end="00:11:24.268" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t held the rope,</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.368" end="00:11:25.658" style="s2">you guys would&#39;ve fallen!</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.098" end="00:11:27.368" style="s2">I know you helped a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.458" end="00:11:28.768" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you extra fish later.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.678" end="00:11:35.418" style="s2">Have a bite.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.608" end="00:11:37.098" style="s2">Your wound will heal in a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.738" end="00:11:40.238" style="s2">Rescue and feeding complete.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.358" end="00:11:42.178" style="s2">Bondable sea beast detected:</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.448" end="00:11:43.268" style="s2">Old Shelly.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.388" end="00:11:44.918" style="s2">Knows tides and hidden reefs,</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.088" end="00:11:46.778" style="s2">rivers and deep-water resources.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.938" end="00:11:48.288" style="s2">Can communicate once bonded,</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.398" end="00:11:49.778" style="s2">and boosts diving perception</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.908" end="00:11:51.158" style="s2">and defense capabilities.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.358" end="00:11:52.438" style="s2">Bond with beast?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.038" end="00:11:53.838" style="s2">I found another</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.858" end="00:11:54.838" style="s2">bondable sea beast.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.678" end="00:11:56.298" style="s2">Bond.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.238" end="00:12:00.528" style="s2">Old Shelly bonded successfully.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.608" end="00:12:01.618" style="s2">Bonded Keeper gains Ocean</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.698" end="00:12:02.708" style="s2">Adaptation Physique.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.778" end="00:12:03.948" style="s2">Can enter normal coastal waters</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.968" end="00:12:05.588" style="s2">to breathe, see, and move normally.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.588" end="00:12:06.548" style="s2">Young man.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.948" end="00:12:07.938" style="s2">Steady hands.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.198" end="00:12:09.068" style="s2">A bit later,</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.458" end="00:12:10.368" style="s2">and my leg</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.418" end="00:12:11.438" style="s2">would be gone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.868" end="00:12:14.008" style="s2">If I didn&#39;t hold that cage,</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.358" end="00:12:15.828" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t even have a chance</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.988" end="00:12:16.558" style="s2">to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.068" end="00:12:18.228" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you the one</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.398" end="00:12:20.498" style="s2">tumbling around earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.668" end="00:12:21.748" style="s2">I was just finding</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.798" end="00:12:22.598" style="s2">a better angle!</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.798" end="00:12:24.018" style="s2">Haha, okay.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.518" end="00:12:25.898" style="s2">You&#39;re the real hero.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.978" end="00:12:26.908" style="s2">You heard the boss.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.198" end="00:12:28.168" style="s2">I&#39;ll let it slide.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.838" end="00:12:39.358" style="s2">I can really breathe underwater.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.868" end="00:12:41.348" style="s2">Deep areas I couldn&#39;t reach before,</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.598" end="00:12:42.698" style="s2">I can dive down there now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.368" end="00:12:49.598" style="s2">The catch is fine. Tonight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.628" end="00:12:50.338" style="s2">order is secured.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.338" end="00:12:52.238" style="s2">These abalones aren&#39;t that big.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.798" end="00:12:54.578" style="s2">There&#39;s Backflow Reef up ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.868" end="00:12:56.298" style="s2">The water is calmer there,</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.668" end="00:12:58.038" style="s2">and the abalones are plumper.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.588" end="00:13:00.398" style="s2">The ones I found are plump too!</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.118" end="00:13:02.758" style="s2">I didn&#39;t say they weren&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.178" end="00:13:04.808" style="s2">The ones ahead are just bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.338" end="00:13:09.428" style="s2">Let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.748" end="00:13:11.338" style="s2">We already have over 30 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.518" end="00:13:13.058" style="s2">If we find some big ones over a pound,</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.168" end="00:13:14.348" style="s2">we&#39;ll make a killing today!</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.038" end="00:13:19.758" style="s2">So many giant abalones over a pound!</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.988" end="00:13:21.038" style="s2">For Ms. Dalton&#39;s order,</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.188" end="00:13:22.238" style="s2">not only can we deliver,</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.358" end="00:13:22.768" style="s2">we&#39;ll give her</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.798" end="00:13:24.368" style="s2">the best catch in Luna Cove!</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.338" end="00:13:28.298" style="s2">Clean shells.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.478" end="00:13:29.358" style="s2">Great size, too.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.458" end="00:13:30.658" style="s2">These abalones are even better</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.688" end="00:13:31.468" style="s2">than the ones before.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.208" end="00:13:35.628" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.738" end="00:13:37.268" style="s2">Two more fat ones on the left.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.708" end="00:13:39.148" style="s2">Guard them if you spot them.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.168" end="00:13:40.478" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the fish get near them.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.538" end="00:13:48.088" style="s2">This water will only stay calm for a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.388" end="00:13:50.438" style="s2">Once the high tide rolls in,</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.708" end="00:13:53.128" style="s2">these reef cracks will be hard to pass.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.128" end="00:13:54.138" style="s2">We have enough time.</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.368" end="00:13:55.518" style="s2">Only grab the biggest ones.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.668" end="00:13:57.268" style="s2">We leave once the second net is full.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.458" end="00:14:05.668" style="s2">No need to hold my breath.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.768" end="00:14:07.248" style="s2">And I can see the stuff in the crevices</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.298" end="00:14:07.858" style="s2">crystal clear.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.738" end="00:14:18.078" style="s2">About a pound and a half.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.208" end="00:14:19.718" style="s2">This is the biggest one today.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.048" end="00:14:21.338" style="s2">You&#39;re awesome, Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.488" end="00:14:23.098" style="s2">Getting it out of that tight spot!</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.268" end="00:14:25.298" style="s2">Now who was it that said they&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.378" end="00:14:27.798" style="s2">smash the rocks open with their head?</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.098" end="00:14:29.368" style="s2">I was just giving you</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.438" end="00:14:30.968" style="s2">a backup plan, Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.098" end="00:14:32.198" style="s2">Cut the crap.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.538" end="00:14:38.948" style="s2">We&#39;ve got about 50 pounds total.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.608" end="00:14:40.478" style="s2">Ms. Dalton&#39;s order</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.528" end="00:14:41.938" style="s2">is safely in the bag!</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.138" end="00:14:46.548" style="s2">The rising tide is here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.758" end="00:14:48.588" style="s2">Follow me through the backflow channel.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.968" end="00:15:07.578" style="s2">The smallest is seven or eight ounces.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.698" end="00:15:09.218" style="s2">There&#39;s over a dozen over a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.358" end="00:15:10.798" style="s2">I&#39;ll take the whole batch.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.708" end="00:15:13.528" style="s2">Total weight 52.8 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.818" end="00:15:15.398" style="s2">Not a single one is damaged.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.198" end="00:15:21.828" style="s2">The large ones are 360 a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.918" end="00:15:22.968" style="s2">Medium ones 280.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.068" end="00:15:24.798" style="s2">That&#39;s 15,600 total.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.128" end="00:15:25.558" style="s2">Doug.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.018" end="00:15:26.838" style="s2">Morgan made</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.448" end="00:15:30.278" style="s2">15,000 on this trip.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.198" end="00:15:34.898" style="s2">Our son said</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.968" end="00:15:36.168" style="s2">if he&#39;s bringing goods back,</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.838" end="00:15:38.498" style="s2">he wouldn&#39;t come home empty-handed.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.588" end="00:15:44.858" style="s2">These big abalones are rare,</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.988" end="00:15:46.318" style="s2">but you got them all in one day.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.428" end="00:15:47.728" style="s2">For any future rush orders,</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.858" end="00:15:48.988" style="s2">you&#39;ll be my first call.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.068" end="00:15:49.998" style="s2">You pay a fair price.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.098" end="00:15:50.908" style="s2">When I get a good catch,</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.028" end="00:15:51.938" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring it here first.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.378" end="00:15:57.778" style="s2">Mom, get the freezer fixed tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.918" end="00:15:59.178" style="s2">then we&#39;ll restock the shop.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.888" end="00:16:01.448" style="s2">Giles is waiting for us to fold,</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.648" end="00:16:02.978" style="s2">but we&#39;re gonna build this business</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.028" end="00:16:03.668" style="s2">right back up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.838" end="00:16:06.938" style="s2">I&#39;m with you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.298" end="00:16:10.098" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep track of every penny.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.058" end="00:16:16.678" style="s2">Ms. Dalton,</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.068" end="00:16:18.278" style="s2">sell me a bucket of scrap fish.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.538" end="00:16:19.548" style="s2">I&#39;ve got two big heroes today</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.588" end="00:16:20.638" style="s2">who haven&#39;t had their dinner yet.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.602" end="00:16:28.532" style="s2">The fish you bought is so good, Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.582" end="00:16:31.032" style="s2">Shelly,</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.412" end="00:16:32.592" style="s2">you worked hard yesterday, too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.772" end="00:16:33.532" style="s2">Eat up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.702" end="00:16:35.332" style="s2">I may eat slowly,</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.582" end="00:16:37.232" style="s2">but I eat a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.602" end="00:16:39.292" style="s2">The boss gave this to me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.412" end="00:16:40.392" style="s2">Once you finish yours,</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.562" end="00:16:41.322" style="s2">stay away from mine!</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.562" end="00:16:44.542" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. Even with my strong jaws,</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.752" end="00:16:46.582" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t chew your wooden tub.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.762" end="00:16:51.622" style="s2">No need to fight.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.872" end="00:16:52.802" style="s2">Work hard for me,</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.932" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">and there&#39;ll be plenty of fish.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.502" end="00:16:56.482" style="s2">Let&#39;s head out when you&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.652" end="00:16:58.672" style="s2">Ms. Dalton is buying wild sea cucumbers.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.802" end="00:16:59.992" style="s2">Let&#39;s go to Chillstone Reef today</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.042" end="00:17:00.792" style="s2">and try our luck.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.832" end="00:17:04.642" style="s2">It&#39;s Morgan again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.772" end="00:17:05.142" style="s2">That crocodile</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.192" end="00:17:06.052" style="s2">doesn&#39;t just listen to him.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.192" end="00:17:07.532" style="s2">It swims so fast carrying a person!</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.532" end="00:17:08.402" style="s2">It has a shallow draft,</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.522" end="00:17:09.902" style="s2">so it can cross reefs and shoals.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.032" end="00:17:10.762" style="s2">Even with a boat,</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.892" end="00:17:12.102" style="s2">we can&#39;t go where it goes.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.102" end="00:17:12.992" style="s2">It&#39;s just an animal.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.112" end="00:17:14.032" style="s2">How capable can it be?</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.232" end="00:17:15.462" style="s2">Speed up and follow him!</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.172" end="00:17:19.232" style="s2">We can&#39;t go any further.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.372" end="00:17:20.452" style="s2">It&#39;s all hidden reefs below.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.582" end="00:17:22.152" style="s2">If the propeller hits one, we&#39;re done for!</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.742" end="00:17:23.252" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.502" end="00:17:24.882" style="s2">that junk boat can&#39;t catch me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.092" end="00:17:26.032" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about them.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.402" end="00:17:28.082" style="s2">The places boats can&#39;t reach</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.122" end="00:17:29.072" style="s2">hide the real good stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.172" end="00:17:30.272" style="s2">No wonder he doesn&#39;t have a boat</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.302" end="00:17:31.542" style="s2">but still gets a full haul every day.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.672" end="00:17:32.862" style="s2">We can only stop outside.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.952" end="00:17:33.772" style="s2">He rides a crocodile</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.792" end="00:17:34.932" style="s2">and goes wherever he wants.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.722" end="00:17:36.772" style="s2">He just happened to find</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.812" end="00:17:38.542" style="s2">a few reefs no one goes to.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.972" end="00:17:39.672" style="s2">The stuff in there</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.052" end="00:17:41.102" style="s2">will be gone sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.102" end="00:17:41.812" style="s2">But he seems to go</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.882" end="00:17:43.472" style="s2">somewhere different every time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.372" end="00:17:47.372" style="s2">Cold water&#39;s bubbling up from the bottom.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.622" end="00:17:48.982" style="s2">Sea cucumbers love hiding</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.032" end="00:17:50.342" style="s2">under these exposed rocks.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.212" end="00:17:53.402" style="s2">This Six-Spike Sea Cucumber</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.612" end="00:17:54.402" style="s2">weighs half a pound!</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.482" end="00:17:55.642" style="s2">Wild sea cucumbers like this</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.722" end="00:17:56.732" style="s2">can easily sell fresh for</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.762" end="00:17:57.752" style="s2">300 dollars a pound!</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.062" end="00:18:03.692" style="s2">These guys are hiding pretty well.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.912" end="00:18:06.032" style="s2">They almost fooled old Shelly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.412" end="00:18:10.692" style="s2">Boss, Finn is guarding the stash.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.822" end="00:18:12.212" style="s2">Not a single one will get away!</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.572" end="00:18:14.142" style="s2">Over 40 pounds of sea cucumbers,</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.262" end="00:18:16.102" style="s2">and plenty of sea urchins and snails, too.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.232" end="00:18:18.392" style="s2">This trip will make us at least 10,000 dollars!</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.232" end="00:18:21.602" style="s2">The wind is picking up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.802" end="00:18:22.832" style="s2">It&#39;s time to head back.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.732" end="00:18:35.112" style="s2">The sea cucumbers are meaty.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.142" end="00:18:36.602" style="s2">The urchin roe is plump too.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.992" end="00:18:37.962" style="s2">This whole batch</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.972" end="00:18:39.602" style="s2">is restaurant premium grade.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.702" end="00:18:41.042" style="s2">Sea cucumbers, 46 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.142" end="00:18:42.482" style="s2">Sea urchins, 68 pieces.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.502" end="00:18:43.902" style="s2">Babylon shells, 27 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.902" end="00:18:45.482" style="s2">Sea cucumbers at $260 a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.482" end="00:18:46.752" style="s2">Urchins and shells are separate.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.832" end="00:18:48.572" style="s2">That&#39;s $14,200 in total.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.572" end="00:18:50.142" style="s2">$15,000 yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.262" end="00:18:51.992" style="s2">And another $14,000 today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.752" end="00:18:53.152" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.682" end="00:18:55.322" style="s2">We really made the $30,000.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.932" end="00:18:57.022" style="s2">That&#39;s my boy!</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.352" end="00:18:58.742" style="s2">He promised to save the shop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.872" end="00:19:00.302" style="s2">And he actually got the money!</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.932" end="00:19:01.632" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.272" end="00:19:07.212" style="s2">Weight, unit price, and total</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.262" end="00:19:08.122" style="s2">are all on the receipt.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.192" end="00:19:09.212" style="s2">You can double-check.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.522" end="00:19:11.352" style="s2">The numbers are good.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.952" end="00:19:13.502" style="s2">Thanks, Ms. Dalton.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.022" end="00:19:15.462" style="s2">You found the goods yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.542" end="00:19:16.342" style="s2">No need to thank me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.932" end="00:19:24.332" style="s2">Where&#39;d you get the $30,000?</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.422" end="00:19:25.412" style="s2">How did I earn it?</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.572" end="00:19:27.022" style="s2">Everyone on the dock saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.152" end="00:19:28.012" style="s2">The money is right here.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.162" end="00:19:29.422" style="s2">Now hand over our shop&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.472" end="00:19:30.152" style="s2">mortgage deed.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.332" end="00:19:31.472" style="s2">Who knows if it&#39;s enough?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.502" end="00:19:32.832" style="s2">Count it in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.032" end="00:19:34.702" style="s2">If it&#39;s short, I&#39;ll make it up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.872" end="00:19:35.872" style="s2">Not a bill short.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.262" end="00:19:37.282" style="s2">Just hand over the deed</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.342" end="00:19:38.102" style="s2">and the receipt.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.102" end="00:19:39.032" style="s2">So what if Giles took</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.062" end="00:19:39.432" style="s2">the SeaRunner?</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.512" end="00:19:40.162" style="s2">Morgan has no boat,</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.232" end="00:19:41.192" style="s2">but riding his croc a few times</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.262" end="00:19:42.332" style="s2">he made over $30,000!</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.332" end="00:19:43.142" style="s2">The SeaRunner has only brought</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.162" end="00:19:43.902" style="s2">back trash fish lately.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.992" end="00:19:44.632" style="s2">Minus the gas money,</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.702" end="00:19:45.422" style="s2">it probably doesn&#39;t even match</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.432" end="00:19:46.332" style="s2">what Morgan makes in a day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.332" end="00:19:47.472" style="s2">One has a boat but no catch.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.512" end="00:19:49.302" style="s2">The other rides a croc and returns full every day!</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.362" end="00:19:50.392" style="s2">Who really needs who here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.562" end="00:19:51.602" style="s2">I think it&#39;s pretty clear now!</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.602" end="00:19:52.732" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.662" end="00:19:55.202" style="s2">He just got lucky and found</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.232" end="00:19:56.172" style="s2">some untouched reefs.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.782" end="00:19:58.072" style="s2">Once he fishes them out,</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.632" end="00:19:59.972" style="s2">we&#39;ll see how cocky he is!</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.922" end="00:20:02.372" style="s2">Knowing where the good stuff hides</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.622" end="00:20:03.792" style="s2">isn&#39;t something you can buy</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.832" end="00:20:04.402" style="s2">with a boat.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.042" end="00:20:06.352" style="s2">You can steal the SeaRunner,</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.802" end="00:20:07.832" style="s2">but you can&#39;t steal my skills</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.872" end="00:20:08.752" style="s2">to make a living at sea.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.362" end="00:20:16.192" style="s2">Where&#39;s the receipt?</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.562" end="00:20:18.592" style="s2">Write clearly that the $30,000 is paid in full</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.692" end="00:20:19.602" style="s2">and the mortgage is void.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.532" end="00:20:22.422" style="s2">I gave you the deed back!</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.602" end="00:20:23.632" style="s2">Why do you need a receipt?</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.632" end="00:20:25.082" style="s2">When we borrowed the money, you made us</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.142" end="00:20:26.052" style="s2">sign with our fingerprints!</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.182" end="00:20:27.612" style="s2">We need proof of repayment too!</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.752" end="00:20:28.762" style="s2">Everything that needs to be written down</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.792" end="00:20:30.272" style="s2">must be included. Not a word less.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.272" end="00:20:31.492" style="s2">You&#39;ve already taken the money.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.772" end="00:20:33.202" style="s2">You don&#39;t even dare to write a receipt?</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.332" end="00:20:34.482" style="s2">Are you planning to use the old debt</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.512" end="00:20:35.242" style="s2">to extort them again?</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.302" end="00:20:36.932" style="s2">Yeah, paying off a debt is only right!</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.972" end="00:20:38.932" style="s2">Stop dragging your feet and write it!</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.952" end="00:20:49.332" style="s2">The shop&#39;s debt is cleared.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.862" end="00:20:51.932" style="s2">The SeaRunner and my $120,000,</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.252" end="00:20:53.272" style="s2">we&#39;ll settle that later.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.332" end="00:20:56.852" style="s2">Mr. Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.132" end="00:20:58.272" style="s2">Are we gonna let him keep earning?</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.472" end="00:20:59.442" style="s2">Every time he comes back with</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.482" end="00:21:00.102" style="s2">valuable goods.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.502" end="00:21:02.092" style="s2">It&#39;s definitely not just the croc.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.512" end="00:21:04.462" style="s2">First, we find out where he dives</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.502" end="00:21:05.532" style="s2">and which way he heads.</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.702" end="00:21:07.102" style="s2">You want to follow him to the reefs?</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.102" end="00:21:08.222" style="s2">Once we find the spot,</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.872" end="00:21:10.072" style="s2">the goods in the sea</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.492" end="00:21:12.602" style="s2">belong to whoever grabs them first.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.936" end="00:21:15.546" style="s2">Genevieve.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.666" end="00:21:16.076" style="s2">Your shop</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.146" end="00:21:17.566" style="s2">staying open for good now?</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.566" end="00:21:18.136" style="s2">It is!</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.276" end="00:21:19.966" style="s2">We&#39;ll have fresh seafood every day now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.966" end="00:21:21.936" style="s2">Hahaha, that&#39;s great!</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.626" end="00:21:31.896" style="s2">We just got back on our feet.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.096" end="00:21:33.506" style="s2">Why buy me new clothes?</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.566" end="00:21:33.996" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.086" end="00:21:34.756" style="s2">Your old coat</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.796" end="00:21:36.946" style="s2">the cuffs are completely worn out.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.966" end="00:21:37.826" style="s2">We saved the shop.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.886" end="00:21:38.876" style="s2">Buying a new coat isn&#39;t a big deal.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.766" end="00:21:43.206" style="s2">My shoes are still fine.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.756" end="00:21:45.306" style="s2">You dive the reefs, you should</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.366" end="00:21:46.906" style="s2">buy yourself a good pair first.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.906" end="00:21:48.526" style="s2">I got myself wading shoes too.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.606" end="00:21:49.356" style="s2">The money I earn</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.516" end="00:21:51.176" style="s2">is to make our lives more comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.376" end="00:21:52.996" style="s2">Stop being so stingy on yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.566" end="00:21:56.286" style="s2">Alright, my son bought it, I&#39;ll wear it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.086" end="00:21:58.616" style="s2">I&#39;ll make meat dumplings for lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.306" end="00:22:00.676" style="s2">Maris has helped us out a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.816" end="00:22:02.166" style="s2">You should invite her over.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.736" end="00:22:03.186" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.346" end="00:22:04.706" style="s2">She&#39;s still busy taking in stock.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.906" end="00:22:06.146" style="s2">She still needs to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.346" end="00:22:07.586" style="s2">Just go and invite her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.996" end="00:22:14.226" style="s2">Hey, big shell!</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.466" end="00:22:16.106" style="s2">I had my eyes on that one!</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.106" end="00:22:17.406" style="s2">Stare all you want,</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.616" end="00:22:19.426" style="s2">Shelly still bites faster.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.206" end="00:22:25.666" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.926" end="00:22:27.336" style="s2">these are all going in the water.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.626" end="00:22:28.846" style="s2">We&#39;ll need them for our trips.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.266" end="00:22:30.276" style="s2">You carry the cargo.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.586" end="00:22:31.736" style="s2">Shelly shows me the way.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.026" end="00:22:33.086" style="s2">I dive for the goods.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.326" end="00:22:34.636" style="s2">We all have our part to play.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.006" end="00:22:37.066" style="s2">Leave the heaviest stuff to me!</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.456" end="00:22:39.356" style="s2">Just learn to tell a tank</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.406" end="00:22:40.686" style="s2">from a log first.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.976" end="00:22:42.836" style="s2">Stop ramming into things.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.806" end="00:22:44.996" style="s2">That time, I was</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.056" end="00:22:46.506" style="s2">just testing if it was sturdy!</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.506" end="00:22:47.516" style="s2">Two restaurants in the city</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.586" end="00:22:48.806" style="s2">want a long-term supply of</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.856" end="00:22:50.806" style="s2">live royal lobsters and wild sea cucumbers.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.926" end="00:22:52.076" style="s2">They don&#39;t need much per order,</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.136" end="00:22:53.436" style="s2">but they need stock every week.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.436" end="00:22:54.926" style="s2">Big one-off orders bring quick cash,</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.256" end="00:22:56.356" style="s2">but a steady supply keeps</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.396" end="00:22:57.736" style="s2">the shop&#39;s income rolling in.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.736" end="00:22:58.976" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle the buyers</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.116" end="00:23:00.166" style="s2">and the saltwater tanks.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.296" end="00:23:01.606" style="s2">You take care of the ocean side.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.606" end="00:23:02.526" style="s2">Yesterday we only searched</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.666" end="00:23:03.596" style="s2">the edge of Chillstone Reef.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.776" end="00:23:04.606" style="s2">Beneath Blackstone Reef,</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.646" end="00:23:05.656" style="s2">there are a few deep trenches</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.766" end="00:23:06.966" style="s2">that should hold more goods.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.966" end="00:23:08.376" style="s2">There are a lot of crevices there.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.456" end="00:23:09.126" style="s2">Before you go in,</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.256" end="00:23:10.646" style="s2">make sure your safety line is secure.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.646" end="00:23:12.726" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. When I get back,</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.836" end="00:23:14.436" style="s2">I&#39;ll treat you to meat dumplings at my place.</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.646" end="00:23:15.916" style="s2">Are your parents treating me,</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.436" end="00:23:17.336" style="s2">or are you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.336" end="00:23:18.306" style="s2">My parents are treating.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.416" end="00:23:19.246" style="s2">I&#39;m just in charge of</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.296" end="00:23:20.406" style="s2">making the dumpling money in the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.406" end="00:23:21.166" style="s2">Heh.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.636" end="00:23:33.766" style="s2">Boss, something&#39;s stealing your knife!</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.463" end="00:23:42.693" style="s2">You weren&#39;t stealing it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.993" end="00:23:44.153" style="s2">You wanted me to save you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.453" end="00:23:45.473" style="s2">Give me the knife.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.673" end="00:23:52.423" style="s2">So you took Boss&#39;s knife!</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.793" end="00:23:53.203" style="s2">Let go!</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.723" end="00:23:55.403" style="s2">I&#39;ll smash this cage for you!</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.333" end="00:23:59.073" style="s2">You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.183" end="00:24:01.433" style="s2">Boss, move!</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.703" end="00:24:02.773" style="s2">Eat this first.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.863" end="00:24:05.353" style="s2">Cutting the ropes will hurt. Bear with it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.773" end="00:24:13.693" style="s2">Don&#39;t move. Two left.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.843" end="00:24:14.673" style="s2">Almost done.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.503" end="00:24:22.733" style="s2">Finn, pull him out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.203" end="00:24:27.623" style="s2">Boss, are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.823" end="00:24:28.453" style="s2">I just knew that</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.473" end="00:24:29.883" style="s2">eight-legged freak would be trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.593" end="00:24:38.243" style="s2">At least you returned my stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.303" end="00:24:39.433" style="s2">Didn&#39;t save you for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.923" end="00:24:41.353" style="s2">Rescue and feeding complete.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.543" end="00:24:43.033" style="s2">Target accepts Bonded Keeper.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.163" end="00:24:43.993" style="s2">Adult octopus.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.113" end="00:24:45.543" style="s2">Excels in narrow spaces,</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.673" end="00:24:46.413" style="s2">precision touch,</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.613" end="00:24:47.333" style="s2">untying knots,</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.553" end="00:24:48.943" style="s2">and finding resources.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.073" end="00:24:50.373" style="s2">Initiate BeastBond?</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.573" end="00:24:52.753" style="s2">Bonding third Sea Beast Companion.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.933" end="00:24:57.073" style="s2">Octopus BeastBond complete.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.173" end="00:24:58.853" style="s2">Precision touch, untying skills,</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.023" end="00:24:59.403" style="s2">and narrow</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.523" end="00:25:00.233" style="s2">space mobility</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.463" end="00:25:01.073" style="s2">are enhanced.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.073" end="00:25:01.703" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.843" end="00:25:03.143" style="s2">You can finally understand me!</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.323" end="00:25:04.723" style="s2">I banged that knife for ages!</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.993" end="00:25:06.173" style="s2">And that bighead outside</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.193" end="00:25:06.913" style="s2">even tried to ram me!</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.273" end="00:25:08.273" style="s2">You just learned to speak,</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.303" end="00:25:09.773" style="s2">and you dare call me bighead?</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.023" end="00:25:11.103" style="s2">Your head couldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.263" end="00:25:11.943" style="s2">fit through the hole!</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.053" end="00:25:13.003" style="s2">How&#39;s that not big?</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.003" end="00:25:14.193" style="s2">Come down here if you dare!</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.313" end="00:25:15.863" style="s2">Let&#39;s see who swims faster!</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.103" end="00:25:18.413" style="s2">If you two want to argue,</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.593" end="00:25:20.373" style="s2">get off my back first.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.873" end="00:25:21.213" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.533" end="00:25:24.953" style="s2">Dexter,</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.373" end="00:25:26.803" style="s2">the sea cucumbers you put in the net,</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.003" end="00:25:28.573" style="s2">where did you find them?</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.573" end="00:25:29.243" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.483" end="00:25:30.043" style="s2">There are still</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.103" end="00:25:31.533" style="s2">lots of squishy things inside.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.663" end="00:25:33.573" style="s2">And hiding in the holes nearby</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.613" end="00:25:35.193" style="s2">are a bunch of bearded guys.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.213" end="00:25:43.933" style="s2">Grabbing seafood with eight arms!</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.093" end="00:25:44.483" style="s2">Dexter,</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.673" end="00:25:45.473" style="s2">your skills came in</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.513" end="00:25:46.303" style="s2">right on time!</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.373" end="00:25:47.413" style="s2">Master, come quick!</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.493" end="00:25:48.253" style="s2">Deep inside there&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.283" end="00:25:48.903" style="s2">really big guy!</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.013" end="00:25:50.083" style="s2">I can&#39;t pull it out by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.773" end="00:25:52.913" style="s2">Master, come quick!</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.023" end="00:25:53.653" style="s2">This big guy</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.753" end="00:25:54.613" style="s2">keeps digging deeper!</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.773" end="00:25:56.053" style="s2">I can barely hold on!</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.183" end="00:26:00.533" style="s2">Such a huge Ruby Grouper!</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.793" end="00:26:02.093" style="s2">It&#39;s gotta be at least 15 pounds!</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.213" end="00:26:03.553" style="s2">And it&#39;s alive and in perfect shape!</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.593" end="00:26:05.233" style="s2">This alone could sell for thousands of dollars!</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.783" end="00:26:09.763" style="s2">Master, it&#39;s way too strong!</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.923" end="00:26:11.273" style="s2">Eight arms aren&#39;t enough!</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.303" end="00:26:13.443" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it, let go. Over by the hole,</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.503" end="00:26:14.893" style="s2">I&#39;ll catch it when it dashes out!</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.373" end="00:26:22.133" style="s2">Boss, I&#39;ll pin it down!</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.983" end="00:26:24.043" style="s2">It&#39;s a live catch!</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.183" end="00:26:25.053" style="s2">One swipe of your claws,</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.133" end="00:26:26.463" style="s2">and the price drops by half!</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.663" end="00:26:28.033" style="s2">Go watch the net outside!</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.203" end="00:26:30.163" style="s2">I was just afraid it&#39;d hit you, Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.333" end="00:26:31.363" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t craving it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.673" end="00:26:33.773" style="s2">You&#39;re drooling all over the cave.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.273" end="00:26:35.903" style="s2">Master,</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.073" end="00:26:37.183" style="s2">they&#39;re all over the place!</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.403" end="00:26:38.293" style="s2">So squishy!</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.723" end="00:26:39.713" style="s2">One for each arm.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.043" end="00:26:41.233" style="s2">None of them can hide!</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.023" end="00:26:45.313" style="s2">A three or four-pound Grand Conch</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.503" end="00:26:46.143" style="s2">is quite rare.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.233" end="00:26:46.593" style="s2">Dexter,</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.763" end="00:26:48.303" style="s2">those eyes of yours are put to good use!</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.303" end="00:26:50.333" style="s2">Master, I have eight arms, too!</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.433" end="00:26:51.713" style="s2">What&#39;s the use of so many arms</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.813" end="00:26:52.733" style="s2">if I&#39;m the one who has to</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.773" end="00:26:53.653" style="s2">carry everything back!</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.263" end="00:26:58.413" style="s2">The tide is turning.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.803" end="00:27:00.873" style="s2">A strong current will soon enter the cave.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.003" end="00:27:05.333" style="s2">That&#39;s enough for today. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.873" end="00:27:16.143" style="s2">Eight legs, don&#39;t choke</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.183" end="00:27:16.673" style="s2">my neck!</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.673" end="00:27:17.683" style="s2">Swim steadier!</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.803" end="00:27:18.763" style="s2">Master&#39;s Scarlet Snapper</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.903" end="00:27:19.533" style="s2">almost fell!</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.533" end="00:27:21.483" style="s2">Stop arguing, the fish is still alive.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.513" end="00:27:22.873" style="s2">It&#39;ll fetch a good price back at the harbor!</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.773" end="00:27:27.303" style="s2">Clear eyes, red gills.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.503" end="00:27:29.003" style="s2">We&#39;ll offer $4,500.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.003" end="00:27:30.283" style="s2">I bid $5,000!</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.343" end="00:27:31.053" style="s2">The city really needs</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.083" end="00:27:32.203" style="s2">a great centerpiece fish.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.333" end="00:27:33.103" style="s2">Your call.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.203" end="00:27:34.423" style="s2">Sold for $5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.543" end="00:27:35.833" style="s2">Weigh the rest separately.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.373" end="00:27:37.863" style="s2">The Ruby Grouper is $5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.963" end="00:27:39.753" style="s2">Other seafood is $13,600.</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.863" end="00:27:41.733" style="s2">That&#39;s $18,600 in total.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.913" end="00:27:44.183" style="s2">A Ruby Grouper this big?</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.933" end="00:27:46.133" style="s2">Where did you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.733" end="00:27:48.153" style="s2">You kicked me off the boat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.293" end="00:27:49.303" style="s2">Where I find my catch</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.663" end="00:27:50.573" style="s2">is none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.833" end="00:27:51.963" style="s2">The eyes are all cloudy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.823" end="00:27:54.373" style="s2">We can only take it as standard.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.743" end="00:27:56.163" style="s2">SeaRunner was out all day,</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.333" end="00:27:57.423" style="s2">but it still can&#39;t beat Morgan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.483" end="00:27:58.273" style="s2">one single fish!</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.533" end="00:27:59.703" style="s2">So what if he took the boat?</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.813" end="00:28:01.383" style="s2">Morgan rides a croc with an octopus,</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.503" end="00:28:02.673" style="s2">and still earns way more!</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.673" end="00:28:05.373" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.923" end="00:28:07.393" style="s2">Got lucky once and you&#39;re smug.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.013" end="00:28:09.233" style="s2">To chase big fish out there,</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.423" end="00:28:11.273" style="s2">you&#39;re still stuck without a boat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.273" end="00:28:13.033" style="s2">True, a raft</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.093" end="00:28:13.833" style="s2">can&#39;t carry much.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.003" end="00:28:15.163" style="s2">My next step is buying</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.213" end="00:28:15.953" style="s2">my own boat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.403" end="00:28:16.603" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.553" end="00:28:19.213" style="s2">Made a few bucks and you dare</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.293" end="00:28:20.533" style="s2">dream of being a captain?</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.573" end="00:28:22.013" style="s2">I beat you without a boat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.743" end="00:28:23.883" style="s2">When I get my own boat,</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.823" end="00:28:25.933" style="s2">you&#39;ll feel even worse.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.933" end="00:28:27.283" style="s2">Auntie, that&#39;s really enough.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.343" end="00:28:28.633" style="s2">I can&#39;t finish if you give me more.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.633" end="00:28:29.653" style="s2">My mom wants you to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.723" end="00:28:30.563" style="s2">Don&#39;t be so polite.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.673" end="00:28:32.093" style="s2">I&#39;ll help if you can&#39;t finish it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.303" end="00:28:33.653" style="s2">Get your own if you want it!</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.743" end="00:28:35.433" style="s2">Don&#39;t use Maris as an excuse.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.463" end="00:28:38.003" style="s2">Morgan, this is the receipt</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.173" end="00:28:40.203" style="s2">for the $120,000 sent to Giles.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.363" end="00:28:41.773" style="s2">The transfer slips and receipts,</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.773" end="00:28:42.773" style="s2">your mom kept them all.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.773" end="00:28:43.743" style="s2">When he took the money,</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.853" end="00:28:45.103" style="s2">he was all sweet talk.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.263" end="00:28:46.473" style="s2">Once the boat made a profit,</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.623" end="00:28:48.103" style="s2">he turned his back on us.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.103" end="00:28:50.503" style="s2">Mom, it&#39;s useful to keep these.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.673" end="00:28:52.073" style="s2">But I won&#39;t drop my real business</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.123" end="00:28:53.273" style="s2">just to obsess over him every day.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.273" end="00:28:54.373" style="s2">So what&#39;s your plan?</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.703" end="00:28:55.423" style="s2">Make money first.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.483" end="00:28:56.433" style="s2">Buy a boat that&#39;s better</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.453" end="00:28:56.963" style="s2">than the SeaRunner.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.023" end="00:28:58.243" style="s2">When I sail my boat back to the dock,</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.333" end="00:28:59.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll take those receipts,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.223" end="00:29:00.053" style="s2">and in front of everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.193" end="00:29:01.413" style="s2">I&#39;ll settle the score with Giles</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.463" end="00:29:03.683" style="s2">over the $120,000 and the SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.933" end="00:29:04.493" style="s2">once and for all.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.493" end="00:29:05.363" style="s2">At this rate,</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.683" end="00:29:06.503" style="s2">a few more trips,</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.693" end="00:29:08.273" style="s2">and you could look at used motorboats.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.303" end="00:29:09.533" style="s2">That&#39;s our boy.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.933" end="00:29:11.073" style="s2">They can take the boat,</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.433" end="00:29:12.333" style="s2">but they can&#39;t take Morgan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.353" end="00:29:13.303" style="s2">knack for making money.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.003" end="00:29:18.333" style="s2">Eight legs, one for each!</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.473" end="00:29:19.273" style="s2">That is cheating!</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.273" end="00:29:20.203" style="s2">I have eight arms.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.313" end="00:29:21.053" style="s2">One fish per arm.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.133" end="00:29:21.933" style="s2">It&#39;s totally fair.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.933" end="00:29:22.573" style="s2">By that logic,</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.673" end="00:29:23.523" style="s2">since my mouth is huge,</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.663" end="00:29:24.763" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t I eat the whole bowl?</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.763" end="00:29:25.983" style="s2">You guys keep arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.453" end="00:29:27.573" style="s2">While you figure it out,</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.833" end="00:29:29.843" style="s2">Shelly will just eat two more.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.073" end="00:29:31.043" style="s2">The guy with the big shell</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.153" end="00:29:32.673" style="s2">is the biggest cheater of all!</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.673" end="00:29:34.373" style="s2">Warm water is flowing into the bay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.473" end="00:29:36.033" style="s2">It brought a school of fish.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.123" end="00:29:36.613" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.753" end="00:29:38.273" style="s2">It&#39;s pitch black underwater over there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.393" end="00:29:39.063" style="s2">Full of fish!</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.113" end="00:29:40.283" style="s2">We haven&#39;t bought a boat yet,</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.353" end="00:29:41.703" style="s2">but the big school of fish is here.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.943" end="00:29:42.193" style="s2">Finn.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.463" end="00:29:43.973" style="s2">We&#39;ll go check it out tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.973" end="00:29:44.433" style="s2">Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.533" end="00:29:45.143" style="s2">I will definitely</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.173" end="00:29:46.613" style="s2">get there before those junk boats.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.727" end="00:29:47.917" style="s2">Boss, hurry up!</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.997" end="00:29:49.137" style="s2">All those fish last night</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.177" end="00:29:50.607" style="s2">They&#39;ll be gone if we&#39;re late!</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.637" end="00:29:52.407" style="s2">Who knows if the fish are gone,</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.637" end="00:29:54.967" style="s2">but your breakfast is about to be.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.167" end="00:29:56.167" style="s2">Hey, eight-legs!</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.237" end="00:29:58.007" style="s2">That&#39;s my breakfast!</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.267" end="00:29:59.157" style="s2">The master said</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.277" end="00:30:00.437" style="s2">we need a full stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.437" end="00:30:01.707" style="s2">I&#39;m just listening better than you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.717" end="00:30:02.527" style="s2">Knock it off.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.927" end="00:30:03.597" style="s2">Find the fish,</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.757" end="00:30:05.117" style="s2">and you&#39;ll get extra portions later.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.437" end="00:30:09.527" style="s2">The birds aren&#39;t flying high.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.557" end="00:30:10.207" style="s2">And what they&#39;re catching</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.237" end="00:30:11.147" style="s2">are just small sardines.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.227" end="00:30:12.747" style="s2">The big fish must be near the surface.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.747" end="00:30:14.627" style="s2">Master, the small fish below are</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.707" end="00:30:15.427" style="s2">all fleeing one way.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.537" end="00:30:16.907" style="s2">Like something&#39;s chasing them.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.907" end="00:30:18.537" style="s2">Southeast waters are warmer.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.697" end="00:30:19.797" style="s2">The big schools chasing them</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.827" end="00:30:21.007" style="s2">won&#39;t stay in the open sea.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.007" end="00:30:22.227" style="s2">They&#39;ll likely follow the warm water</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.337" end="00:30:22.937" style="s2">into Reef Bay.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.937" end="00:30:23.787" style="s2">Let&#39;s ignore the birds.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.917" end="00:30:25.307" style="s2">We&#39;ll block the inlet first.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.307" end="00:30:26.547" style="s2">No matter how fast they swim,</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.607" end="00:30:27.797" style="s2">they have to pass through there.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.507" end="00:30:32.197" style="s2">The warm water enters the bay from the southeast.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.307" end="00:30:34.157" style="s2">The big fish are driving the little ones</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.187" end="00:30:35.377" style="s2">toward the shallow reef.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.737" end="00:30:36.567" style="s2">Silver pomfrets.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.687" end="00:30:37.677" style="s2">About a pound each.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.867" end="00:30:38.867" style="s2">Nice shiny scales too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.957" end="00:30:39.777" style="s2">This whole bay is full of</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.807" end="00:30:40.707" style="s2">valuable fresh catch.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.707" end="00:30:41.207" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.357" end="00:30:42.317" style="s2">I&#39;ll go down and herd them</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.427" end="00:30:43.137" style="s2">right into the net.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.137" end="00:30:43.767" style="s2">Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.267" end="00:30:45.427" style="s2">The school split into three.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.667" end="00:30:46.517" style="s2">The largest group</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.557" end="00:30:47.477" style="s2">is hugging the reef.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.637" end="00:30:48.297" style="s2">Rushing them will</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.357" end="00:30:49.467" style="s2">just scare them away.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.467" end="00:30:50.757" style="s2">Finn, flank the left.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.807" end="00:30:51.917" style="s2">Don&#39;t charge the school.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.137" end="00:30:53.847" style="s2">Shelly, guard the right trench.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.217" end="00:30:55.687" style="s2">Dexter, help me lay the net.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.177" end="00:31:08.557" style="s2">Master, they split up.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.567" end="00:31:09.627" style="s2">Which side do I chase?</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.627" end="00:31:10.667" style="s2">Don&#39;t chase the front.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.797" end="00:31:11.647" style="s2">The real big school</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.687" end="00:31:12.507" style="s2">is still coming.</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.877" end="00:31:18.917" style="s2">Boss, there&#39;s a bunch over there too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.027" end="00:31:20.157" style="s2">Are we really not chasing?</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.157" end="00:31:21.097" style="s2">The little fish are still</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.237" end="00:31:22.037" style="s2">fleeing towards us.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.317" end="00:31:23.547" style="s2">That means there&#39;s more behind them.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.637" end="00:31:24.727" style="s2">Chasing the small groups now</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.367" end="00:31:26.807" style="s2">would waste the whole net.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.937" end="00:31:28.307" style="s2">I&#39;ll listen to you, Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.337" end="00:31:29.247" style="s2">Forget the small fry.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.347" end="00:31:30.527" style="s2">We&#39;ll wait for the big ones.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.437" end="00:31:33.587" style="s2">This is the current.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.747" end="00:31:35.147" style="s2">Dexter, hold the bottom of the net!</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.287" end="00:31:36.317" style="s2">Finn, press the left side!</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.387" end="00:31:37.437" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them go around!</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.567" end="00:31:42.097" style="s2">Dexter!</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.517" end="00:31:43.467" style="s2">Hold the right sinker!</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.707" end="00:31:44.437" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the fish</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.507" end="00:31:45.507" style="s2">slip under the net!</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.537" end="00:31:46.077" style="s2">Master,</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.307" end="00:31:47.447" style="s2">they are crashing into me!</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.807" end="00:31:49.137" style="s2">I can&#39;t hold them!</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.567" end="00:31:51.597" style="s2">Hold on for three seconds!</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.117" end="00:31:52.307" style="s2">One,</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.627" end="00:31:52.887" style="s2">Two!</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.337" end="00:31:54.067" style="s2">It&#39;s closed!</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.967" end="00:31:56.377" style="s2">They charged at me together!</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.767" end="00:31:58.357" style="s2">I was almost dragged down!</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.627" end="00:32:00.267" style="s2">You still have energy to complain.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.467" end="00:32:01.737" style="s2">Guess you&#39;re doing fine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.847" end="00:32:02.307" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.457" end="00:32:03.987" style="s2">The net is full of silver fish!</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.177" end="00:32:05.707" style="s2">It&#39;s totally packed this time!</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.407" end="00:32:06.837" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.117" end="00:32:08.417" style="s2">This one jumped up on its own!</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.617" end="00:32:09.837" style="s2">I didn&#39;t take a single bite!</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.637" end="00:32:11.627" style="s2">The scales are intact.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.727" end="00:32:12.607" style="s2">Nice catch.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.707" end="00:32:14.247" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.517" end="00:32:15.867" style="s2">I caught so many at once!</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.007" end="00:32:17.097" style="s2">So what if you caught a lot?</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.447" end="00:32:18.367" style="s2">I was the one who held</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.417" end="00:32:20.067" style="s2">the whole net for Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.267" end="00:32:24.027" style="s2">Boss&#39;s net here</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.217" end="00:32:25.267" style="s2">caught way more than he did.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.267" end="00:32:26.307" style="s2">Master is the best, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.307" end="00:32:27.297" style="s2">Comparing Master to me?</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.527" end="00:32:28.207" style="s2">That&#39;s cheating!</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.317" end="00:32:29.267" style="s2">Over 300 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.477" end="00:32:30.937" style="s2">All prime catch, not a single scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.177" end="00:32:32.197" style="s2">If we keep &#39;em in this condition,</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.287" end="00:32:33.707" style="s2">they&#39;ll fetch at least ten grand back at the dock.</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.367" end="00:32:35.897" style="s2">That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.747" end="00:32:37.447" style="s2">If we load any more,</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.567" end="00:32:38.577" style="s2">the raft won&#39;t hold up.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.677" end="00:32:39.467" style="s2">Let the rest go.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.667" end="00:32:44.207" style="s2">The school is right inside! Take us in!</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.207" end="00:32:44.897" style="s2">Mr. Barrett,</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.037" end="00:32:46.097" style="s2">the entrance is too narrow!</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.197" end="00:32:47.377" style="s2">The hull&#39;s gonna scrape for sure!</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.017" end="00:32:50.887" style="s2">The hull&#39;s cracked!</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.017" end="00:32:52.267" style="s2">And the fish all got away!</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.267" end="00:32:52.817" style="s2">Dammit!</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.287" end="00:32:54.667" style="s2">Morgan hauls in over ten grand,</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.907" end="00:32:56.237" style="s2">and I don&#39;t even get a single scale!</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.487" end="00:32:58.027" style="s2">Now I&#39;m stuck paying for repairs!</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.171" end="00:32:59.611" style="s2">Slow down a bit, Finn.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.771" end="00:33:00.871" style="s2">Silver pomfret scales are thin.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.951" end="00:33:01.941" style="s2">If they get crushed or bruised,</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.001" end="00:33:03.121" style="s2">the price will drop significantly.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.121" end="00:33:04.051" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.301" end="00:33:05.601" style="s2">I guarantee they&#39;ll go back</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.661" end="00:33:06.701" style="s2">nice and comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.771" end="00:33:08.311" style="s2">Master, I&#39;m watching them.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.791" end="00:33:10.401" style="s2">The ice and wet cloths won&#39;t go anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.401" end="00:33:12.571" style="s2">You were the fastest when grabbing fish earlier,</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.691" end="00:33:14.471" style="s2">and now you&#39;re the busiest protecting them.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.471" end="00:33:15.531" style="s2">I&#39;m fast,</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.691" end="00:33:17.471" style="s2">so of course I can take care of everything well.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.871" end="00:33:23.111" style="s2">You all did a great job this time.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.731" end="00:33:24.541" style="s2">Once the fish are sold,</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.871" end="00:33:25.971" style="s2">everyone gets a big bowl tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.371" end="00:33:27.501" style="s2">A big bowl from Morgan</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.591" end="00:33:29.641" style="s2">will definitely be bigger than the one this morning!</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.721" end="00:33:30.781" style="s2">Fresh out of the water.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.071" end="00:33:32.031" style="s2">Kept well chilled, too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.221" end="00:33:33.341" style="s2">$46 a pound.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.341" end="00:33:34.041" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it all.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.041" end="00:33:35.441" style="s2">That&#39;s 382 pounds total.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.501" end="00:33:36.401" style="s2">That comes to 17,000</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.551" end="00:33:37.671" style="s2">572 dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.671" end="00:33:38.511" style="s2">How did a wooden raft</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.541" end="00:33:39.461" style="s2">hold so many pomfrets?</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.561" end="00:33:40.321" style="s2">If he had a real boat,</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.411" end="00:33:41.571" style="s2">it&#39;d be bursting at the seams.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.571" end="00:33:42.451" style="s2">And that octopus</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.541" end="00:33:43.541" style="s2">holding down the boxes,</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.761" end="00:33:45.271" style="s2">and using ice and wet cloths.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.481" end="00:33:46.371" style="s2">Unbelievable!</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.371" end="00:33:47.451" style="s2">The pomfrets are pristine.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.491" end="00:33:48.771" style="s2">Buyers want a long-term deal.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.921" end="00:33:50.041" style="s2">With the money you&#39;ve saved,</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.171" end="00:33:51.631" style="s2">you can afford an old boat now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.271" end="00:33:56.131" style="s2">Let&#39;s not rush it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.641" end="00:33:58.261" style="s2">Gotta check the hull and engine carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.501" end="00:33:59.771" style="s2">We can&#39;t just throw our family&#39;s money</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.791" end="00:34:00.261" style="s2">down the drain.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.831" end="00:34:04.401" style="s2">Auntie, you got something for me too?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.401" end="00:34:05.331" style="s2">You&#39;re always running around</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.451" end="00:34:06.421" style="s2">finding buyers for Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.491" end="00:34:07.381" style="s2">Wearing out your soles.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.471" end="00:34:08.101" style="s2">These are comfortable,</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.181" end="00:34:09.301" style="s2">and make working much easier.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.301" end="00:34:10.361" style="s2">Just accept it from Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.441" end="00:34:11.661" style="s2">When we bring in future catches,</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.751" end="00:34:12.891" style="s2">we&#39;ll still be counting on your help.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.001" end="00:34:17.921" style="s2">This one is cheap,</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.011" end="00:34:19.201" style="s2">but the hull is too narrow.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.331" end="00:34:20.381" style="s2">Loading a few hundred pounds</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.511" end="00:34:21.451" style="s2">will weigh it down too much.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.621" end="00:34:22.611" style="s2">This other one is wider,</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.911" end="00:34:24.001" style="s2">but the engine is old.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.071" end="00:34:24.711" style="s2">Dad is right.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.831" end="00:34:26.391" style="s2">You can&#39;t just look at the price when buying a boat.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.461" end="00:34:28.181" style="s2">The fish hold, fuel consumption, and hull</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.211" end="00:34:29.041" style="s2">must all be factored in.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.131" end="00:34:30.511" style="s2">Let&#39;s save up a bit more for repairs,</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.691" end="00:34:32.001" style="s2">so we can sail it right after buying.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.381" end="00:34:33.191" style="s2">City Harbor Brokers</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.251" end="00:34:34.271" style="s2">gets old boats in every week.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.481" end="00:34:35.341" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep an eye out for you,</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.431" end="00:34:37.051" style="s2">and we can go look when a suitable one comes up.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.401" end="00:34:43.151" style="s2">We can take our time choosing a boat.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.321" end="00:34:45.231" style="s2">For tonight, let&#39;s just enjoy our meal.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.321" end="00:34:46.671" style="s2">And tomorrow, don&#39;t just wake up</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.721" end="00:34:47.791" style="s2">and run straight to the ocean.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.471" end="00:34:51.101" style="s2">The Subsea Springs have opened.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.251" end="00:34:52.871" style="s2">The scent of the water has changed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.001" end="00:34:54.191" style="s2">Beneath the sandy bottom,</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.291" end="00:34:55.981" style="s2">there must be plenty of things hiding.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.541" end="00:34:57.321" style="s2">Even shrimp this big</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.341" end="00:34:58.711" style="s2">were swept up by the warm current.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.011" end="00:35:00.111" style="s2">The things below the springs</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.231" end="00:35:00.931" style="s2">will only be bigger!</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.438" end="00:35:03.748" style="s2">The restaurant&#39;s having a seafood banquet</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.778" end="00:35:04.248" style="s2">this weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.388" end="00:35:05.298" style="s2">We have enough standard stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.868" end="00:35:06.508" style="s2">What we really need</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.538" end="00:35:07.688" style="s2">are the show-stopping big catches.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.678" end="00:35:09.338" style="s2">These regular ones</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.388" end="00:35:10.778" style="s2">only go for a few dozen bucks apiece.</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.538" end="00:35:12.998" style="s2">Wild big catches over three pounds</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.288" end="00:35:14.238" style="s2">can be priced by the piece.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.178" end="00:35:16.378" style="s2">Blue Gar over 15 pounds</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.598" end="00:35:17.508" style="s2">are also priced separately.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.638" end="00:35:19.168" style="s2">Don&#39;t force yourself to find everything.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.298" end="00:35:19.978" style="s2">Finding just one</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.058" end="00:35:21.108" style="s2">makes the trip worthwhile.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.108" end="00:35:21.728" style="s2">Last night,</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.918" end="00:35:22.728" style="s2">I saw thermal bubbles.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.848" end="00:35:24.288" style="s2">There might really be King Clams down there.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.698" end="00:35:26.108" style="s2">I&#39;ll go check the current and the sand bed.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.458" end="00:35:27.748" style="s2">Just bring back what you can.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.958" end="00:35:29.538" style="s2">Don&#39;t risk your life for an order.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.808" end="00:35:30.288" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.488" end="00:35:31.438" style="s2">I&#39;m just going foraging,</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.558" end="00:35:32.638" style="s2">not picking a fight with the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.318" end="00:35:39.548" style="s2">Four degrees warmer than the outer bay.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.808" end="00:35:40.808" style="s2">The spring just opened up.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.968" end="00:35:42.338" style="s2">The sand hasn&#39;t been washed away yet.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.578" end="00:35:43.098" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.318" end="00:35:44.588" style="s2">The water here is so warm.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.688" end="00:35:45.738" style="s2">Like soaking in soup.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.738" end="00:35:46.438" style="s2">Move aside!</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.608" end="00:35:47.628" style="s2">Let me have a try!</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.648" end="00:35:48.918" style="s2">You&#39;re here to forage,</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.218" end="00:35:50.328" style="s2">not to take a bath.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.078" end="00:35:52.518" style="s2">The warm spring is just ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.688" end="00:35:54.908" style="s2">The sand is soft, and the holes are deep.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.168" end="00:35:56.648" style="s2">King Clam.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.868" end="00:35:57.738" style="s2">Just the exposed siphon</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.768" end="00:35:58.528" style="s2">is already this thick.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.628" end="00:36:00.398" style="s2">The one below must be at least three or four pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.038" end="00:36:01.478" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.678" end="00:36:02.758" style="s2">No matter how deep it hides,</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.988" end="00:36:03.918" style="s2">I can dig it out!</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.918" end="00:36:04.738" style="s2">Around four pounds,</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.858" end="00:36:05.738" style="s2">and not a single scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.898" end="00:36:06.528" style="s2">Just this one alone</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.548" end="00:36:07.908" style="s2">can sell for at least 700 bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.908" end="00:36:08.818" style="s2">Hey, Big Head!</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.898" end="00:36:10.308" style="s2">Are you helping or burying me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.568" end="00:36:11.198" style="s2">My claws</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.358" end="00:36:12.218" style="s2">dig fast and deep!</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.618" end="00:36:14.238" style="s2">The sand just flew the wrong way!</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.408" end="00:36:15.608" style="s2">If you dig any more,</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.868" end="00:36:17.668" style="s2">you&#39;ll fill in the whole warm spring.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.338" end="00:36:21.958" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.148" end="00:36:23.378" style="s2">It&#39;s playing tug-of-war!</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.478" end="00:36:24.168" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it!</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.618" end="00:36:26.098" style="s2">It loses value if scratched.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.388" end="00:36:27.708" style="s2">Dig the sand around it first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.568" end="00:36:29.418" style="s2">See that?</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.908" end="00:36:31.508" style="s2">I can be gentle too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.638" end="00:36:33.148" style="s2">If you&#39;d learned that sooner,</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.528" end="00:36:34.248" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t have gotten</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.288" end="00:36:35.638" style="s2">a mouthful of sand.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.658" end="00:36:39.888" style="s2">The spring is shifting!</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.178" end="00:36:41.968" style="s2">The sand ahead is sinking!</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.538" end="00:36:43.358" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.578" end="00:36:45.668" style="s2">There&#39;s another hole down here!</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.068" end="00:36:52.478" style="s2">Dexter!</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.668" end="00:36:53.488" style="s2">Let go of the King Clam!</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.598" end="00:36:54.438" style="s2">Grab the rope first!</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.438" end="00:36:55.808" style="s2">I caught it for you, Master!</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.918" end="00:36:56.528" style="s2">The biggest one!</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.608" end="00:36:57.308" style="s2">Can&#39;t drop it!</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.748" end="00:37:00.248" style="s2">Dexter&#39;s usually so sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.358" end="00:37:01.228" style="s2">Hugging a hard shell</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.288" end="00:37:02.068" style="s2">Waiting to be bait?</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.068" end="00:37:03.518" style="s2">I&#39;m protecting Master&#39;s cargo!</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.648" end="00:37:04.468" style="s2">Don&#39;t need your help!</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.608" end="00:37:05.478" style="s2">Then get off</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.518" end="00:37:06.468" style="s2">my head first!</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.468" end="00:37:07.628" style="s2">The current is weak here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.858" end="00:37:09.078" style="s2">Put the cargo down first.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.248" end="00:37:10.248" style="s2">Then look for an exit.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.338" end="00:37:12.338" style="s2">No matter how valuable it is,</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.448" end="00:37:13.678" style="s2">don&#39;t hold on to it at all costs!</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.788" end="00:37:14.318" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for Finn</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.338" end="00:37:14.898" style="s2">catching you just now,</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.978" end="00:37:15.558" style="s2">both you and the cargo</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.568" end="00:37:16.268" style="s2">would&#39;ve been swept back!</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.268" end="00:37:16.758" style="s2">Master,</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.938" end="00:37:17.528" style="s2">I&#39;ll remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.678" end="00:37:18.758" style="s2">Next time I&#39;ll save myself first,</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.888" end="00:37:19.868" style="s2">then grab the cargo.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.868" end="00:37:20.718" style="s2">Now you know I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.748" end="00:37:21.758" style="s2">reliable, right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.788" end="00:37:22.978" style="s2">You did good this time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.488" end="00:37:25.238" style="s2">Just don&#39;t laugh at me next time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.898" end="00:37:28.788" style="s2">This is the real</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.898" end="00:37:29.698" style="s2">King Clam Den!</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.238" end="00:37:32.348" style="s2">The biggest one must be around five or six catties.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.348" end="00:37:32.848" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.118" end="00:37:34.198" style="s2">I&#39;ll dig slowly this time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.338" end="00:37:35.658" style="s2">No running around holding stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.968" end="00:37:42.888" style="s2">Don&#39;t pull it hard upwards.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.118" end="00:37:43.878" style="s2">Wiggle it left and right.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.018" end="00:37:44.518" style="s2">Let the seawater</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.578" end="00:37:45.568" style="s2">loosen the sand underneath.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.168" end="00:37:49.828" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.098" end="00:37:51.038" style="s2">This one is even bigger</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.088" end="00:37:52.548" style="s2">than the one I wouldn&#39;t let go of!</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.988" end="00:37:53.828" style="s2">Over five catties.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.238" end="00:37:55.658" style="s2">The shell and siphon are intact.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.408" end="00:37:57.258" style="s2">The biggest one today</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.288" end="00:37:58.008" style="s2">has to be this one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.508" end="00:37:59.628" style="s2">Ordinary boats can&#39;t reach here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.718" end="00:38:00.728" style="s2">And divers would find it hard</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.758" end="00:38:02.158" style="s2">to pass through the warm current outside.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.538" end="00:38:03.618" style="s2">No wonder the King Clams here</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.638" end="00:38:04.498" style="s2">can grow this huge.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.218" end="00:38:09.878" style="s2">This hole is so small on purpose!</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.008" end="00:38:11.378" style="s2">It&#39;s looking down on Finn!</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.928" end="00:38:13.708" style="s2">A hole doesn&#39;t look down on anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.378" end="00:38:15.608" style="s2">It just measures your head.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.568" end="00:38:22.298" style="s2">Don&#39;t laugh!</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.428" end="00:38:23.978" style="s2">It ambushed me with a water spout!</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.158" end="00:38:25.638" style="s2">That&#39;s why I lost my balance!</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.418" end="00:38:30.518" style="s2">One knocked over by a clam</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.958" end="00:38:32.668" style="s2">One burying himself</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.058" end="00:38:34.538" style="s2">Quite a matching pair.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.108" end="00:38:38.908" style="s2">Banded Shrimp Shoal!</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.008" end="00:38:39.788" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them scatter!</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.072" end="00:38:45.762" style="s2">They&#39;re all hand-sized</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.792" end="00:38:46.762" style="s2">giant banded shrimp!</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.912" end="00:38:47.492" style="s2">This one net alone</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.522" end="00:38:48.672" style="s2">must weigh at least fifty pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.672" end="00:38:51.022" style="s2">Master, there are too many long legs!</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.172" end="00:38:52.642" style="s2">They&#39;re jumping out everywhere!</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.672" end="00:38:53.782" style="s2">Drive them my way!</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.922" end="00:38:54.682" style="s2">If any try to run,</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.952" end="00:38:56.112" style="s2">I&#39;ll bump them right back in!</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.072" end="00:38:59.162" style="s2">Boss, take this one first!</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.272" end="00:39:00.772" style="s2">It keeps scratching my nose!</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.822" end="00:39:01.772" style="s2">Don&#39;t chase them around!</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.982" end="00:39:02.812" style="s2">When they hit cold water,</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.022" end="00:39:03.702" style="s2">they bounce right back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.952" end="00:39:04.582" style="s2">Hold this spot.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.822" end="00:39:05.972" style="s2">They&#39;ll hit the net themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.182" end="00:39:10.362" style="s2">Master guarded the flow</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.582" end="00:39:11.272" style="s2">and caught way more</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.292" end="00:39:12.202" style="s2">than us chasing them.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.222" end="00:39:13.022" style="s2">Of course!</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.312" end="00:39:14.672" style="s2">The boss just checks the water,</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.882" end="00:39:15.842" style="s2">and he knows exactly</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.882" end="00:39:17.142" style="s2">where those long legs go!</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.372" end="00:39:20.552" style="s2">Such a massive Blue Gar!</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.682" end="00:39:22.082" style="s2">Dexter, block the rear exit!</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.242" end="00:39:23.072" style="s2">Finn, don&#39;t bump it!</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.202" end="00:39:23.882" style="s2">Guard the channel!</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.572" end="00:39:32.142" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.412" end="00:39:34.102" style="s2">This big Emerald Bass is too strong!</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.332" end="00:39:35.772" style="s2">It almost threw me off!</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.872" end="00:39:36.872" style="s2">I&#39;m the one</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.072" end="00:39:37.852" style="s2">who held it down!</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.932" end="00:39:38.792" style="s2">Otherwise, you guys</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.822" end="00:39:39.702" style="s2">would&#39;ve slid right off!</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.702" end="00:39:41.272" style="s2">Save the bragging for later!</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.362" end="00:39:42.972" style="s2">The springs are surging again!</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.302" end="00:39:45.202" style="s2">Sand is burying the entrance!</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.302" end="00:39:49.552" style="s2">Finn, drag the haul!</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.612" end="00:39:50.902" style="s2">Dexter, secure the bag!</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.992" end="00:39:51.652" style="s2">Follow Shelly</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.692" end="00:39:52.582" style="s2">out the backflow!</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.832" end="00:39:54.342" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.492" end="00:39:55.672" style="s2">the haul is stuck!</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.242" end="00:39:58.992" style="s2">We go together!</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.142" end="00:39:59.742" style="s2">Catch and crew,</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.922" end="00:40:00.942" style="s2">nothing gets left behind!</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.582" end="00:40:04.792" style="s2">Now this is how you hunt!</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.112" end="00:40:06.262" style="s2">No rush to sell just yet.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.572" end="00:40:07.382" style="s2">Let Ms. Dalton</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.672" end="00:40:08.732" style="s2">get all the banquet buyers</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.762" end="00:40:09.502" style="s2">together first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.706" end="00:40:10.896" style="s2">Blue Gar&#39;s scales are perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.966" end="00:40:11.706" style="s2">And the meat is firm.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.866" end="00:40:12.956" style="s2">Served whole on the table,</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.066" end="00:40:14.176" style="s2">it&#39;ll definitely steal the show.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.176" end="00:40:15.206" style="s2">Eighteen King Clams.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.326" end="00:40:16.416" style="s2">The smallest is three pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.486" end="00:40:17.506" style="s2">Banded Shrimp and Blue Gar.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.596" end="00:40:18.506" style="s2">They&#39;re all fresh and alive.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.536" end="00:40:19.766" style="s2">This seafood feast is all set.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.766" end="00:40:20.846" style="s2">I want those King Clams too.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.986" end="00:40:21.896" style="s2">I&#39;ll add 50 dollars each.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.036" end="00:40:22.736" style="s2">Sell me six of them.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.736" end="00:40:24.126" style="s2">The restaurant doesn&#39;t need this many.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.226" end="00:40:25.086" style="s2">If we spare six,</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.176" end="00:40:26.516" style="s2">the price can go even higher.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.516" end="00:40:27.516" style="s2">Sort them by quality.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.726" end="00:40:28.906" style="s2">Keep the biggest for the feast.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.396" end="00:40:30.336" style="s2">Give the other six to him.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.836" end="00:40:32.446" style="s2">$14,800 for the King Clams.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.536" end="00:40:34.056" style="s2">$6,300 for the Banded Shrimp.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.066" end="00:40:35.686" style="s2">And $7,200 for the Blue Gar.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.736" end="00:40:37.526" style="s2">That makes $28,300 in total.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.526" end="00:40:38.326" style="s2">Next time you find</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.366" end="00:40:39.326" style="s2">a big warm reef catch,</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.456" end="00:40:40.336" style="s2">save a share for me first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.606" end="00:40:41.336" style="s2">With top quality,</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.536" end="00:40:42.166" style="s2">I prefer to sell to</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.196" end="00:40:43.246" style="s2">buyers who keep their word.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.246" end="00:40:44.706" style="s2">We&#39;ll display them up front tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.896" end="00:40:46.076" style="s2">Seeing live catches like this,</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.266" end="00:40:47.576" style="s2">our seafood feast&#39;s reputation</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.656" end="00:40:48.576" style="s2">will be set in stone.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.576" end="00:40:49.996" style="s2">This didn&#39;t just make us money.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.166" end="00:40:51.166" style="s2">It also helped the station</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.396" end="00:40:52.396" style="s2">secure the restaurant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.406" end="00:40:53.676" style="s2">three-month supply contract.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.676" end="00:40:54.546" style="s2">You handle the buyers,</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.046" end="00:40:56.156" style="s2">so I can fish with peace of mind.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.666" end="00:40:57.566" style="s2">For this long-term order,</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.636" end="00:40:58.616" style="s2">you get half the credit.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.106" end="00:41:02.316" style="s2">It&#39;s got so many patches.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.556" end="00:41:03.836" style="s2">Is it safe for the open sea?</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.976" end="00:41:04.656" style="s2">The patches are old,</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.796" end="00:41:05.616" style="s2">but the wood is solid.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.756" end="00:41:06.416" style="s2">The real issue</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.446" end="00:41:07.476" style="s2">is the tail shaft and seals.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.646" end="00:41:08.196" style="s2">Once replaced,</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.276" end="00:41:09.106" style="s2">it&#39;ll run for years.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.356" end="00:41:10.196" style="s2">The money for repairs</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.226" end="00:41:11.026" style="s2">and new safety gear</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.056" end="00:41:12.216" style="s2">has already been set aside.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.346" end="00:41:13.046" style="s2">You can buy the boat,</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.326" end="00:41:13.816" style="s2">but don&#39;t blow</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.876" end="00:41:14.876" style="s2">all your savings on it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.036" end="00:41:16.096" style="s2">Keep enough cash on hand.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.246" end="00:41:17.306" style="s2">Buying it is to make more money.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.386" end="00:41:17.996" style="s2">I can&#39;t just buy it</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.026" end="00:41:19.036" style="s2">and have no gas money left.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.036" end="00:41:19.876" style="s2">The boat&#39;s a bit old,</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.956" end="00:41:21.226" style="s2">but the engine was just serviced.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.456" end="00:41:22.456" style="s2">48,000 dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.636" end="00:41:23.786" style="s2">The life jackets, anchor,</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.926" end="00:41:25.436" style="s2">and two rolls of nets are included.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.436" end="00:41:26.446" style="s2">The bearings have a slight rattle.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.516" end="00:41:27.746" style="s2">And the tail shaft seals need replacing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.796" end="00:41:28.676" style="s2">45,000 dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.746" end="00:41:29.446" style="s2">Throw in the spare ropes</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.476" end="00:41:30.136" style="s2">and the hand winch.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.136" end="00:41:31.236" style="s2">You know how to fix boats?</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.236" end="00:41:32.576" style="s2">I was a dive boat hand for years.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.726" end="00:41:34.056" style="s2">I know exactly where the hull was patched</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.126" end="00:41:35.026" style="s2">and where the engine struggles.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.126" end="00:41:35.776" style="s2">You can&#39;t fool me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.176" end="00:41:38.176" style="s2">45,000 dollars, it&#39;s a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.506" end="00:41:38.956" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.156" end="00:41:40.516" style="s2">No one gave you charity this time,</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.576" end="00:41:42.036" style="s2">and no one can swap the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.086" end="00:41:43.986" style="s2">You earned this boat, trip by trip,</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.096" end="00:41:44.986" style="s2">out there in the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.066" end="00:41:46.646" style="s2">Hold onto these keys tight.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.646" end="00:41:47.006" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.516" end="00:41:48.296" style="s2">The boat is ours now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.646" end="00:41:49.926" style="s2">From now on, our family&#39;s life</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.986" end="00:41:50.836" style="s2">we steer it ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.606" end="00:41:53.426" style="s2">It&#39;s a good boat.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.626" end="00:41:54.696" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell everyone back home</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.726" end="00:41:55.316" style="s2">that my son</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.336" end="00:41:56.336" style="s2">earned this all by himself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.143" end="00:42:03.353" style="s2">Morgan really brought his own boat</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.443" end="00:42:04.103" style="s2">all the way back.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.103" end="00:42:05.603" style="s2">Just the other day he was kicked off a boat,</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.673" end="00:42:06.973" style="s2">and now he&#39;s a captain himself!</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.403" end="00:42:08.323" style="s2">Next time you go out to sea,</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.503" end="00:42:09.763" style="s2">at least you won&#39;t have to squeeze onto a raft</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.793" end="00:42:10.843" style="s2">or borrow someone else&#39;s boat.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.843" end="00:42:11.103" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.223" end="00:42:12.033" style="s2">I&#39;m not throwing the raft away.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.103" end="00:42:13.163" style="s2">The boat&#39;s for cargo and braving the waves,</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.303" end="00:42:14.403" style="s2">but for shallow reefs and underwater caves,</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.503" end="00:42:15.373" style="s2">I still need them to take me in.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.373" end="00:42:16.253" style="s2">I knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.703" end="00:42:18.673" style="s2">Morgan still needs me even with a new boat.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.743" end="00:42:20.403" style="s2">He can&#39;t do without me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.643" end="00:42:22.123" style="s2">Any knots on this boat,</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.363" end="00:42:24.203" style="s2">I can tie them all perfectly.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.923" end="00:42:26.693" style="s2">The new boat just docked,</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.193" end="00:42:28.573" style="s2">and you guys have already</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.713" end="00:42:30.173" style="s2">claimed your spots.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.433" end="00:42:32.523" style="s2">Kicked off a boat, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.363" end="00:42:35.033" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll ride the waves back ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.563" end="00:42:37.443" style="s2">The name suits my son perfectly.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.273" end="00:42:47.663" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t look like it&#39;s chasing us.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.853" end="00:42:49.213" style="s2">It looks like it wants us to follow it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.503" end="00:42:50.163" style="s2">Let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.573" end="00:42:56.333" style="s2">It&#39;s looking for someone to save its baby.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.493" end="00:42:57.873" style="s2">Finn, hold up the wooden crate.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.003" end="00:42:59.223" style="s2">Dexter, untie the rope.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.833" end="00:43:09.333" style="s2">Dolphin requested help.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.433" end="00:43:10.273" style="s2">Rescue completed.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.353" end="00:43:11.943" style="s2">Target acknowledged Bonded Keeper.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.173" end="00:43:12.913" style="s2">Adult Dolphin.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.053" end="00:43:14.803" style="s2">Skilled at fish school reconnaissance,</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.943" end="00:43:16.113" style="s2">long-distance communication,</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.203" end="00:43:17.093" style="s2">and reef warning.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.193" end="00:43:18.533" style="s2">Initiate BeastBond Protocol?</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.533" end="00:43:19.993" style="s2">Another Sea Beast Companion.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.413" end="00:43:20.983" style="s2">Initiate.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.943" end="00:43:25.963" style="s2">You can really understand me?</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.053" end="00:43:27.243" style="s2">Thank you for saving my little one.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.243" end="00:43:27.903" style="s2">Just so we&#39;re clear,</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.983" end="00:43:28.863" style="s2">the first one Morgan met</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.933" end="00:43:29.303" style="s2">was me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.433" end="00:43:30.743" style="s2">You&#39;re in line behind me from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.743" end="00:43:31.973" style="s2">But I swim faster than you!</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.973" end="00:43:32.693" style="s2">Nonsense!</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.763" end="00:43:33.253" style="s2">I just wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.283" end="00:43:34.413" style="s2">even trying earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.473" end="00:43:38.043" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.073" end="00:43:39.503" style="s2">Lots of fast fish up ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.503" end="00:43:41.193" style="s2">They&#39;re chasing small fish north!</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.193" end="00:43:42.443" style="s2">The water&#39;s churning!</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.823" end="00:43:44.963" style="s2">The new boat&#39;s just arrived,</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.143" end="00:43:46.403" style="s2">and the first big catch is here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.743" end="00:43:47.303" style="s2">Wavecrest!</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.463" end="00:43:48.903" style="s2">Time for our first full haul.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.783" end="00:43:50.213" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.563" end="00:43:52.153" style="s2">Tons of long, big fish ahead!</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.233" end="00:43:53.283" style="s2">They&#39;re chasing the little fish!</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.473" end="00:43:54.643" style="s2">The water&#39;s churning white!</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.713" end="00:43:55.483" style="s2">Mackerel run.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.883" end="00:43:57.413" style="s2">Must be thousands of pounds of fish here.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.073" end="00:44:01.083" style="s2">The crushed ice in the hold</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.143" end="00:44:02.503" style="s2">is only enough for a thousand pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.633" end="00:44:03.353" style="s2">If we cast the net,</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.433" end="00:44:04.243" style="s2">we can&#39;t be too greedy.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.243" end="00:44:04.923" style="s2">Hold off on the net.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.323" end="00:44:06.113" style="s2">They&#39;re moving fast.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.243" end="00:44:07.093" style="s2">We don&#39;t know their path yet.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.213" end="00:44:07.883" style="s2">If we cast it now,</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.003" end="00:44:08.743" style="s2">we&#39;ll come up empty.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.673" end="00:44:11.703" style="s2">The surface and bottom currents</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.903" end="00:44:12.813" style="s2">flow in opposite directions.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.913" end="00:44:13.903" style="s2">Echo Cove must be up ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.983" end="00:44:15.103" style="s2">The mackerel are chasing the sardines.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.183" end="00:44:16.153" style="s2">They&#39;ll be drawn in eventually.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.073" end="00:44:20.423" style="s2">The water below is getting colder.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.553" end="00:44:22.003" style="s2">The fish are crowding the left trench.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.003" end="00:44:23.383" style="s2">The left trench leads to Gourd Pass.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.493" end="00:44:24.723" style="s2">The exit is flanked by reefs.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.853" end="00:44:25.943" style="s2">The school will enter Gourd Pass.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.053" end="00:44:27.413" style="s2">It&#39;s wide outside and narrow inside.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.463" end="00:44:28.563" style="s2">Once we follow them to Echo Cove,</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.653" end="00:44:29.523" style="s2">we&#39;ll have a chance to trap them.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.623" end="00:44:30.273" style="s2">The birds are keeping to</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.303" end="00:44:31.133" style="s2">the left of the lead fish.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.253" end="00:44:32.393" style="s2">So the water on the right is colder.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.503" end="00:44:32.893" style="s2">Mackerel won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.923" end="00:44:33.583" style="s2">dive into cold water.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.653" end="00:44:34.053" style="s2">Gourd Pass is</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.083" end="00:44:34.743" style="s2">their only way through!</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.703" end="00:44:38.503" style="s2">The net is fine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.613" end="00:44:39.903" style="s2">If the fish start dragging us,</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.063" end="00:44:40.673" style="s2">we at least have</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.713" end="00:44:41.883" style="s2">a knife to cut it loose.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.733" end="00:44:44.583" style="s2">Let&#39;s track them first.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.903" end="00:44:46.253" style="s2">Then find the safest spot to cast.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.083" end="00:44:48.383" style="s2">Boat, fish, and crew—</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.803" end="00:44:49.643" style="s2">I&#39;m bringing them all back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.443" end="00:44:51.593" style="s2">We have two seine nets,</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.723" end="00:44:52.753" style="s2">twelve boxes of ice,</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.873" end="00:44:53.623" style="s2">and backup fuel.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.983" end="00:44:54.583" style="s2">Is that enough?</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.803" end="00:44:55.723" style="s2">Enough for a portion.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.923" end="00:44:56.753" style="s2">We&#39;re not heading back yet.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.843" end="00:44:57.643" style="s2">Let&#39;s follow the fish.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.663" end="00:45:02.733" style="s2">The right side is packed!</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.873" end="00:45:04.073" style="s2">The bow can&#39;t push through!</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.293" end="00:45:05.263" style="s2">Keep the Wavecrest steady!</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.483" end="00:45:05.953" style="s2">I&#39;ll ride Finn</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.983" end="00:45:06.943" style="s2">and scout the path ahead!</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.933" end="00:45:10.353" style="s2">Finn!</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.743" end="00:45:11.533" style="s2">After the lead fish!</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.793" end="00:45:12.613" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if Gourd Pass</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.663" end="00:45:13.703" style="s2">is wide enough for the boat!</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.303" end="00:45:16.553" style="s2">Hold on tight, Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.793" end="00:45:17.603" style="s2">These silver punks</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.693" end="00:45:18.773" style="s2">can&#39;t shake Finn off!</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.927" end="00:45:26.827" style="s2">Go around the left.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.077" end="00:45:28.317" style="s2">The Wavecrest&#39;s draft is too deep.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.407" end="00:45:29.387" style="s2">She can&#39;t make it through here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.077" end="00:45:37.877" style="s2">The exit&#39;s actually on the right.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.807" end="00:45:40.707" style="s2">Master, she took the long way around.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.747" end="00:45:42.137" style="s2">Echo Cove is just ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.437" end="00:45:43.497" style="s2">Let&#39;s follow the fish in first.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.827" end="00:45:44.937" style="s2">We&#39;ll meet up with her at the exit.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.257" end="00:45:48.267" style="s2">Don&#39;t charge into the school.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.547" end="00:45:49.337" style="s2">Stick to the outside.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.897" end="00:45:50.627" style="s2">Once we find where</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.647" end="00:45:51.397" style="s2">they make their turn,</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.967" end="00:45:53.077" style="s2">we can seal them off from behind.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.477" end="00:45:58.167" style="s2">They&#39;re all big catches over five pounds!</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.547" end="00:45:59.627" style="s2">If we just net a portion of them,</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.827" end="00:46:01.207" style="s2">the Wavecrest will fill her hold!</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.977" end="00:46:10.887" style="s2">What are you staring at?</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.977" end="00:46:12.137" style="s2">The fish are getting away!</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.247" end="00:46:12.957" style="s2">Just watching you</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.997" end="00:46:13.917" style="s2">bring the boat in alone.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.037" end="00:46:14.737" style="s2">It&#39;s impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.937" end="00:46:16.207" style="s2">Done flattering? Let&#39;s work.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.317" end="00:46:17.347" style="s2">Where do we drop the net?</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.177" end="00:46:20.427" style="s2">The exit&#39;s on the left.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.827" end="00:46:21.817" style="s2">Let the front pass first.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.987" end="00:46:23.297" style="s2">When the big ones enter the cove,</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.457" end="00:46:24.407" style="s2">we seal them from behind.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.477" end="00:46:29.537" style="s2">You drop the net later.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.707" end="00:46:30.717" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow the school.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.337" end="00:46:32.727" style="s2">If the tilt hits the limit,</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.907" end="00:46:34.007" style="s2">I&#39;ll ease up the throttle.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.277" end="00:46:34.617" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.177" end="00:46:36.137" style="s2">Follow my angles,</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.237" end="00:46:37.317" style="s2">and I&#39;ll trust your driving.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.117" end="00:46:40.857" style="s2">If we don&#39;t move,</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.997" end="00:46:42.137" style="s2">they&#39;re gonna escape!</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.387" end="00:46:42.907" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.527" end="00:46:44.617" style="s2">I don&#39;t want a few strays.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.937" end="00:46:45.697" style="s2">I want the biggest school</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.737" end="00:46:46.337" style="s2">right behind them.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.174" end="00:46:50.664" style="s2">Now!</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.484" end="00:46:52.864" style="s2">Ms. Dalton, hard right!</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.004" end="00:46:54.444" style="s2">Dexter, drop the net!</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.254" end="00:47:09.674" style="s2">Think you can escape me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.904" end="00:47:11.104" style="s2">Get back in there!</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.824" end="00:47:12.824" style="s2">They&#39;re going under the net!</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.024" end="00:47:14.774" style="s2">Shelly, guard the deepest trench!</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.974" end="00:47:27.244" style="s2">I can&#39;t hold the left side!</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.374" end="00:47:28.084" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it!</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.174" end="00:47:29.164" style="s2">Let them drag the boat!</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.254" end="00:47:30.374" style="s2">Let&#39;s tire them out first!</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.694" end="00:47:38.734" style="s2">The bow is coming around!</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.764" end="00:47:40.044" style="s2">The left floats are still sinking!</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.064" end="00:47:40.954" style="s2">Keep this angle!</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.394" end="00:47:42.084" style="s2">The more they struggle,</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.184" end="00:47:43.064" style="s2">the faster they tire out!</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.984" end="00:47:46.514" style="s2">Get behind me!</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.774" end="00:47:47.474" style="s2">Stay out of the loop!</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.474" end="00:47:48.194" style="s2">Let me go first.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.284" end="00:47:49.144" style="s2">I still have to steer!</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.594" end="00:47:54.534" style="s2">They&#39;re losing steam!</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.754" end="00:47:56.374" style="s2">One more circle and we haul the net!</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.574" end="00:48:05.374" style="s2">The net is torn!</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.434" end="00:48:06.534" style="s2">The fish are rushing out!</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.808" end="00:48:09.158" style="s2">Dare hit my boss&#39;s net?</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.428" end="00:48:11.078" style="s2">Finn will headbutt it right back!</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.138" end="00:48:11.778" style="s2">Don&#39;t do it!</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.968" end="00:48:13.008" style="s2">It&#39;s stuck on the outside!</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.128" end="00:48:13.778" style="s2">One hit from you,</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.908" end="00:48:15.068" style="s2">and the whole net is ruined!</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.978" end="00:48:21.208" style="s2">Ms. Dalton, steady the boat!</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.378" end="00:48:22.358" style="s2">Finn and I are heading over.</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.518" end="00:48:24.298" style="s2">Dexter, untie the rope around its mouth!</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.008" end="00:48:34.968" style="s2">If we don&#39;t patch the tear,</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.128" end="00:48:35.648" style="s2">pulling the winch</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.668" end="00:48:36.858" style="s2">will rip it apart completely!</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.608" end="00:48:41.708" style="s2">Just focus on patching!</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.298" end="00:48:43.638" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you fall!</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.578" end="00:48:51.638" style="s2">Haul the fish in!</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.978" end="00:48:56.168" style="s2">They&#39;re all over five pounds!</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.298" end="00:48:56.968" style="s2">Giant Mackerel!</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.128" end="00:48:58.038" style="s2">Not a scratch on them!</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.178" end="00:49:00.098" style="s2">This catch is worth at least $20,000!</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.678" end="00:49:07.478" style="s2">This one has to be twelve or thirteen pounds!</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.478" end="00:49:09.108" style="s2">Save it for City Grill to price separately.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.608" end="00:49:10.418" style="s2">This one net of yours</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.768" end="00:49:12.318" style="s2">is worth half a boatload for anyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.678" end="00:49:17.508" style="s2">That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.658" end="00:49:18.478" style="s2">If we load any more,</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.618" end="00:49:19.758" style="s2">Wavecrest won&#39;t make it home.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.908" end="00:49:20.588" style="s2">Open the net wings</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.698" end="00:49:21.758" style="s2">and let the rest go!</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.738" end="00:49:28.358" style="s2">Good job, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.558" end="00:49:29.278" style="s2">Once we get back to shore,</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.388" end="00:49:30.248" style="s2">we&#39;re all having a feast!</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.278" end="00:49:37.658" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.768" end="00:49:39.118" style="s2">The water ahead is churning up!</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.138" end="00:49:40.058" style="s2">Behind the rocks on the right,</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.158" end="00:49:40.948" style="s2">there are no big waves!</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.078" end="00:49:42.338" style="s2">We&#39;ll head back around Leeward Reef.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.338" end="00:49:43.098" style="s2">When the hold is full,</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.278" end="00:49:44.078" style="s2">safety is more important</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.098" end="00:49:44.858" style="s2">than saving half an hour.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.008" end="00:49:50.078" style="s2">Your hands are blistered again.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.078" end="00:49:50.988" style="s2">It&#39;s just a scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.178" end="00:49:52.648" style="s2">Let&#39;s get the fish back fresh first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.648" end="00:49:53.408" style="s2">Give me your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.868" end="00:49:55.838" style="s2">You still need to steer, don&#39;t be stubborn.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.778" end="00:49:59.438" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you cold?</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.578" end="00:50:00.678" style="s2">I&#39;m sweating from working.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.788" end="00:50:01.588" style="s2">If you catch a cold,</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.778" end="00:50:02.858" style="s2">who&#39;s going to sell my fish?</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.938" end="00:50:04.478" style="s2">I knew you weren&#39;t just being nice.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.538" end="00:50:10.268" style="s2">Such a full hold,</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.358" end="00:50:11.278" style="s2">and the fish aren&#39;t even crushed!</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.278" end="00:50:12.368" style="s2">Morgan didn&#39;t just catch a lot,</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.538" end="00:50:13.638" style="s2">he kept them perfectly fresh!</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.638" end="00:50:15.078" style="s2">Total weight is 1,108 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.128" end="00:50:16.138" style="s2">That comes out to twenty-seven thousand,</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.228" end="00:50:17.078" style="s2">six hundred and eighty dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.078" end="00:50:17.938" style="s2">You stole Morgan&#39;s boat,</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.988" end="00:50:18.768" style="s2">but what good did it do?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.848" end="00:50:19.698" style="s2">He just rides a crocodile</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.728" end="00:50:20.458" style="s2">and still finds fish!</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.658" end="00:50:21.398" style="s2">He makes more in one trip</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.428" end="00:50:22.278" style="s2">than we do in a whole month!</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.278" end="00:50:22.728" style="s2">Shut up!</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.898" end="00:50:23.798" style="s2">He just got lucky and hit</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.828" end="00:50:24.398" style="s2">one fish run!</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.568" end="00:50:25.198" style="s2">You think he&#39;s gonna have</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.238" end="00:50:26.458" style="s2">that kind of dumb luck every day?</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.668" end="00:50:27.498" style="s2">Three repairs,</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.588" end="00:50:28.618" style="s2">plus engine parts,</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.788" end="00:50:30.078" style="s2">that&#39;s 38,000 dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.428" end="00:50:31.398" style="s2">If you don&#39;t pay up today,</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.738" end="00:50:32.938" style="s2">Sea Breeze isn&#39;t leaving port.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.578" end="00:50:34.758" style="s2">That&#39;s our boy.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.908" end="00:50:36.498" style="s2">Others just blindly chase fish.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.618" end="00:50:37.388" style="s2">Morgan tracked them</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.458" end="00:50:38.388" style="s2">straight to Echo Cove,</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.458" end="00:50:40.108" style="s2">and brought back a full hold.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.108" end="00:50:40.528" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.768" end="00:50:41.778" style="s2">Let&#39;s ship the fish first.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.958" end="00:50:42.758" style="s2">Tonight, we&#39;re having</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.798" end="00:50:43.878" style="s2">a feast on the Wavecrest.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.572" end="00:50:50.322" style="s2">You were out at sea</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.362" end="00:50:51.282" style="s2">working hard all day.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.402" end="00:50:52.442" style="s2">Fill your stomach first.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.922" end="00:50:54.002" style="s2">The money&#39;s been made,</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.602" end="00:50:55.772" style="s2">now build your strength back.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.772" end="00:50:56.952" style="s2">Mom, I&#39;m perfectly healthy.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.012" end="00:50:58.162" style="s2">From now on, whenever Wavecrest</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.192" end="00:50:58.942" style="s2">comes back with a full haul,</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.032" end="00:50:59.942" style="s2">let&#39;s have a meal on the boat.</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.942" end="00:51:01.362" style="s2">I don&#39;t expect a full haul every day.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.592" end="00:51:02.342" style="s2">I just hope every time</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.372" end="00:51:03.472" style="s2">you return to shore safely.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.172" end="00:51:07.942" style="s2">Hey, Eight-Legs!</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.052" end="00:51:09.012" style="s2">Morgan said one bowl each.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.012" end="00:51:09.812" style="s2">You&#39;re sticking your tentacles</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.892" end="00:51:10.472" style="s2">into my food again!</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.472" end="00:51:11.902" style="s2">Your bowl is bigger than mine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.152" end="00:51:13.322" style="s2">I&#39;m just helping you out.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.372" end="00:51:26.152" style="s2">The city night market is short on fresh squid.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.272" end="00:51:27.402" style="s2">The frozen stuff tastes bad.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.532" end="00:51:28.132" style="s2">If you can deliver</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.242" end="00:51:29.302" style="s2">six hundred pounds of fresh catch,</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.412" end="00:51:30.942" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay twenty percent above market price.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.942" end="00:51:31.872" style="s2">Thirty percent deposit upfront.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.872" end="00:51:32.812" style="s2">If the sea conditions are bad,</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.862" end="00:51:33.562" style="s2">the order gets delayed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.632" end="00:51:34.612" style="s2">We&#39;re not risking lives for this.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.612" end="00:51:34.872" style="s2">Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.872" end="00:51:36.132" style="s2">As long as the quality is good,</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.262" end="00:51:36.822" style="s2">I can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.632" end="00:51:38.102" style="s2">Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.502" end="00:51:39.372" style="s2">Pulling makes it tighter.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.692" end="00:51:42.962" style="s2">You&#39;re so quick catching fish.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.352" end="00:51:44.512" style="s2">Why so slow with my hair?</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.562" end="00:51:45.682" style="s2">Scraped fish can still sell.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.932" end="00:51:46.752" style="s2">But if I rip your hair out,</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.972" end="00:51:47.642" style="s2">I can&#39;t afford it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.272" end="00:51:50.052" style="s2">Take these too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.492" end="00:51:51.492" style="s2">The deck gets soaked at night.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.622" end="00:51:52.542" style="s2">You need non-slip soles.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.112" end="00:51:54.242" style="s2">You bought these just for me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.742" end="00:51:55.902" style="s2">If you slip on the boat,</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.482" end="00:51:57.572" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to carry you back.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.362" end="00:51:58.732" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.962" end="00:51:59.402" style="s2">Then I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.442" end="00:52:00.312" style="s2">cause you any trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.772" end="00:52:03.462" style="s2">Equipment and fuel,</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.572" end="00:52:04.342" style="s2">plus labor costs</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.462" end="00:52:04.982" style="s2">we need at least</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.132" end="00:52:06.472" style="s2">four hundred pounds just to break even.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.472" end="00:52:07.192" style="s2">You handle the math.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.262" end="00:52:07.892" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle the fish.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.012" end="00:52:09.802" style="s2">First night trip, doesn&#39;t need to be full.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.952" end="00:52:11.422" style="s2">Just figure out the lights and fish depths.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.432" end="00:52:12.692" style="s2">Let&#39;s catch tonight&#39;s quota first.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.752" end="00:52:13.882" style="s2">The old debts aren&#39;t going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.912" end="00:52:14.232" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.442" end="00:52:16.172" style="s2">Tonight, Wavecrest&#39;s lights</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.312" end="00:52:17.362" style="s2">will light up the whole sea.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.546" end="00:52:20.976" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.046" end="00:52:21.596" style="s2">There are a lot of</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.676" end="00:52:23.376" style="s2">squishy, water-squirting guys ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.496" end="00:52:24.806" style="s2">They&#39;re hiding under the small fish,</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.026" end="00:52:26.216" style="s2">just following the current.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.136" end="00:52:29.036" style="s2">The water temp is good,</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.386" end="00:52:30.536" style="s2">and there&#39;s an upwelling below.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.226" end="00:52:33.256" style="s2">Turn on two lights first.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.476" end="00:52:34.686" style="s2">Let&#39;s draw the small fish in slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.576" end="00:52:37.356" style="s2">The lights are too shallow.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.436" end="00:52:38.526" style="s2">They&#39;ll only attract small fish.</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.666" end="00:52:39.696" style="s2">Drop them two meters down.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.746" end="00:52:40.856" style="s2">Let the beam pierce the warm layer,</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.996" end="00:52:42.136" style="s2">so the squid follow the fish</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.156" end="00:52:42.736" style="s2">and chase them up.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.646" end="00:52:45.806" style="s2">Looking at this sea during the day,</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.906" end="00:52:46.646" style="s2">it&#39;s just ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.776" end="00:52:47.536" style="s2">When the lights go on,</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.656" end="00:52:48.016" style="s2">down below</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.056" end="00:52:49.246" style="s2">it&#39;s like hiding another world.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.246" end="00:52:50.706" style="s2">The good things in the sea are all like this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.386" end="00:52:52.296" style="s2">If you don&#39;t wait patiently,</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.866" end="00:52:53.806" style="s2">they&#39;ll never show up.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.276" end="00:52:58.156" style="s2">You gave me your clothes,</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.256" end="00:52:59.046" style="s2">what about yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.046" end="00:53:00.076" style="s2">I have to work back and forth,</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.156" end="00:53:00.706" style="s2">I won&#39;t be cold.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.166" end="00:53:02.056" style="s2">You&#39;re in charge of the lights.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.386" end="00:53:03.586" style="s2">Don&#39;t freeze and run away first.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.946" end="00:53:07.586" style="s2">Stay outside.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.046" end="00:53:08.916" style="s2">With one sweep of your tail,</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.116" end="00:53:10.436" style="s2">the small fish and squid will all run away.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.126" end="00:53:16.586" style="s2">No wonder</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.656" end="00:53:18.076" style="s2">people stay out here at night.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.646" end="00:53:19.566" style="s2">Just for this view,</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.756" end="00:53:20.796" style="s2">it&#39;s totally worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.256" end="00:53:21.956" style="s2">The real show</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.146" end="00:53:22.816" style="s2">is still down below.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.036" end="00:53:23.816" style="s2">Look at the edge of the light.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.086" end="00:53:25.046" style="s2">The colors are changing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.946" end="00:53:28.276" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.386" end="00:53:28.896" style="s2">Those guys below</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.966" end="00:53:29.616" style="s2">can change colors!</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.766" end="00:53:30.946" style="s2">They&#39;re heading for the light!</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.116" end="00:53:37.086" style="s2">The school isn&#39;t steady yet.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.216" end="00:53:38.036" style="s2">Fish the edge first.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.266" end="00:53:38.996" style="s2">Pull the line gently.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.266" end="00:53:40.046" style="s2">Don&#39;t play tug-of-war.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.376" end="00:53:44.406" style="s2">So close!</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.976" end="00:53:45.466" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.926" end="00:53:46.506" style="s2">It didn&#39;t get hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.796" end="00:53:47.506" style="s2">It&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.273" end="00:53:55.793" style="s2">Got it!</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.363" end="00:53:57.343" style="s2">At least two pounds!</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.973" end="00:53:58.783" style="s2">Perfectly intact.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.013" end="00:53:59.783" style="s2">Still changing color.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.143" end="00:54:01.643" style="s2">First catch is top-tier.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.783" end="00:54:04.383" style="s2">Fast learner.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.003" end="00:54:05.593" style="s2">A few more of these,</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.943" end="00:54:07.013" style="s2">and you&#39;ll be taking my job.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.333" end="00:54:08.613" style="s2">Then you can steer the boat.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.813" end="00:54:09.573" style="s2">I&#39;ll make the money.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.913" end="00:54:10.163" style="s2">Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.543" end="00:54:11.163" style="s2">Just don&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.193" end="00:54:11.873" style="s2">to give me my cut.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.803" end="00:54:21.023" style="s2">The boots you bought really help.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.293" end="00:54:21.613" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.843" end="00:54:22.983" style="s2">you won&#39;t need to carry me back.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.133" end="00:54:24.073" style="s2">Don&#39;t speak too soon.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.713" end="00:54:25.313" style="s2">The next haul</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.353" end="00:54:26.573" style="s2">is the real heavy lifting.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.073" end="00:54:29.543" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.193" end="00:54:31.733" style="s2">This squishy thing is hugging Finn!</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.123" end="00:54:32.453" style="s2">Do you think</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.483" end="00:54:33.753" style="s2">he wants me to be his boss?</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.283" end="00:54:35.493" style="s2">He just thinks you&#39;re a rock.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.783" end="00:54:37.183" style="s2">Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.633" end="00:54:38.713" style="s2">It&#39;s worth more intact.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.173" end="00:54:42.923" style="s2">Hooks are too slow.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.523" end="00:54:44.853" style="s2">Drop the net ten feet below the light.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.013" end="00:54:46.013" style="s2">Slowly dim the side lights.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.193" end="00:54:47.273" style="s2">Keep only the center beam on.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.603" end="00:54:53.383" style="s2">They&#39;re in the net.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.693" end="00:54:54.733" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you pulling it up?</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.743" end="00:54:56.303" style="s2">These are just the small ones on the edge.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.743" end="00:54:57.863" style="s2">The shadows below are much bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.313" end="00:54:59.473" style="s2">Wait for them all to float up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.833" end="00:55:03.523" style="s2">Right now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.083" end="00:55:04.563" style="s2">Pull it in!</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.913" end="00:55:08.213" style="s2">There&#39;s something else under the net!</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.743" end="00:55:16.523" style="s2">The boat is steady.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.763" end="00:55:17.943" style="s2">But the winch won&#39;t hold for long!</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.943" end="00:55:19.083" style="s2">We have to make it let go first.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.193" end="00:55:20.483" style="s2">We can&#39;t just force it with the new boat.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.943" end="00:55:21.513" style="s2">Don&#39;t yank it!</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.513" end="00:55:22.863" style="s2">It&#39;s sucked onto the bottom of the net.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.933" end="00:55:24.173" style="s2">Forcing it will tear the net apart!</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.343" end="00:55:29.413" style="s2">Ms. Dalton, steady the boat.</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.563" end="00:55:29.883" style="s2">I&#39;ll go down</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.893" end="00:55:30.773" style="s2">and lure it away from the net.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.773" end="00:55:31.543" style="s2">Do not untie the safety rope!</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.543" end="00:55:32.833" style="s2">If the waves change, I&#39;m pulling you right back!</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.863" end="00:55:33.303" style="s2">If the waves change,</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.393" end="00:55:34.113" style="s2">I&#39;m pulling you right back!</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.773" end="00:55:41.183" style="s2">Morgan, don&#39;t fight it head-on!</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.113" end="00:55:55.563" style="s2">This one is at least six pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.723" end="00:55:56.693" style="s2">A completely live catch!</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.823" end="00:55:57.963" style="s2">If we take this to the night market,</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.073" end="00:55:59.273" style="s2">it&#39;ll be the best advertisement!</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.843" end="00:56:02.253" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.333" end="00:56:04.513" style="s2">The big fish that eat the softies are here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.073" end="00:56:06.153" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight the Carp for it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.313" end="00:56:08.003" style="s2">Let them chase the small fish on the edge away.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.103" end="00:56:09.723" style="s2">The squid will sink back down under the boat.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.213" end="00:56:16.283" style="s2">You cross to the boat first.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.443" end="00:56:17.413" style="s2">I can stand steadily.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.513" end="00:56:18.273" style="s2">If you&#39;re really steady,</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.473" end="00:56:19.403" style="s2">don&#39;t hold me so tight.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.573" end="00:56:31.103" style="s2">Over six hundred pounds of fresh squid!</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.213" end="00:56:32.223" style="s2">The whole night wasn&#39;t wasted!</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.443" end="00:56:33.053" style="s2">When we get back,</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.173" end="00:56:34.313" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you all extra food!</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.243" end="00:56:36.373" style="s2">Firm meat, bright color.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.563" end="00:56:37.353" style="s2">Compared to frozen ones,</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.533" end="00:56:38.593" style="s2">the texture is totally different.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.683" end="00:56:39.493" style="s2">650 pounds.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.583" end="00:56:41.283" style="s2">That&#39;s 15,600 in total.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.113" end="00:56:47.703" style="s2">So crunchy!</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.793" end="00:56:48.963" style="s2">Two more skewers, please!</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.273" end="00:56:51.063" style="s2">We can keep supplying,</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.153" end="00:56:51.993" style="s2">but it depends on the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.103" end="00:56:53.043" style="s2">We can&#39;t just make up numbers</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.223" end="00:56:54.013" style="s2">and ruin the quality.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.013" end="00:56:55.233" style="s2">As long as it&#39;s this good,</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.433" end="00:56:56.383" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait an extra day.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.653" end="00:56:59.533" style="s2">We worked all night.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.663" end="00:57:00.573" style="s2">And this is my treat?</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.573" end="00:57:01.563" style="s2">The boss said this is</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.593" end="00:57:02.313" style="s2">our best catch.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.603" end="00:57:03.223" style="s2">Others have to pay,</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.493" end="00:57:04.243" style="s2">but we get it right here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.563" end="00:57:05.103" style="s2">What a steal.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.833" end="00:57:06.503" style="s2">Tastes pretty good.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.733" end="00:57:08.083" style="s2">Next time there&#39;s a Giant Squid,</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.203" end="00:57:09.233" style="s2">no diving in by yourself!</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.233" end="00:57:09.853" style="s2">That depends on</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.893" end="00:57:10.843" style="s2">whether you hold onto me</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.953" end="00:57:11.973" style="s2">and won&#39;t let go like tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.953" end="00:57:15.023" style="s2">Until the debt is paid,</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.083" end="00:57:16.453" style="s2">the SeaRunner isn&#39;t leaving port.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.523" end="00:57:17.733" style="s2">And it definitely can&#39;t be sold.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.343" end="00:57:19.573" style="s2">For $100,000,</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.773" end="00:57:20.753" style="s2">the SeaRunner is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.933" end="00:57:22.083" style="s2">We&#39;ll wipe the slate clean.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.143" end="00:57:23.903" style="s2">I originally put</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.933" end="00:57:25.573" style="s2">$120,000 into this boat.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.703" end="00:57:26.563" style="s2">You stole my money,</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.783" end="00:57:27.783" style="s2">and now you want to take my boat</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.803" end="00:57:28.613" style="s2">and sell it back to me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.623" end="00:57:30.033" style="s2">Only my name is on the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.173" end="00:57:30.903" style="s2">You say you paid,</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.103" end="00:57:31.923" style="s2">but where&#39;s the proof?</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.943" end="00:57:33.533" style="s2">The receipt says the SeaRunner&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.723" end="00:57:34.943" style="s2">purchase and share payment.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.043" end="00:57:36.623" style="s2">And your signature is right on it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.723" end="00:57:37.683" style="s2">When you took the money,</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.823" end="00:57:39.273" style="s2">you didn&#39;t say it was a loss.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.833" end="00:57:40.823" style="s2">These documents prove</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.893" end="00:57:42.003" style="s2">Morgan&#39;s actual investment.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.423" end="00:57:43.583" style="s2">Until this matter is settled,</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.823" end="00:57:44.883" style="s2">the SeaRunner cannot be sold.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.813" end="00:57:48.523" style="s2">Either give me my $120,000,</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.693" end="00:57:49.653" style="s2">or give me the SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.743" end="00:57:50.423" style="s2">and make up the difference.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.603" end="00:57:51.273" style="s2">It&#39;s your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.273" end="00:57:52.243" style="s2">What the boat is worth,</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.333" end="00:57:53.883" style="s2">we&#39;ll know once we inspect it in the dock.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.073" end="00:57:56.103" style="s2">My $38,000 repair fee</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.203" end="00:57:57.113" style="s2">must be settled too.</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.643" end="00:58:07.833" style="s2">Needs two new hull plates.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.913" end="00:58:08.773" style="s2">Tail shaft bearings and</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.833" end="00:58:10.023" style="s2">fuel lines need an overhaul.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.193" end="00:58:11.143" style="s2">Minus repair costs,</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.903" end="00:58:12.453" style="s2">the SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.573" end="00:58:14.173" style="s2">is only worth 98,000 bucks now.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.273" end="00:58:16.853" style="s2">It cost over 200,000 to buy!</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.183" end="00:58:18.673" style="s2">How can it be worth only 98,000?!</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.543" end="00:58:23.153" style="s2">You only patched it up after hitting the reef,</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.183" end="00:58:24.243" style="s2">refused to replace the plates,</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.353" end="00:58:25.803" style="s2">and ran the engine sick for six months.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.913" end="00:58:27.163" style="s2">You still owe me 38,000.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.203" end="00:58:28.533" style="s2">That 98,000 already assumes</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.583" end="00:58:29.643" style="s2">the cost to get it fixed.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.643" end="00:58:30.283" style="s2">Giles Barrett</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.393" end="00:58:32.083" style="s2">can refund the 120,000 dollars</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.193" end="00:58:32.983" style="s2">and keep the SeaRunner.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.093" end="00:58:33.583" style="s2">Or the SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.653" end="00:58:35.243" style="s2">goes to Morgan for 98,000 dollars,</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.323" end="00:58:36.453" style="s2">plus 22,000 dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.573" end="00:58:37.283" style="s2">The repair debt</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.333" end="00:58:38.553" style="s2">is Giles Barrett&#39;s to pay.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.553" end="00:58:39.743" style="s2">You already have the Wavecrest.</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.063" end="00:58:40.673" style="s2">Why are you eyeing</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.713" end="00:58:41.613" style="s2">this piece of junk?</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.373" end="00:58:44.203" style="s2">It&#39;s a piece of junk</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.383" end="00:58:45.603" style="s2">because of your handiwork, isn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.813" end="00:58:46.983" style="s2">I paid 120,000 dollars</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.113" end="00:58:47.803" style="s2">for this asset.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.913" end="00:58:48.993" style="s2">You took it and wrecked it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.113" end="00:58:50.353" style="s2">Now it belongs back with me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.973" end="00:58:51.653" style="s2">This boat</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.833" end="00:58:52.943" style="s2">made you money too!</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.343" end="00:58:54.493" style="s2">After you kicked me off,</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.863" end="00:58:56.053" style="s2">I didn&#39;t get $0.01!</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.643" end="00:58:57.653" style="s2">Who pocketed the cash?</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.763" end="00:58:58.533" style="s2">You know damn well!</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.603" end="00:58:59.553" style="s2">Why are you just staring?</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.213" end="00:59:01.043" style="s2">Say something for me!</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.433" end="00:59:01.763" style="s2">Fine!</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.193" end="00:59:03.183" style="s2">You owe us two months&#39; pay!</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.333" end="00:59:03.743" style="s2">And you made us</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.793" end="00:59:04.543" style="s2">sail a leaky boat!</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.623" end="00:59:05.453" style="s2">Whoever owns it now,</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.653" end="00:59:06.413" style="s2">we&#39;re done with you!</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.443" end="00:59:09.663" style="s2">Morgan trusted you,</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.833" end="00:59:11.943" style="s2">that&#39;s why he gave you 120,000 dollars!</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.173" end="00:59:13.253" style="s2">Not only did you swallow the money,</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.473" end="00:59:14.073" style="s2">you almost left him</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.113" end="00:59:15.393" style="s2">on Crab Isle to feed the crocs!</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.633" end="00:59:16.713" style="s2">We aren&#39;t forcing you today.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.243" end="00:59:18.563" style="s2">You drove yourself into a dead end!</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.173" end="00:59:22.003" style="s2">The 38,000 dollars for the repairs,</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.123" end="00:59:22.983" style="s2">not $0.01 less!</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.083" end="00:59:23.953" style="s2">Giving the boat to Morgan</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.183" end="00:59:25.473" style="s2">won&#39;t cover what you owe me!</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.473" end="00:59:26.563" style="s2">The SeaRunner goes to Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.703" end="00:59:27.923" style="s2">The remaining 22,000 dollars</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.983" end="00:59:28.853" style="s2">must be paid within a month.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.873" end="00:59:30.233" style="s2">The 38,000 dollars repair bill</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.313" end="00:59:31.873" style="s2">will be paid separately by Giles.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.873" end="00:59:33.633" style="s2">You swallowed my 120,000 dollars,</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.733" end="00:59:34.713" style="s2">and thought you&#39;d get a free boat?</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.883" end="00:59:35.723" style="s2">Now I get the boat back,</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.893" end="00:59:37.583" style="s2">and you owe 60,000 dollars on top of that.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.723" end="00:59:38.323" style="s2">Giles Barrett,</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.393" end="00:59:39.263" style="s2">that&#39;s what I call not getting</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.303" end="00:59:40.413" style="s2">a single $0.01 of a bargain.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.413" end="00:59:41.713" style="s2">It&#39;s just a rotten ship.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.833" end="00:59:42.473" style="s2">You take it back,</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.563" end="00:59:43.923" style="s2">you&#39;re just throwing money into it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.013" end="00:59:45.723" style="s2">Rotten hull plates can be replaced.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.963" end="00:59:46.723" style="s2">You treat the brothers</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.763" end="00:59:47.963" style="s2">you eat with like fools,</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.113" end="00:59:49.043" style="s2">and a life-saving boat</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.113" end="00:59:50.023" style="s2">like a disposable toy.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.063" end="00:59:50.973" style="s2">When a person is rotten,</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.473" end="00:59:52.283" style="s2">there&#39;s no fixing them.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.643" end="00:59:56.713" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.973" end="01:00:04.643" style="s2">It&#39;s rotting even worse on the inside.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.843" end="01:00:05.213" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.543" end="01:00:06.233" style="s2">This boat needs to be</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.253" end="01:00:07.043" style="s2">rebuilt from the bones up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.240" end="01:00:09.500" style="s2">Half an inch higher on the right.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.620" end="01:00:10.540" style="s2">The seam isn&#39;t tight enough.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.600" end="01:00:11.870" style="s2">It&#39;ll leak once it hits the waves.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.110" end="01:00:16.560" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.710" end="01:00:17.990" style="s2">Before, Giles</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.060" end="01:00:19.350" style="s2">only let us patch the surface.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.510" end="01:00:20.340" style="s2">You&#39;re willing to replace</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.390" end="01:00:21.130" style="s2">everything that needs it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.210" end="01:00:21.660" style="s2">From now on,</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.870" end="01:00:22.700" style="s2">we want to work for you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.110" end="01:00:23.810" style="s2">You can work for me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.240" end="01:00:25.110" style="s2">Wages paid monthly.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.440" end="01:00:26.300" style="s2">Safety comes first.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.480" end="01:00:27.410" style="s2">If anyone spots an issue,</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.580" end="01:00:28.250" style="s2">they can stop the boat.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.310" end="01:00:29.730" style="s2">We don&#39;t risk lives to save on repairs.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.310" end="01:00:31.680" style="s2">He just tried to borrow my boat.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.420" end="01:00:33.560" style="s2">He stole from his partners</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.720" end="01:00:34.730" style="s2">and owes his crew wages.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.860" end="01:00:35.710" style="s2">No way I&#39;m lending it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.790" end="01:00:36.580" style="s2">Give him a boat,</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.080" end="01:00:38.490" style="s2">and in a few days, even the name</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.510" end="01:00:39.170" style="s2">will belong to him.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.710" end="01:00:43.390" style="s2">Eat first.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.770" end="01:00:44.590" style="s2">The boat can wait.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.830" end="01:00:46.750" style="s2">You can&#39;t work all day on an empty stomach.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.750" end="01:00:47.010" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.160" end="01:00:47.730" style="s2">just the last row.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.800" end="01:00:48.710" style="s2">I&#39;ll eat after these nails.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.710" end="01:00:49.550" style="s2">Listen to your mom.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.850" end="01:00:50.630" style="s2">The work is never done,</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.720" end="01:00:51.710" style="s2">but you gotta eat on time.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.740" end="01:00:56.040" style="s2">Live well goes in the middle.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.240" end="01:00:57.280" style="s2">Insulated hold in the back.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.460" end="01:00:58.920" style="s2">Wavecrest will handle the fishing.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.070" end="01:01:00.600" style="s2">SeaRunner will bring ice and haul the catch.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.780" end="01:01:02.100" style="s2">This way, both boats won&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.140" end="01:01:03.410" style="s2">crowd into the dangerous reefs.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.410" end="01:01:04.610" style="s2">Let&#39;s also leave space at the bow</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.860" end="01:01:05.790" style="s2">for a repair station.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.890" end="01:01:06.660" style="s2">If a net breaks at sea,</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.750" end="01:01:07.630" style="s2">we can patch it right there.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.330" end="01:01:19.340" style="s2">The engine turns over,</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.690" end="01:01:20.690" style="s2">but we still need to test it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.340" end="01:01:22.640" style="s2">Tomorrow we&#39;ll add water ballast</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.690" end="01:01:23.520" style="s2">and run it for an hour.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.750" end="01:01:24.630" style="s2">The temp and oil pressure</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.660" end="01:01:25.900" style="s2">must be steady to be fully fixed.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.840" end="01:01:27.500" style="s2">Knows his stuff.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.850" end="01:01:28.460" style="s2">With old boats,</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.610" end="01:01:30.150" style="s2">you don&#39;t just rush out when it starts.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.430" end="01:01:31.090" style="s2">One more test</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.440" end="01:01:32.640" style="s2">saves trouble out there.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.340" end="01:01:34.590" style="s2">That&#39;s my boy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.810" end="01:01:35.830" style="s2">Others see a wrecked boat</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.870" end="01:01:37.010" style="s2">and only think of scrap.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.270" end="01:01:38.680" style="s2">You got her working again.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.950" end="01:01:47.290" style="s2">The shells</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.360" end="01:01:48.660" style="s2">all cracked in the exact same spot.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.720" end="01:01:49.350" style="s2">Not from the waves.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.710" end="01:01:50.390" style="s2">There&#39;s something ahead</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.420" end="01:01:51.460" style="s2">that knows how to use tools.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.334" end="01:02:01.884" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.194" end="01:02:02.634" style="s2">Does Pebble</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.724" end="01:02:04.114" style="s2">use rocks to smash food?</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.944" end="01:02:08.604" style="s2">Stop right there!</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.764" end="01:02:10.004" style="s2">How dare you steal Morgan&#39;s fish!</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.154" end="01:02:11.484" style="s2">Finn is gonna catch you today!</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.564" end="01:02:14.714" style="s2">You stole Morgan&#39;s fish,</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.244" end="01:02:16.374" style="s2">and dare to show off?</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.984" end="01:02:18.334" style="s2">Don&#39;t hide in those cracks!</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.844" end="01:02:19.624" style="s2">Come out and race Finn</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.664" end="01:02:20.814" style="s2">to see who&#39;s faster!</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.864" end="01:02:22.194" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it, back up.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.224" end="01:02:22.794" style="s2">You&#39;re too big.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.904" end="01:02:24.214" style="s2">You can&#39;t catch him in the seagrass.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.384" end="01:02:29.224" style="s2">Take it if you want.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.424" end="01:02:30.064" style="s2">I won&#39;t chase you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.254" end="01:02:37.374" style="s2">Trading abalone for fish</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.744" end="01:02:38.744" style="s2">You&#39;re quite the businessman.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.244" end="01:02:43.834" style="s2">He isn&#39;t just picking up random things.</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.064" end="01:02:46.174" style="s2">Abalone, sea urchins, and echo conchs</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.254" end="01:02:47.264" style="s2">He only picks the big ones.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.374" end="01:02:47.904" style="s2">There must be an</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.954" end="01:02:49.294" style="s2">untouched shell ground nearby.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.044" end="01:02:50.474" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.694" end="01:02:51.544" style="s2">Finn can find them too!</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.894" end="01:02:52.864" style="s2">He only picks up shells!</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.974" end="01:02:54.054" style="s2">He&#39;s got nothing on me!</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.544" end="01:03:04.134" style="s2">New waters.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.254" end="01:03:05.254" style="s2">Can&#39;t just chase blindly.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.564" end="01:03:06.684" style="s2">Mark the way back first.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.084" end="01:03:07.864" style="s2">Gotta know the route.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.914" end="01:03:13.314" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.474" end="01:03:14.224" style="s2">Let&#39;s see exactly where</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.274" end="01:03:15.114" style="s2">he&#39;s trying to take us.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.881" end="01:03:26.041" style="s2">That fuzzball tricked me!</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.021" end="01:03:30.511" style="s2">Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.121" end="01:03:31.651" style="s2">It took our</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.701" end="01:03:32.911" style="s2">net away!</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.431" end="01:03:35.071" style="s2">Don&#39;t chase.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.541" end="01:03:36.561" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t want the net.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.891" end="01:03:37.861" style="s2">He&#39;s just being cautious</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.931" end="01:03:38.661" style="s2">about us being here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.651" end="01:03:52.271" style="s2">Your stuff,</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.431" end="01:03:52.931" style="s2">I won&#39;t steal.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.341" end="01:03:54.261" style="s2">If we want seafood,</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.401" end="01:03:55.311" style="s2">we&#39;ll catch it ourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.831" end="01:04:00.181" style="s2">Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.691" end="01:04:01.461" style="s2">He didn&#39;t just grab it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.071" end="01:04:02.591" style="s2">He&#39;s testing us</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.621" end="01:04:03.741" style="s2">to see if we&#39;ll steal his stuff.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.951" end="01:04:05.081" style="s2">That&#39;s why we can&#39;t rush.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.391" end="01:04:06.361" style="s2">Finding this place</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.771" end="01:04:07.161" style="s2">means he</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.231" end="01:04:08.071" style="s2">lives around here.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.561" end="01:04:09.251" style="s2">If he leads the way,</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.661" end="01:04:10.941" style="s2">it&#39;s better than forcing it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.041" end="01:04:16.241" style="s2">These aren&#39;t scattered shells.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.681" end="01:04:17.211" style="s2">Down there must be</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.251" end="01:04:18.081" style="s2">an old shell ground.</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.341" end="01:04:27.701" style="s2">A crocodile finds him fish.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.711" end="01:04:29.651" style="s2">Now even a sea otter</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.691" end="01:04:30.631" style="s2">is finding him abalone!</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.001" end="01:04:32.101" style="s2">If I just follow this thing,</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.901" end="01:04:34.441" style="s2">I can find the shell grounds too.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.131" end="01:04:42.011" style="s2">A crocodile</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.271" end="01:04:43.361" style="s2">and an octopus aren&#39;t enough?</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.681" end="01:04:44.681" style="s2">Now there&#39;s a sea otter!</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.191" end="01:04:46.221" style="s2">Why do all the sea creatures</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.261" end="01:04:47.111" style="s2">revolve around him?</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.811" end="01:04:52.041" style="s2">We won&#39;t touch the shell grounds today.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.541" end="01:04:53.871" style="s2">Someone&#39;s already got their eyes on this place.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.071" end="01:04:54.971" style="s2">We need to get this little guy</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.991" end="01:04:56.111" style="s2">to truly trust us first.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.115" end="01:05:08.855" style="s2">Don&#39;t charge in!</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.095" end="01:05:10.215" style="s2">Boss will know what to do.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.395" end="01:05:11.385" style="s2">If you get swept away too,</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.545" end="01:05:12.945" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to drag both of you out.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.275" end="01:05:14.025" style="s2">Ah, so you lost your</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.045" end="01:05:14.515" style="s2">most precious thing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.515" end="01:05:14.945" style="s2">Shelly,</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.165" end="01:05:16.345" style="s2">stick to the right wall and dive.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.435" end="01:05:17.405" style="s2">Avoid the main backflow.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.855" end="01:05:22.805" style="s2">Let the current pass.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.015" end="01:05:23.915" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.765" end="01:05:27.965" style="s2">You learned to go with the flow,</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.145" end="01:05:29.485" style="s2">better than forcing the net last time.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.715" end="01:05:30.415" style="s2">I learned my lesson.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.675" end="01:05:31.365" style="s2">Can&#39;t let the same</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.415" end="01:05:32.715" style="s2">current teach me twice.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.905" end="01:05:34.285" style="s2">Here you go.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.465" end="01:05:36.345" style="s2">Keep a closer eye on it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.425" end="01:05:37.565" style="s2">Don&#39;t bring things near the rapids.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.445" end="01:05:51.515" style="s2">Bond with Mira?</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.725" end="01:05:52.705" style="s2">She&#39;s not hurt,</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.705" end="01:05:55.065" style="s2">but still accepted me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.765" end="01:05:56.445" style="s2">Bond.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.145" end="01:05:58.725" style="s2">Sea otter bonded successfully.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.915" end="01:05:59.635" style="s2">Shell detection,</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.745" end="01:06:01.495" style="s2">diving, and tool skills</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.655" end="01:06:02.435" style="s2">are enhanced.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.675" end="01:06:03.335" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.775" end="01:06:05.155" style="s2">You helped me get my shell,</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.375" end="01:06:07.375" style="s2">I&#39;ll show you the biggest hard shells.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.995" end="01:06:09.275" style="s2">Now we&#39;re even.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.975" end="01:06:10.765" style="s2">Why are you</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.855" end="01:06:11.955" style="s2">using Boss&#39;s name?</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.435" end="01:06:13.575" style="s2">Call him Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.375" end="01:06:15.275" style="s2">He&#39;s your Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.475" end="01:06:16.345" style="s2">not mine!</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.315" end="01:06:26.565" style="s2">Boss, harvest first.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.745" end="01:06:27.135" style="s2">I&#39;ll deal</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.175" end="01:06:27.655" style="s2">with Pebble</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.725" end="01:06:28.845" style="s2">for squirting me later.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.875" end="01:06:31.365" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.465" end="01:06:32.725" style="s2">These squirting hard shells,</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.795" end="01:06:34.175" style="s2">there&#39;s a whole bunch down below!</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.779" end="01:06:45.809" style="s2">It really is a King Clam!</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.989" end="01:06:46.839" style="s2">This siphon is huge!</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.939" end="01:06:47.299" style="s2">And the shell</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.329" end="01:06:48.419" style="s2">At least three or four pounds.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.609" end="01:06:55.379" style="s2">Over four pounds.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.499" end="01:06:56.289" style="s2">The siphon&#39;s intact.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.409" end="01:06:57.299" style="s2">For live catch like this,</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.489" end="01:06:58.029" style="s2">the City Grill</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.049" end="01:06:59.309" style="s2">would easily pay hundreds!</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.309" end="01:06:59.749" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.049" end="01:07:00.949" style="s2">I dug it out!</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.059" end="01:07:02.219" style="s2">That&#39;s worth two fish!</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.349" end="01:07:03.029" style="s2">Big ones!</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.029" end="01:07:04.099" style="s2">Put it down first.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.629" end="01:07:05.589" style="s2">Whatever the boss gives</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.649" end="01:07:06.469" style="s2">is up to the boss!</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.849" end="01:07:08.209" style="s2">You can&#39;t just hike up the price!</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.979" end="01:07:09.459" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.599" end="01:07:11.599" style="s2">The three holes on the left are empty.</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.739" end="01:07:12.769" style="s2">Under this right one,</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.889" end="01:07:13.949" style="s2">there&#39;s something else.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.079" end="01:07:15.129" style="s2">Hidden really deep.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.209" end="01:07:24.449" style="s2">How dare you ambush me!</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.449" end="01:07:25.849" style="s2">Boss, put this one at the bottom.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.929" end="01:07:26.949" style="s2">Don&#39;t let it squirt again!</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.349" end="01:07:28.179" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.459" end="01:07:40.399" style="s2">Don&#39;t spook the fish yet.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.689" end="01:07:41.639" style="s2">Dexter, block the back.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.759" end="01:07:42.759" style="s2">Finn, guard the outside.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.869" end="01:07:43.929" style="s2">I&#39;ll sink the net to the bottom.</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.019" end="01:07:49.359" style="s2">That&#39;s at least twenty pounds!</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.609" end="01:07:50.439" style="s2">The clams are huge,</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.559" end="01:07:51.869" style="s2">and the shrimp are top live catch!</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.539" end="01:07:53.359" style="s2">These Shell Grounds</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.469" end="01:07:54.079" style="s2">really paid off!</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.579" end="01:07:57.349" style="s2">Nicely done!</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.769" end="01:07:58.449" style="s2">One more net,</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.889" end="01:07:59.909" style="s2">and the raft will be full.</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.429" end="01:08:05.919" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.099" end="01:08:06.879" style="s2">Inside these shells</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.919" end="01:08:07.999" style="s2">are hard little stones.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.139" end="01:08:09.379" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen glowing ones.</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.399" end="01:08:10.399" style="s2">We&#39;ll take them back alive.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.649" end="01:08:11.679" style="s2">If there&#39;s good stuff inside,</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.899" end="01:08:12.709" style="s2">we&#39;ll see on shore.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.809" end="01:08:18.439" style="s2">Right here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.759" end="01:08:19.949" style="s2">If Morgan filled a few baskets,</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.069" end="01:08:21.349" style="s2">there&#39;s ten times more down there.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.349" end="01:08:22.169" style="s2">Mr. Ashton said</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.339" end="01:08:22.999" style="s2">you can borrow the boat,</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.179" end="01:08:24.649" style="s2">but it&#39;s a fifty-fifty split.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.789" end="01:08:26.059" style="s2">Any damage to the boat is on you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.059" end="01:08:26.499" style="s2">Relax.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.039" end="01:08:28.039" style="s2">I tailed him for two days.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.499" end="01:08:29.579" style="s2">The location is dead on.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.619" end="01:08:30.879" style="s2">That&#39;s Lowtide Shoal ahead!</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.079" end="01:08:32.079" style="s2">Your draft is too deep!</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.399" end="01:08:33.909" style="s2">Keep going and you&#39;ll get stuck!</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.039" end="01:08:36.599" style="s2">Don&#39;t try to scare me with that!</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.209" end="01:08:37.919" style="s2">If you can get in,</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.149" end="01:08:39.189" style="s2">why the hell can&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.359" end="01:08:40.589" style="s2">I&#39;m riding Finn.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.319" end="01:08:42.619" style="s2">You&#39;re driving someone else&#39;s boat.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.339" end="01:08:44.789" style="s2">Gambling with other people&#39;s property.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.279" end="01:08:46.609" style="s2">No wonder you never care.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.809" end="01:08:52.159" style="s2">Starboard side is gonna hit!</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.059" end="01:08:55.629" style="s2">This is your safe channel?</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.899" end="01:08:57.439" style="s2">Get down there and plug the leak!</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.419" end="01:09:10.479" style="s2">When you snagged the boat,</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.919" end="01:09:12.129" style="s2">you thought you were a captain.</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.289" end="01:09:13.129" style="s2">Followed me to the reef,</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.229" end="01:09:14.319" style="s2">thought you could find the catch.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.649" end="01:09:15.229" style="s2">Giles Barrett,</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.979" end="01:09:16.789" style="s2">your greatest skill</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.359" end="01:09:17.839" style="s2">is ruining</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.899" end="01:09:19.309" style="s2">everything that belongs to others.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.849" end="01:09:26.439" style="s2">Impossible!</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.729" end="01:09:27.479" style="s2">His catch</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.519" end="01:09:28.679" style="s2">he definitely got it from here!</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.679" end="01:09:30.189" style="s2">You couldn&#39;t even read the layout,</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.309" end="01:09:31.409" style="s2">and you dared to rush the reef?</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.499" end="01:09:33.189" style="s2">Repairs, towing, and lost wages</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.349" end="01:09:34.399" style="s2">it&#39;s all going on your tab!</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.109" end="01:09:36.989" style="s2">I already owe $38,000 on the boat,</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.139" end="01:09:38.709" style="s2">and I gotta pay Morgan $22,000!</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.819" end="01:09:39.899" style="s2">How am I supposed to pay you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.899" end="01:09:41.709" style="s2">No money? Then work for Mr. Ashton.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.949" end="01:09:42.339" style="s2">Sign!</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.289" end="01:09:46.829" style="s2">He didn&#39;t even need a boat to get a full load.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.269" end="01:09:48.549" style="s2">We followed him in a speedboat,</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.749" end="01:09:49.609" style="s2">didn&#39;t catch a single thing,</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.669" end="01:09:50.879" style="s2">and lost a propeller to boot.</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.679" end="01:09:57.479" style="s2">Just ignore him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.359" end="01:09:59.599" style="s2">This catch we worked so hard for,</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.839" end="01:10:01.279" style="s2">let&#39;s just focus on getting it back safe.</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.049" end="01:10:07.859" style="s2">Finn, hold the right side of the raft!</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.939" end="01:10:09.329" style="s2">Dexter, take the loose knot</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.449" end="01:10:10.779" style="s2">and rethread it through the beam!</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.249" end="01:10:13.909" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.039" end="01:10:15.059" style="s2">These water-squirting</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.099" end="01:10:16.239" style="s2">guys are too heavy!</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.469" end="01:10:18.209" style="s2">My fur is getting crushed!</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.749" end="01:10:19.359" style="s2">Right now!</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.749" end="01:10:20.999" style="s2">Finn, turn left!</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.249" end="01:10:22.909" style="s2">Use the backflow to push the bow out!</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.499" end="01:10:28.249" style="s2">The ropes held!</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.309" end="01:10:29.069" style="s2">Water&#39;s still flowing!</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.849" end="01:10:31.109" style="s2">We didn&#39;t lose a single one!</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.379" end="01:10:33.749" style="s2">Pebble,</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.989" end="01:10:34.759" style="s2">go guard your shells.</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.909" end="01:10:35.869" style="s2">Finn will hold it for Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.189" end="01:10:36.999" style="s2">The raft won&#39;t flip!</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.729" end="01:10:39.919" style="s2">This one&#39;s on my tab for now.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.439" end="01:10:42.029" style="s2">Wait till Morgan cooks it before eating.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.609" end="01:10:48.289" style="s2">I waited at the dock, but you never showed.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.339" end="01:10:49.379" style="s2">The wind picked up on the water,</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.519" end="01:10:50.529" style="s2">so I had to come out and get you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.619" end="01:10:51.759" style="s2">Are you and the cargo alright?</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.759" end="01:10:52.229" style="s2">All here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.549" end="01:10:53.429" style="s2">You came at a good time.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.519" end="01:10:55.329" style="s2">Let&#39;s hoist the live baskets onto the boat first.</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.579" end="01:11:04.539" style="s2">So this is the sea otter</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.579" end="01:11:05.399" style="s2">that&#39;s been following you?</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.549" end="01:11:06.679" style="s2">Keeping a close eye on things.</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.679" end="01:11:07.629" style="s2">He calls me Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.709" end="01:11:08.749" style="s2">He&#39;s friendly with everyone,</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.849" end="01:11:09.999" style="s2">but when it comes to his shells,</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.129" end="01:11:11.069" style="s2">no one&#39;s allowed to touch them.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.759" end="01:11:13.289" style="s2">Are you saying</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.559" end="01:11:14.459" style="s2">what&#39;s inside this shell</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.499" end="01:11:15.229" style="s2">is perfect for her?</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.969" end="01:11:19.339" style="s2">He says this shell is special.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.519" end="01:11:20.489" style="s2">When we get back and open it,</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.529" end="01:11:21.459" style="s2">if there&#39;s a real pearl,</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.559" end="01:11:22.439" style="s2">you&#39;ll be the first to see it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.609" end="01:11:28.549" style="s2">Hahaha.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.513" end="01:11:34.653" style="s2">Averaging 3.8 pounds.</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.723" end="01:11:35.753" style="s2">Largest is 6.2 pounds.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.903" end="01:11:36.583" style="s2">Siphons are intact.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.673" end="01:11:37.543" style="s2">Short time out of the water too.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.633" end="01:11:39.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll take them all as premium live catch!</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.083" end="01:11:40.803" style="s2">The king clams are $18,400.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.933" end="01:11:42.733" style="s2">Striped shrimp, $6,200.</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.833" end="01:11:43.863" style="s2">Echo conchs and tiger shells</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.013" end="01:11:45.163" style="s2">Are $4,900.</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.243" end="01:11:47.083" style="s2">That&#39;s a total of $29,500.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.293" end="01:11:49.073" style="s2">Sort the king clams into three boxes by size.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.173" end="01:11:50.643" style="s2">Pack the echo conchs separately with ice.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.733" end="01:11:51.703" style="s2">Don&#39;t crush the striped shrimp.</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.843" end="01:11:52.563" style="s2">Ship them out tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.663" end="01:11:53.943" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the freshness Morgan preserved</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.023" end="01:11:55.143" style="s2">At sea be ruined on shore!</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.383" end="01:11:58.723" style="s2">Same waters, same catch.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.893" end="01:12:00.503" style="s2">Why is his worth tens of thousands of dollars,</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.593" end="01:12:02.113" style="s2">and you won&#39;t give me the same price?</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.113" end="01:12:03.063" style="s2">The conch meat is pale.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.143" end="01:12:04.253" style="s2">The shrimp are completely dead.</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.353" end="01:12:05.583" style="s2">Even a feed mill would reject this.</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.713" end="01:12:07.173" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you 50 dollars, tops!</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.383" end="01:12:11.513" style="s2">You learned how to tail me,</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.633" end="01:12:12.953" style="s2">but not how to read the tides,</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.123" end="01:12:15.063" style="s2">keep the catch alive, or actually fish.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.293" end="01:12:15.903" style="s2">Giles.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.233" end="01:12:17.333" style="s2">The sea doesn&#39;t recognize you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.393" end="01:12:18.293" style="s2">Or that fake contract.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.573" end="01:12:19.463" style="s2">And it certainly won&#39;t pay you</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.533" end="01:12:21.053" style="s2">just because you&#39;re thick-skinned.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.243" end="01:12:22.013" style="s2">Leave it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.183" end="01:12:24.213" style="s2">Mr. Ashton is waiting for you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.443" end="01:12:29.723" style="s2">A natural saltwater pearl.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.793" end="01:12:30.833" style="s2">About eleven millimeters.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.933" end="01:12:32.113" style="s2">Great roundness and luster.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.353" end="01:12:34.273" style="s2">Some would pay $3,000 for the pearl alone.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.453" end="01:12:36.213" style="s2">Make it a pendant and it&#39;s worth even more.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.213" end="01:12:37.313" style="s2">Is this for me?</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.543" end="01:12:38.363" style="s2">He took a liking to you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.733" end="01:12:39.093" style="s2">Take it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.363" end="01:12:40.343" style="s2">Just hold on to it for him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.683" end="01:12:41.613" style="s2">It&#39;s so expensive.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.013" end="01:12:43.013" style="s2">I can&#39;t just take it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.043" end="01:12:43.833" style="s2">Then deduct it from</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.873" end="01:12:45.123" style="s2">the fish you buy him from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.913" end="01:12:46.703" style="s2">With his appetite,</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.833" end="01:12:48.133" style="s2">you might be feeding him for a lifetime.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.043" end="01:12:54.683" style="s2">Does it look good?</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.823" end="01:12:55.243" style="s2">It does.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.763" end="01:12:56.783" style="s2">The pearl looks good too.</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.027" end="01:12:59.477" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.967" end="01:13:01.407" style="s2">This boat broken by the bad guy</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.557" end="01:13:02.457" style="s2">is alive again!</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.637" end="01:13:03.677" style="s2">Who dares to bump it now?</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.967" end="01:13:04.947" style="s2">I&#39;ll bump them first!</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.957" end="01:13:07.157" style="s2">The boat is for making money,</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.317" end="01:13:08.407" style="s2">not for holding grudges.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.807" end="01:13:10.247" style="s2">I&#39;ll add two big fishes for you today!</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.397" end="01:13:22.427" style="s2">The shop is fixed!</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.787" end="01:13:23.737" style="s2">The boat is fixed too!</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.267" end="01:13:25.867" style="s2">No one is allowed to talk about work today.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.127" end="01:13:27.177" style="s2">Let&#39;s have a good meal first!</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.487" end="01:13:28.757" style="s2">Our son is the best!</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.987" end="01:13:29.997" style="s2">Giles wrecked the boat</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.107" end="01:13:31.127" style="s2">leaving only a shell,</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.407" end="01:13:32.357" style="s2">but in Morgan&#39;s hands,</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.567" end="01:13:34.077" style="s2">it can still sail the deep sea!</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.647" end="01:13:37.787" style="s2">Three restaurants next week</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.917" end="01:13:39.077" style="s2">signing long-term contracts.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.077" end="01:13:40.077" style="s2">You bring the catch in,</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.217" end="01:13:41.257" style="s2">and I&#39;ll make sure it&#39;s alive</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.287" end="01:13:42.247" style="s2">when it hits their tables.</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.367" end="01:13:43.427" style="s2">Both boats are ready to go.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.917" end="01:13:44.827" style="s2">When we hit a big haul,</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.017" end="01:13:46.157" style="s2">Wavecrest will work the front,</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.247" end="01:13:47.877" style="s2">and SeaRunner will bring the catch straight back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.107" end="01:13:49.637" style="s2">No more letting the good stuff die on the way.</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.277" end="01:13:54.947" style="s2">A croc</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.967" end="01:13:56.467" style="s2">turtle, octopus</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.657" end="01:13:57.947" style="s2">and now an otter too.</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.137" end="01:13:59.647" style="s2">When Morgan goes into the sea,</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.847" end="01:14:01.287" style="s2">it&#39;s like he&#39;s going home.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.417" end="01:14:02.817" style="s2">Everyone, stop working!</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.017" end="01:14:03.847" style="s2">Come eat!</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.617" end="01:14:17.177" style="s2">You owe Morgan $22,000,</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.357" end="01:14:19.007" style="s2">owe the shipyard $38,000,</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.177" end="01:14:20.167" style="s2">and you wrecked my speedboat.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.397" end="01:14:20.797" style="s2">Giles</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.007" end="01:14:22.147" style="s2">You don&#39;t even have a boat now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.287" end="01:14:23.277" style="s2">How will you pay me back?</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.277" end="01:14:24.497" style="s2">Those sea beasts around Morgan</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.797" end="01:14:25.707" style="s2">can find fishing grounds</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.017" end="01:14:26.767" style="s2">that others can&#39;t enter.</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.897" end="01:14:28.777" style="s2">Give me one more chance.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.047" end="01:14:29.977" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you tail him.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.977" end="01:14:30.967" style="s2">You tailed him once,</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.157" end="01:14:33.027" style="s2">brought back a basket of stinky conches,</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.157" end="01:14:34.667" style="s2">and it cost me a propeller.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.727" end="01:14:36.637" style="s2">Starting today,</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.897" end="01:14:38.727" style="s2">you&#39;ll lead my boat and cast the nets.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.867" end="01:14:40.207" style="s2">Until the debt is paid off,</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.377" end="01:14:41.727" style="s2">you won&#39;t see a single cent.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.927" end="01:14:43.147" style="s2">Lead us wrong one more time,</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.187" end="01:14:44.577" style="s2">and I&#39;ll throw you overboard!</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.077" end="01:15:07.567" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.117" end="01:15:09.287" style="s2">There&#39;s a dark boat outside.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.477" end="01:15:10.687" style="s2">They dropped a huge net</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.737" end="01:15:11.817" style="s2">taking even the smallest fish!</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.627" end="01:15:13.007" style="s2">Maris!</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.347" end="01:15:14.157" style="s2">Get the SeaRunner crew.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.477" end="01:15:15.087" style="s2">Someone&#39;s messing with</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.117" end="01:15:15.977" style="s2">our Seagrass Meadow.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.314" end="01:15:24.614" style="s2">What did Pebble find?</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.844" end="01:15:29.914" style="s2">There&#39;s a trawler running dark</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.944" end="01:15:30.724" style="s2">out by the outer reef.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.834" end="01:15:32.194" style="s2">They&#39;ve dropped fine nets into the seagrass.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.544" end="01:15:33.234" style="s2">If we wait any longer,</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.594" end="01:15:34.254" style="s2">the shell grounds and</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.294" end="01:15:35.284" style="s2">the fry will be wiped out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.644" end="01:15:36.104" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.844" end="01:15:37.784" style="s2">That net is huge!</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.284" end="01:15:39.014" style="s2">So many little fish</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.054" end="01:15:39.814" style="s2">are getting trapped!</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.944" end="01:15:40.824" style="s2">Get on board, boss!</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.954" end="01:15:41.714" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you chase them!</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.804" end="01:15:42.924" style="s2">Nobody messes with your stuff!</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.044" end="01:15:43.964" style="s2">I&#39;ll smash a giant hole</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.084" end="01:15:44.754" style="s2">right through their hull!</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.754" end="01:15:45.464" style="s2">Don&#39;t ram them yet.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.684" end="01:15:46.844" style="s2">That boat is surrounded by tow lines.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.214" end="01:15:47.914" style="s2">Getting your tail tangled</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.954" end="01:15:48.384" style="s2">is no joke.</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.974" end="01:15:49.444" style="s2">Follow the bow</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.714" end="01:15:50.484" style="s2">and wait for my signal.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.484" end="01:15:50.984" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.114" end="01:15:52.484" style="s2">Take the Wavecrest and chase them.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.624" end="01:15:53.904" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring the SeaRunner with buoys,</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.024" end="01:15:55.464" style="s2">net cutters, and spare ropes.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.554" end="01:15:56.544" style="s2">I&#39;ll be right behind you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.584" end="01:15:56.974" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.284" end="01:15:58.434" style="s2">don&#39;t stay right behind the net.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.534" end="01:16:00.174" style="s2">If a rope snaps, slow down right away!</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.784" end="01:16:06.454" style="s2">Mr. Ashton only told me to lead the way.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.724" end="01:16:07.294" style="s2">Why do I have to</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.324" end="01:16:08.224" style="s2">haul the net myself?</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.734" end="01:16:11.754" style="s2">You still owe me</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.954" end="01:16:12.764" style="s2">for that speedboat.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.084" end="01:16:14.154" style="s2">You&#39;ll do as I say.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.774" end="01:16:15.614" style="s2">Cut the crap!</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.314" end="01:16:23.434" style="s2">Stop the boat and haul the net!</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.544" end="01:16:24.834" style="s2">That&#39;s Luna Cove Shell Nursery ahead!</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.954" end="01:16:25.284" style="s2">You&#39;re using</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.314" end="01:16:26.354" style="s2">a fine-mesh bottom trawl!</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.354" end="01:16:27.534" style="s2">Do you own the ocean?</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.454" end="01:16:29.594" style="s2">I&#39;ll drop my nets</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.074" end="01:16:31.144" style="s2">wherever I want!</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.174" end="01:16:32.064" style="s2">I don&#39;t own the ocean,</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.374" end="01:16:33.064" style="s2">so you have no right</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.104" end="01:16:33.864" style="s2">to drag it all up!</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.504" end="01:16:35.184" style="s2">Haul up the net</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.414" end="01:16:36.194" style="s2">and get out of here now!</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.284" end="01:16:43.714" style="s2">He&#39;s forcing us to move!</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.864" end="01:16:45.064" style="s2">His boat has a deep draft,</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.174" end="01:16:46.404" style="s2">and there&#39;s a reef on the left.</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.494" end="01:16:47.584" style="s2">Finn, get on his right side.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.664" end="01:16:48.374" style="s2">Only push the bow.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.534" end="01:16:49.654" style="s2">Stay away from the propeller!</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.574" end="01:16:57.314" style="s2">Hard port!</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.574" end="01:16:58.844" style="s2">Pull her back!</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.184" end="01:17:06.254" style="s2">Pull me up!</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.824" end="01:17:08.614" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna fall!</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.914" end="01:17:10.164" style="s2">Maris, steady the boat!</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.254" end="01:17:11.364" style="s2">Their net is completely snagged!</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.444" end="01:17:12.214" style="s2">If they don&#39;t cut the tension,</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.324" end="01:17:12.904" style="s2">the stern will be</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.944" end="01:17:13.914" style="s2">dragged right underwater!</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.198" end="01:17:17.868" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.128" end="01:17:19.478" style="s2">Pull me up first!</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.808" end="01:17:21.108" style="s2">I thought you followed Ashton</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.158" end="01:17:21.898" style="s2">to get rich?</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.638" end="01:17:23.768" style="s2">How come you missed the money</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.208" end="01:17:24.778" style="s2">and got stuck</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.878" end="01:17:25.718" style="s2">with the deadly work?</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.338" end="01:17:28.528" style="s2">Save the sarcasm!</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.978" end="01:17:29.878" style="s2">Just save me!</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.618" end="01:17:31.098" style="s2">Hold on!</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.088" end="01:17:32.978" style="s2">Saving your life</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.368" end="01:17:33.758" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.808" end="01:17:35.148" style="s2">your debt is cleared.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.948" end="01:17:40.308" style="s2">Cut the cables!</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.148" end="01:17:42.278" style="s2">Forget the net!</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.678" end="01:17:43.718" style="s2">You can&#39;t just cut them!</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.378" end="01:17:45.218" style="s2">If the lines snap,</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.508" end="01:17:46.228" style="s2">everyone on deck</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.268" end="01:17:47.008" style="s2">is gonna get hit!</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.478" end="01:17:48.368" style="s2">Kill the engine first!</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.018" end="01:17:49.888" style="s2">Put the winch in neutral!</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.718" end="01:17:51.808" style="s2">Once the line slacks an inch,</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.648" end="01:17:53.578" style="s2">I&#39;ll cut the net underwater.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.748" end="01:17:55.878" style="s2">Why should I listen to you?</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.038" end="01:17:56.908" style="s2">Because you don&#39;t even know</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.948" end="01:17:57.818" style="s2">where the net is snagged!</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.508" end="01:17:59.238" style="s2">Keep forcing it,</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.928" end="01:18:00.728" style="s2">and the next wave</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.928" end="01:18:02.178" style="s2">will flood your stern!</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.308" end="01:18:11.898" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.038" end="01:18:14.288" style="s2">There are still lots of fish moving below!</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.478" end="01:18:16.048" style="s2">I&#39;ll lead you to the net opening!</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.148" end="01:18:17.248" style="s2">Don&#39;t get near the middle rope!</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.498" end="01:18:18.318" style="s2">Stick to my left!</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.018" end="01:18:37.978" style="s2">Dexter, pull the net open!</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.018" end="01:18:39.178" style="s2">Finn, brace against the reef!</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.208" end="01:18:40.048" style="s2">I&#39;ll cut this snagged section!</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.048" end="01:18:40.618" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.728" end="01:18:41.418" style="s2">I&#39;ll hold the gap open</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.508" end="01:18:42.268" style="s2">so the fish can escape!</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.448" end="01:18:58.558" style="s2">You ruined my net!</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.738" end="01:19:00.938" style="s2">You owe me at least $100,000!</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.978" end="01:19:01.908" style="s2">You used an illegal net,</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.988" end="01:19:03.038" style="s2">trespassed in the Seagrass Meadow,</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.088" end="01:19:03.838" style="s2">destroyed the Shell Grounds,</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.938" end="01:19:04.708" style="s2">and caught juvenile fish.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.918" end="01:19:05.778" style="s2">And you want me to pay?</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.778" end="01:19:06.748" style="s2">It&#39;s my net.</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.868" end="01:19:08.228" style="s2">You touched it, you pay.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.228" end="01:19:08.568" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.178" end="01:19:10.718" style="s2">Wait until the Maritime Patrol gets here.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.818" end="01:19:11.428" style="s2">You can tell it</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.468" end="01:19:12.388" style="s2">right to their faces.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.728" end="01:19:13.758" style="s2">Tell them whose net this is.</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.828" end="01:19:14.828" style="s2">And whose juvenile fish</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.918" end="01:19:15.818" style="s2">were caught tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.248" end="01:19:19.738" style="s2">You didn&#39;t leave when you could.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.388" end="01:19:22.168" style="s2">It&#39;s too late to run now!</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.795" end="01:19:26.665" style="s2">Cut the engine!</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.125" end="01:19:28.045" style="s2">Everyone stay where you are!</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.285" end="01:19:28.655" style="s2">The boat,</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.785" end="01:19:29.755" style="s2">nets, and catch</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.905" end="01:19:31.195" style="s2">are impounded for investigation.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.195" end="01:19:32.345" style="s2">He cut our trawl net!</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.475" end="01:19:33.445" style="s2">Made us hit the reef!</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.585" end="01:19:34.505" style="s2">Them entering the cove,</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.705" end="01:19:35.235" style="s2">dropping nets,</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.455" end="01:19:36.395" style="s2">and ramming the Wavecrest,</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.505" end="01:19:37.385" style="s2">it&#39;s all caught on video.</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.635" end="01:19:38.455" style="s2">After the net got stuck,</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.755" end="01:19:39.715" style="s2">I cut the sinker line</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.775" end="01:19:40.695" style="s2">to save the crew</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.695" end="01:19:41.685" style="s2">and trapped sea beasts.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.435" end="01:19:42.985" style="s2">This area</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.035" end="01:19:44.165" style="s2">is a temporary shell nursery.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.515" end="01:19:45.265" style="s2">The underwater buoys</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.285" end="01:19:46.285" style="s2">and shore signs are all there.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.585" end="01:19:47.485" style="s2">Before they came in,</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.615" end="01:19:48.585" style="s2">there&#39;s no way they missed them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.015" end="01:19:50.585" style="s2">Is it illegal fishing?</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.785" end="01:19:51.945" style="s2">The evidence is right here.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.185" end="01:19:54.745" style="s2">Follow the patrol boat back to port.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.115" end="01:19:59.015" style="s2">Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.185" end="01:20:00.295" style="s2">It&#39;s not my boat.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.445" end="01:20:01.435" style="s2">Not my nets either.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.835" end="01:20:03.345" style="s2">I just showed them the way.</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.545" end="01:20:04.365" style="s2">You knew perfectly well</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.405" end="01:20:05.295" style="s2">this is a seagrass meadow,</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.365" end="01:20:06.315" style="s2">but you still brought them in.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.645" end="01:20:07.915" style="s2">You wanted a cut of the money.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.015" end="01:20:08.805" style="s2">Now that things went south,</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.995" end="01:20:09.995" style="s2">you say it&#39;s not your fault?</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.075" end="01:20:10.785" style="s2">I&#39;ve already</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.845" end="01:20:12.115" style="s2">given SeaRunner back to you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.935" end="01:20:14.015" style="s2">What more do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.015" end="01:20:15.175" style="s2">You owed me that boat.</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.135" end="01:20:17.605" style="s2">What you did tonight is on you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.605" end="01:20:19.825" style="s2">Don&#39;t use yesterday&#39;s debt</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.165" end="01:20:21.155" style="s2">to cover up your dirty work</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.215" end="01:20:21.685" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.855" end="01:20:24.415" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.455" end="01:20:25.595" style="s2">no one patrols these waters?</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.755" end="01:20:27.305" style="s2">Mr. Ashton&#39;s boat got impounded.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.445" end="01:20:28.765" style="s2">You&#39;re paying for all the losses!</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.815" end="01:20:40.915" style="s2">Morgan, he can swim by himself now.</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.955" end="01:20:42.475" style="s2">Thanks for spotting that illegal boat first.</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.165" end="01:20:43.995" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for you tonight,</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.315" end="01:20:45.545" style="s2">this seagrass meadow would be gone.</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.685" end="01:20:46.895" style="s2">You worked hard too, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.015" end="01:20:48.885" style="s2">Let&#39;s share it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.085" end="01:20:50.395" style="s2">Big bro just got in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.475" end="01:20:51.595" style="s2">He shouldn&#39;t eat raw fish.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.595" end="01:20:52.755" style="s2">Finn&#39;s stomach is tough.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.795" end="01:20:53.835" style="s2">I&#39;ll eat it for him.</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.615" end="01:20:56.795" style="s2">This is for Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.225" end="01:20:58.555" style="s2">Your fish is on the boat.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.945" end="01:21:01.905" style="s2">There&#39;s enough for everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.835" end="01:21:03.615" style="s2">Let&#39;s fix the last two</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.685" end="01:21:04.455" style="s2">shell cages first.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.655" end="01:21:06.185" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you extra treats when we get back.</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.665" end="01:21:12.585" style="s2">Under the seagrass meadow,</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.675" end="01:21:14.025" style="s2">there&#39;s another batch of old shells.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.405" end="01:21:15.365" style="s2">Once the restoration is done,</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.605" end="01:21:15.955" style="s2">we&#39;ll follow</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.985" end="01:21:17.115" style="s2">the Goldline Shells to find them.</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.082" end="01:21:25.562" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.832" end="01:21:27.062" style="s2">This one makes a sound.</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.372" end="01:21:28.082" style="s2">Just like the</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.202" end="01:21:29.352" style="s2">pearl shells I found.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.112" end="01:21:31.002" style="s2">Don&#39;t open it yet.</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.902" end="01:21:32.672" style="s2">Do you remember where</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.712" end="01:21:33.782" style="s2">you saw these before?</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.052" end="01:21:34.872" style="s2">There&#39;s a patch of</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.962" end="01:21:36.272" style="s2">sunken forest over there.</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.432" end="01:21:37.362" style="s2">Under the tree roots,</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.482" end="01:21:38.932" style="s2">it&#39;s full of these big shells.</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.042" end="01:21:40.242" style="s2">But once the water rises,</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.312" end="01:21:41.502" style="s2">the path disappears.</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.502" end="01:21:42.412" style="s2">Today at 2 PM,</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.532" end="01:21:43.602" style="s2">the tide starts coming in.</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.692" end="01:21:44.552" style="s2">The Sunk Mangrove</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.752" end="01:21:45.552" style="s2">isn&#39;t close to here.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.702" end="01:21:47.152" style="s2">We have four hours max round-trip.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.152" end="01:21:48.002" style="s2">That&#39;s enough time.</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.592" end="01:21:49.712" style="s2">Bring two live tanks for now.</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.882" end="01:21:50.732" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about quantity.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.862" end="01:21:52.272" style="s2">Just find mature Goldline Shells.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.882" end="01:21:53.972" style="s2">Hop on my back, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.052" end="01:21:54.682" style="s2">With Finn around,</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.792" end="01:21:55.792" style="s2">even if the tide rises,</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.902" end="01:21:56.942" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you back safely.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.252" end="01:22:03.162" style="s2">The entire mangrove</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.192" end="01:22:04.152" style="s2">is flooded by seawater,</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.252" end="01:22:05.452" style="s2">and the roots block the big waves.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.952" end="01:22:06.692" style="s2">This place right here</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.722" end="01:22:07.882" style="s2">is a natural shell nursery.</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.652" end="01:22:16.312" style="s2">Morgan, this one looks great!</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.352" end="01:22:17.942" style="s2">There must be something pretty inside!</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.162" end="01:22:24.292" style="s2">Thick shell and a tight seal.</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.542" end="01:22:25.542" style="s2">It&#39;s at least ten years old.</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.012" end="01:22:27.102" style="s2">Put it in a separate tank for now.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.272" end="01:22:34.712" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.922" end="01:22:36.132" style="s2">Is this one big enough?</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.702" end="01:22:37.212" style="s2">Plenty big.</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.712" end="01:22:38.752" style="s2">The first Echo Conch today,</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.862" end="01:22:40.002" style="s2">you get the credit for finding it.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.972" end="01:22:43.462" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.572" end="01:22:45.282" style="s2">The water in here is rising fast!</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.069" end="01:22:49.239" style="s2">Finn, hold the tank!</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.399" end="01:22:50.209" style="s2">Pebble, come back!</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.339" end="01:22:51.419" style="s2">Don&#39;t go any further!</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.559" end="01:22:56.699" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.349" end="01:22:58.289" style="s2">The box and the shells,</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.979" end="01:23:00.349" style="s2">I won&#39;t drop a single one!</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.129" end="01:23:04.579" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.689" end="01:23:05.119" style="s2">The way back</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.159" end="01:23:06.049" style="s2">is blocked by weeds!</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.069" end="01:23:06.569" style="s2">I&#39;m small,</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.689" end="01:23:07.569" style="s2">so I can squeeze through.</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.719" end="01:23:08.689" style="s2">You and Finn can&#39;t!</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.019" end="01:23:10.109" style="s2">The weeds lean right.</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.629" end="01:23:11.349" style="s2">That means on the left,</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.469" end="01:23:12.449" style="s2">there&#39;s another way out!</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.079" end="01:23:14.169" style="s2">Look for bubbles by the roots.</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.649" end="01:23:15.419" style="s2">Don&#39;t wander off!</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.419" end="01:23:15.939" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.139" end="01:23:17.059" style="s2">Here&#39;s a way out!</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.169" end="01:23:17.759" style="s2">But down there,</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.899" end="01:23:19.269" style="s2">a big log is blocking it!</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.289" end="01:23:30.789" style="s2">Finn!</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.899" end="01:23:32.149" style="s2">Push when the wave pulls back!</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.319" end="01:23:33.319" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight the current!</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.539" end="01:23:36.249" style="s2">Now!</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.049" end="01:23:57.299" style="s2">You&#39;re safe, Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.389" end="01:23:58.589" style="s2">The shells are safe too!</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.879" end="01:24:00.659" style="s2">You found the way out.</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.299" end="01:24:02.479" style="s2">You saved us all today.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.719" end="01:24:09.739" style="s2">Ten more minutes,</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.919" end="01:24:11.019" style="s2">and I would&#39;ve driven the boat</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.079" end="01:24:12.239" style="s2">in there to look for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.249" end="01:24:13.309" style="s2">The tide came in a quarter hour</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.359" end="01:24:14.339" style="s2">earlier than the Tide Chart said.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.779" end="01:24:15.419" style="s2">Good thing Pebble</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.489" end="01:24:16.379" style="s2">found another way out.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.729" end="01:24:26.059" style="s2">She really cares about you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.199" end="01:24:27.639" style="s2">Once she got on board, she didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.669" end="01:24:28.649" style="s2">even look for her shells.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.739" end="01:24:29.929" style="s2">She checked on you first.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.479" end="01:24:31.499" style="s2">She treats me as a friend.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.969" end="01:24:32.839" style="s2">So of course I had to</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.869" end="01:24:33.599" style="s2">bring her back safe.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.189" end="01:24:39.759" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.029" end="01:24:41.049" style="s2">This is for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.319" end="01:24:42.309" style="s2">Whenever you see it,</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.649" end="01:24:44.219" style="s2">you&#39;ll know I&#39;m with you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.259" end="01:24:47.099" style="s2">Looks like my pearl</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.169" end="01:24:47.859" style="s2">isn&#39;t that special.</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.309" end="01:24:49.469" style="s2">The things she really loves</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.549" end="01:24:50.519" style="s2">were saved for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.129" end="01:24:53.219" style="s2">She picked out your pearl,</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.719" end="01:24:55.179" style="s2">but this one is a gift to me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.846" end="01:25:11.926" style="s2">One nine millimeters.</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.036" end="01:25:13.076" style="s2">One six millimeters.</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.206" end="01:25:14.326" style="s2">The roundness is okay.</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.406" end="01:25:15.956" style="s2">Fine for earrings and brooches.</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.406" end="01:25:21.036" style="s2">Not every shell</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.066" end="01:25:21.676" style="s2">has a good pearl.</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.486" end="01:25:23.596" style="s2">Finding a mature shell ground</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.346" end="01:25:25.516" style="s2">is already a huge win.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.116" end="01:25:32.276" style="s2">It really is gold!</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.426" end="01:25:33.366" style="s2">Thirteen millimeters.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.466" end="01:25:34.606" style="s2">Almost perfectly round.</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.696" end="01:25:36.086" style="s2">A natural seawater gold pearl.</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.186" end="01:25:37.346" style="s2">This quality is very rare.</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.606" end="01:25:39.606" style="s2">Worth at least $15,000 alone.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.046" end="01:25:40.486" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.626" end="01:25:41.126" style="s2">I found it!</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.216" end="01:25:42.746" style="s2">This prettiest one is for you!</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.746" end="01:25:43.786" style="s2">Let&#39;s keep it for now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.606" end="01:25:45.536" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you a little tag</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.716" end="01:25:47.216" style="s2">for your shells later.</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.186" end="01:25:52.466" style="s2">The rest of the pearls together</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.496" end="01:25:54.346" style="s2">can sell for around $8,000.</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.596" end="01:25:55.866" style="s2">If you wanna sell the gold pearl,</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.216" end="01:25:57.516" style="s2">I can contact city buyers.</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.956" end="01:25:58.816" style="s2">Sell the other pearls.</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.176" end="01:25:59.926" style="s2">We keep the gold one.</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.266" end="01:26:01.556" style="s2">We shouldn&#39;t open all the mature shells.</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.736" end="01:26:02.716" style="s2">Put the rest in the holding tank.</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.416" end="01:26:07.886" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.356" end="01:26:09.516" style="s2">Such a tiny thing</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.656" end="01:26:11.666" style="s2">is worth more than a bucket of fish!</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.666" end="01:26:13.096" style="s2">So you can&#39;t go whacking it with your tail.</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.256" end="01:26:14.186" style="s2">If it falls into the rocks,</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.946" end="01:26:15.516" style="s2">we wouldn&#39;t find it</p>
<p begin="01:26:15.576" end="01:26:16.346" style="s2">if we searched all day.</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.586" end="01:26:19.566" style="s2">The conchs and striped shrimp</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.686" end="01:26:21.026" style="s2">sold for over $6,000.</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.106" end="01:26:22.736" style="s2">The regular pearls went for $8,000.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.846" end="01:26:23.476" style="s2">In the holding tank,</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.506" end="01:26:24.926" style="s2">we still have over a dozen mature shells</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.026" end="01:26:25.906" style="s2">we didn&#39;t rush to cash in.</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.906" end="01:26:27.236" style="s2">We won&#39;t just sell the stock we have.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.036" end="01:26:29.226" style="s2">Pebble knows the shell grounds well.</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.446" end="01:26:29.806" style="s2">We can try</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.836" end="01:26:31.086" style="s2">farming a batch of pearl oysters.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.196" end="01:26:32.566" style="s2">You find the right waters.</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.976" end="01:26:34.496" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle sales and costs.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.186" end="01:26:35.986" style="s2">Same deal as always?</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.186" end="01:26:36.816" style="s2">Same deal.</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.486" end="01:26:38.646" style="s2">We work together, we split the cut.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.696" end="01:26:39.766" style="s2">Morgan&#39;s friend</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.936" end="01:26:41.006" style="s2">is my friend too!</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.206" end="01:26:42.786" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;ll help you guys</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.956" end="01:26:44.006" style="s2">find shells together!</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.316" end="01:26:46.016" style="s2">Boss, don&#39;t forget Finn!</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.116" end="01:26:48.026" style="s2">Farming shells means moving wooden frames!</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.256" end="01:26:49.606" style="s2">Finn is the strongest!</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.606" end="01:26:50.486" style="s2">Can&#39;t do it without you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.656" end="01:26:51.686" style="s2">First, take the stakes</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.806" end="01:26:52.406" style="s2">by the live well</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.566" end="01:26:53.216" style="s2">to the shallows.</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.033" end="01:26:59.563" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.703" end="01:27:00.613" style="s2">Is this tight enough?</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.803" end="01:27:01.343" style="s2">Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.973" end="01:27:02.753" style="s2">Knock the rest of them</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.793" end="01:27:03.553" style="s2">in the same spot.</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.803" end="01:27:12.953" style="s2">Come up and eat first!</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.253" end="01:27:14.483" style="s2">You&#39;ve been busy since morning,</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.623" end="01:27:16.513" style="s2">and haven&#39;t even had a sip of hot water.</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.943" end="01:27:17.313" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.163" end="01:27:18.683" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I tell you</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.713" end="01:27:19.533" style="s2">to rest at the shop?</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.953" end="01:27:21.353" style="s2">I hired two hands for the shop.</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.853" end="01:27:22.543" style="s2">They don&#39;t need me</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.583" end="01:27:23.593" style="s2">watching them all day.</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.513" end="01:27:25.643" style="s2">My biggest job now</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.213" end="01:27:27.013" style="s2">is making sure you all</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.043" end="01:27:28.153" style="s2">come back to eat on time.</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.703" end="01:27:30.293" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.713" end="01:27:31.773" style="s2">The SeaRunner&#39;s been tested</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.803" end="01:27:32.703" style="s2">for two hours straight.</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.863" end="01:27:34.183" style="s2">Oil and temp are totally steady.</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.363" end="01:27:36.063" style="s2">She can officially set sail tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.613" end="01:27:36.983" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.393" end="01:27:38.063" style="s2">are the crew familiar</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.103" end="01:27:38.873" style="s2">with the new live-well?</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.113" end="01:27:40.363" style="s2">With the rules my son set,</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.393" end="01:27:41.343" style="s2">who would dare slack off?</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.423" end="01:27:42.083" style="s2">The water intake,</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.193" end="01:27:43.523" style="s2">aerator, and backup batteries,</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.633" end="01:27:44.743" style="s2">they&#39;ve drilled it all twice.</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.883" end="01:27:46.943" style="s2">It hasn&#39;t been that long since</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.993" end="01:27:47.763" style="s2">Morgan lost his boat.</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.483" end="01:27:49.763" style="s2">Now he&#39;s not only got two boats,</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.873" end="01:27:52.353" style="s2">he&#39;s farming the ocean too.</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.613" end="01:27:53.783" style="s2">This is just the first batch</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.813" end="01:27:54.603" style="s2">of shells in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.053" end="01:27:55.753" style="s2">Whether they thrive</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.813" end="01:27:57.173" style="s2">depends on the temp and waves.</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.183" end="01:27:59.023" style="s2">Once we figure it out,</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.513" end="01:28:00.553" style="s2">we&#39;ll get everyone involved.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.383" end="01:28:04.813" style="s2">Is this for me?</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.263" end="01:28:05.973" style="s2">She likes you,</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.183" end="01:28:07.383" style="s2">so she&#39;s sharing her stash.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.023" end="01:28:13.803" style="s2">You spent so much on a dress</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.393" end="01:28:15.863" style="s2">My old one is still fine to wear.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.933" end="01:28:16.393" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.253" end="01:28:17.983" style="s2">The shop is safe,</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.203" end="01:28:18.973" style="s2">and the boats are back.</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.223" end="01:28:20.443" style="s2">Making money is about making sure</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.473" end="01:28:21.323" style="s2">you all live comfortably.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.403" end="01:28:22.253" style="s2">It&#39;s not about keeping it</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.303" end="01:28:23.313" style="s2">locked up in a box.</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.313" end="01:28:24.863" style="s2">Just wear what your son bought you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.113" end="01:28:26.793" style="s2">Morgan will earn even more later on.</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.903" end="01:28:27.493" style="s2">You can&#39;t always</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.543" end="01:28:28.733" style="s2">feel bad for him spending money.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.193" end="01:28:32.763" style="s2">I have to save the gold pearls for Pebble.</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.153" end="01:28:34.093" style="s2">I used these little pearls</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.133" end="01:28:34.823" style="s2">to make a hairpin.</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.353" end="01:28:36.633" style="s2">You run orders for me every day,</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.953" end="01:28:38.083" style="s2">so I couldn&#39;t give you nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.213" end="01:28:40.563" style="s2">Are you giving this as a partner,</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.713" end="01:28:41.423" style="s2">or under some</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.823" end="01:28:42.713" style="s2">other title?</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.783" end="01:28:44.263" style="s2">Whatever title you want to receive it as,</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.403" end="01:28:45.183" style="s2">that&#39;s the title.</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.113" end="01:28:46.553" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.773" end="01:28:47.453" style="s2">Splash is here!</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.613" end="01:28:48.463" style="s2">He says the open sea</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.513" end="01:28:49.953" style="s2">is full of big flying fish.</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.003" end="01:28:52.643" style="s2">There are so many</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.833" end="01:28:53.723" style="s2">fish with wings!</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.153" end="01:28:54.883" style="s2">They&#39;re chasing small fish</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.883" end="01:28:55.843" style="s2">toward Luna Cove!</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.893" end="01:28:57.073" style="s2">The surface is flashing!</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.523" end="01:28:59.833" style="s2">It&#39;s Giant Mackerel scales.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.413" end="01:29:00.983" style="s2">To force out</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.053" end="01:29:01.963" style="s2">that many flying fish,</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.103" end="01:29:03.453" style="s2">there must be thousands of pounds!</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.693" end="01:29:04.103" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.493" end="01:29:05.153" style="s2">let&#39;s go!</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.253" end="01:29:05.743" style="s2">Finn will</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.903" end="01:29:06.783" style="s2">catch them for you!</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.783" end="01:29:07.773" style="s2">No wooden board this time.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.923" end="01:29:08.883" style="s2">Mackerel swim too fast.</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.113" end="01:29:10.173" style="s2">Wavecrest will drop the nets.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.423" end="01:29:11.893" style="s2">SeaRunner will follow and load the catch.</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.673" end="01:29:17.853" style="s2">We&#39;re not diving for shells today.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.153" end="01:29:18.983" style="s2">You go with SeaRunner.</p>
<p begin="01:29:19.453" end="01:29:20.523" style="s2">Watch the live well for me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.713" end="01:29:21.973" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the fish break the intake net.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.373" end="01:29:23.273" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.623" end="01:29:24.953" style="s2">I&#39;ll watch the boat for you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.253" end="01:29:26.653" style="s2">And I&#39;ll keep my eyes on you too.</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.033" end="01:29:29.053" style="s2">The ice and baskets on board</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.083" end="01:29:29.803" style="s2">are all loaded up.</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.923" end="01:29:30.613" style="s2">I&#39;m coming with you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.743" end="01:29:31.983" style="s2">Leave SeaRunner to Uncle Doug.</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.013" end="01:29:32.483" style="s2">Son,</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.583" end="01:29:34.033" style="s2">you just focus on finding the fish.</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.223" end="01:29:35.193" style="s2">As for the catch behind,</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.293" end="01:29:36.833" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring every single basket back!</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.853" end="01:29:40.253" style="s2">That&#39;s a huge school of fish!</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.253" end="01:29:40.863" style="s2">The fish are using</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.903" end="01:29:42.253" style="s2">the downwind current to head southeast.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.423" end="01:29:43.453" style="s2">We can&#39;t chase them from behind.</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.543" end="01:29:44.683" style="s2">We need to cut them off from the front.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.383" end="01:29:47.613" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.863" end="01:29:49.333" style="s2">SeaRunner, detour east half a mile.</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.403" end="01:29:50.553" style="s2">Once Wavecrest surrounds the lead fish,</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.633" end="01:29:51.653" style="s2">you catch the first batch from the west.</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.653" end="01:29:52.243" style="s2">Copy that.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.393" end="01:29:53.473" style="s2">SeaRunner has turned.</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.653" end="01:29:54.163" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.283" end="01:29:54.963" style="s2">Underneath the school</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.153" end="01:29:56.223" style="s2">There&#39;s an even bigger one!</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.353" end="01:29:57.913" style="s2">It&#39;s leading all the other fish!</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.913" end="01:29:58.903" style="s2">The lead fish is on the right!</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.253" end="01:29:59.643" style="s2">Maris!</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.783" end="01:30:00.853" style="s2">Get ready to drop the nets!</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.153" end="01:30:01.613" style="s2">Hold on.</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.613" end="01:30:02.383" style="s2">Let it lead the school</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.433" end="01:30:03.143" style="s2">over the shoal first.</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.463" end="01:30:06.053" style="s2">Now!</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.383" end="01:30:06.853" style="s2">Drop the nets!</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.897" end="01:30:13.247" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.647" end="01:30:14.947" style="s2">The biggest ones are heading your way!</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.297" end="01:30:17.367" style="s2">There are too many fish!</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.547" end="01:30:18.377" style="s2">If we keep hauling,</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.457" end="01:30:19.747" style="s2">the net and the boat won&#39;t hold!</p>
<p begin="01:30:19.747" end="01:30:20.867" style="s2">Release twenty meters first!</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.967" end="01:30:22.217" style="s2">Let the fish tire themselves out!</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.337" end="01:30:24.047" style="s2">Everyone, stay clear of the rope coils!</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.137" end="01:30:25.487" style="s2">No one is allowed to pull by hand!</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.327" end="01:30:27.847" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.427" end="01:30:30.197" style="s2">The water flow in here is getting weaker!</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.297" end="01:30:32.187" style="s2">The fish will suffocate if we put them in!</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.737" end="01:30:34.127" style="s2">Dad!</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.327" end="01:30:35.147" style="s2">Don&#39;t take the fish yet!</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.187" end="01:30:36.387" style="s2">The livewell inlet is blocked!</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.417" end="01:30:37.477" style="s2">Have the crew clean the filter!</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.107" end="01:30:52.667" style="s2">This otter is so smart.</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.957" end="01:30:54.277" style="s2">If she hadn&#39;t spotted it early,</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.557" end="01:30:55.637" style="s2">the first batch of fish</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.837" end="01:30:56.787" style="s2">would&#39;ve suffocated.</p>
<p begin="01:31:01.127" end="01:31:01.987" style="s2">Haul it in now!</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.497" end="01:31:03.967" style="s2">Sea Wild, port side!</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.047" end="01:31:04.967" style="s2">Get ready to lift!</p>
<p begin="01:31:10.227" end="01:31:11.757" style="s2">We&#39;ve got over six hundred pounds!</p>
<p begin="01:31:12.007" end="01:31:13.447" style="s2">At least half still in the net!</p>
<p begin="01:31:15.847" end="01:31:16.917" style="s2">A sailfish is gonna ram the net!</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.347" end="01:31:21.297" style="s2">The net is torn!</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.457" end="01:31:22.287" style="s2">If it hits again,</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.387" end="01:31:23.597" style="s2">we&#39;ll lose all the fish!</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.007" end="01:31:25.097" style="s2">We can&#39;t trap the sailfish.</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.357" end="01:31:26.727" style="s2">Finn, push it to the outside.</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.857" end="01:31:28.117" style="s2">I&#39;ll let it out through the hole.</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.247" end="01:31:40.317" style="s2">Over here, out this way!</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.547" end="01:31:47.527" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.767" end="01:31:48.987" style="s2">They won&#39;t get away.</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.347" end="01:31:54.297" style="s2">Keep hauling the net.</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.517" end="01:31:55.537" style="s2">Ice the injured ones.</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.637" end="01:31:56.967" style="s2">Live ones go in the SeaRunner.</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.077" end="01:31:58.957" style="s2">Don&#39;t mix them up and crush them!</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.617" end="01:32:04.107" style="s2">Over 1,400 pounds!</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.287" end="01:32:04.937" style="s2">SeaRunner&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.987" end="01:32:06.217" style="s2">first official trip out!</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.217" end="01:32:07.877" style="s2">The live tanks are completely full!</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.877" end="01:32:08.457" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.667" end="01:32:09.997" style="s2">All the fish are doing great.</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.287" end="01:32:11.687" style="s2">I&#39;ve been watching them for you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.967" end="01:32:12.607" style="s2">Great job.</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.767" end="01:32:13.937" style="s2">When we get back, I&#39;ll give you</p>
<p begin="01:32:13.967" end="01:32:14.947" style="s2">the biggest fish of all.</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.947" end="01:32:15.977" style="s2">When the SeaRunner was in</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.007" end="01:32:16.977" style="s2">Giles Barrett&#39;s hands,</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.127" end="01:32:18.827" style="s2">it was hitting reefs and leaking constantly.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.997" end="01:32:20.097" style="s2">Morgan just got it back.</p>
<p begin="01:32:20.197" end="01:32:20.977" style="s2">His first trip out,</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.087" end="01:32:21.737" style="s2">and he brings back</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.787" end="01:32:23.467" style="s2">over 1,400 pounds of big mackerel.</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.617" end="01:32:25.017" style="s2">It&#39;s not the boat that&#39;s the problem,</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.277" end="01:32:26.557" style="s2">it&#39;s the guy driving it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.387" end="01:32:30.607" style="s2">Total weight is 1,460 pounds.</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.777" end="01:32:31.917" style="s2">Live catches and the big ones</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.077" end="01:32:32.767" style="s2">fetch a high price.</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.827" end="01:32:33.617" style="s2">Everything adds up to</p>
<p begin="01:32:33.737" end="01:32:35.147" style="s2">$38,200!</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.747" end="01:32:39.067" style="s2">I heard you jumped in the ocean again?</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.477" end="01:32:40.757" style="s2">Who cares if a few fish get away?</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.077" end="01:32:41.957" style="s2">You have to stay safe.</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.957" end="01:32:42.347" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.607" end="01:32:43.407" style="s2">I had a safety line.</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.537" end="01:32:44.507" style="s2">Finn was right there with me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.807" end="01:32:45.827" style="s2">I let the sailfish go.</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.967" end="01:32:47.447" style="s2">The net and the mackerel are fine.</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.447" end="01:32:48.807" style="s2">Our boy is really something!</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.977" end="01:32:49.857" style="s2">If it were anyone else,</p>
<p begin="01:32:49.987" end="01:32:51.607" style="s2">that sailfish would&#39;ve destroyed the net</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.727" end="01:32:52.947" style="s2">or dragged both boats under.</p>
<p begin="01:32:53.077" end="01:32:54.237" style="s2">Morgan freed the sailfish</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.377" end="01:32:55.627" style="s2">and saved a whole boat of fish!</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.347" end="01:33:02.167" style="s2">Morgan, this one&#39;s the biggest!</p>
<p begin="01:33:02.337" end="01:33:04.237" style="s2">Let&#39;s take it home and eat together.</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.567" end="01:33:06.047" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.367" end="01:33:08.347" style="s2">Tonight, Mom, Dad, Maris,</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.507" end="01:33:09.167" style="s2">and you guys too,</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.357" end="01:33:10.287" style="s2">we&#39;ll all have a feast.</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.349" end="01:33:19.129" style="s2">The cabin is taking on water!</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.379" end="01:33:28.489" style="s2">I saved this shark,</p>
<p begin="01:33:28.789" end="01:33:29.359" style="s2">and in return,</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.489" end="01:33:30.879" style="s2">it helped us avoid the reef.</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.399" end="01:33:33.059" style="s2">You just wanted to cash in on it,</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.639" end="01:33:34.539" style="s2">and ended up losing</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.589" end="01:33:35.789" style="s2">your own boat instead.</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.609" end="01:33:36.999" style="s2">Ashton,</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.529" end="01:33:39.149" style="s2">that&#39;s the difference between you and me.</p>
<p begin="01:33:46.966" end="01:33:48.336" style="s2">I&#39;ll call you Slate from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.836" end="01:33:50.106" style="s2">Your mouth is still hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.276" end="01:33:51.686" style="s2">Don&#39;t chase big fish today.</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.376" end="01:33:54.206" style="s2">Master, I can feel ahead</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.286" end="01:33:55.456" style="s2">Lots of fish in the deep.</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.896" end="01:33:56.576" style="s2">They are following</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.606" end="01:33:57.846" style="s2">The cold current south.</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.486" end="01:33:59.286" style="s2">How far from here?</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.356" end="01:34:01.296" style="s2">Half a day for normal boats.</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.496" end="01:34:03.006" style="s2">But if I swim at top speed</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.476" end="01:34:04.616" style="s2">Just an hour.</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.486" end="01:34:12.026" style="s2">If it hurts, say so. Don&#39;t tough it out.</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.646" end="01:34:14.246" style="s2">This scratch is nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.716" end="01:34:16.096" style="s2">You say that every time.</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.186" end="01:34:17.836" style="s2">Last time was just a scrape.</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.956" end="01:34:19.936" style="s2">This time, a steel wire cut you open.</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.096" end="01:34:21.026" style="s2">Still a &quot;scratch&quot;?</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.266" end="01:34:23.186" style="s2">Does it only count if you lose a hand?</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.196" end="01:34:25.376" style="s2">I&#39;ll be more careful.</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.196" end="01:34:26.966" style="s2">But if it weren&#39;t for you</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.016" end="01:34:27.846" style="s2">Steadying that cable,</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.986" end="01:34:29.246" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t have gotten the hook out alone.</p>
<p begin="01:34:29.946" end="01:34:31.286" style="s2">You gave me the safety line,</p>
<p begin="01:34:31.436" end="01:34:32.076" style="s2">So I had to pull you</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.116" end="01:34:33.116" style="s2">Back here in one piece.</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.236" end="01:34:35.406" style="s2">With you guarding the boat,</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.696" end="01:34:36.346" style="s2">When I go in the water,</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.626" end="01:34:37.786" style="s2">I feel completely at ease.</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.646" end="01:34:40.846" style="s2">Then don&#39;t make me guard it for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.946" end="01:34:42.676" style="s2">Morgan, put your hand here.</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.786" end="01:34:44.306" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch the dirty deck.</p>
<p begin="01:34:48.046" end="01:34:49.246" style="s2">You&#39;re always so thoughtful.</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.246" end="01:34:51.646" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.946" end="01:34:52.926" style="s2">that fast swimmer</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.046" end="01:34:54.446" style="s2">said there are fish ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.556" end="01:34:56.176" style="s2">When are we going to check it out?</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.176" end="01:34:57.746" style="s2">We need to go back for fuel and ice first.</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.436" end="01:34:59.106" style="s2">What Slate found</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.136" end="01:35:00.196" style="s2">is a deep-water fish route.</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.796" end="01:35:01.996" style="s2">Wavecrest and SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.086" end="01:35:03.156" style="s2">both need to gear up again.</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.616" end="01:35:09.066" style="s2">A few days ago it was the otter.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.266" end="01:35:10.136" style="s2">Now even a shark</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.226" end="01:35:11.486" style="s2">followed Morgan back.</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.546" end="01:35:12.946" style="s2">A croc pulling up front,</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.326" end="01:35:14.816" style="s2">a shark guarding the side.</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.816" end="01:35:15.896" style="s2">Out there on the sea,</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.226" end="01:35:17.706" style="s2">he&#39;s cooler than a whole fleet.</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.116" end="01:35:21.486" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.566" end="01:35:23.006" style="s2">The cold current is too far offshore.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.066" end="01:35:23.766" style="s2">The Sea Breeze must</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.796" end="01:35:24.646" style="s2">carry double the diesel.</p>
<p begin="01:35:24.676" end="01:35:26.086" style="s2">The live well needs fine mesh filters</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.246" end="01:35:27.486" style="s2">to stop scales from clogging it.</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.486" end="01:35:28.776" style="s2">Dad, you prep the Sea Breeze.</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.886" end="01:35:29.906" style="s2">Maris, contact the buyers.</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.996" end="01:35:31.026" style="s2">Just tell them in three days,</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.136" end="01:35:32.096" style="s2">we might have deep-water catch.</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.216" end="01:35:33.156" style="s2">Don&#39;t quote a quantity yet.</p>
<p begin="01:35:33.156" end="01:35:34.986" style="s2">I&#39;ll prep two refrigerated trucks.</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.396" end="01:35:36.666" style="s2">We&#39;ll be ready for any amount.</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.106" end="01:35:37.926" style="s2">I won&#39;t leave you guys waiting</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.946" end="01:35:38.906" style="s2">for trucks when you get back.</p>
<p begin="01:35:52.486" end="01:35:52.966" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:35:53.186" end="01:35:54.586" style="s2">We&#39;re over eighty meters deep now!</p>
<p begin="01:35:55.066" end="01:35:55.736" style="s2">Just ahead is</p>
<p begin="01:35:55.776" end="01:35:56.916" style="s2">the deep-sea cold zone!</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.026" end="01:35:57.376" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.656" end="01:35:58.646" style="s2">pull the Sea Breeze back to</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.676" end="01:35:59.376" style="s2">fifty meters!</p>
<p begin="01:35:59.516" end="01:36:00.616" style="s2">The cross waves are strong here.</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.716" end="01:36:01.686" style="s2">If the boats are too close,</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.836" end="01:36:02.616" style="s2">we might crash!</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.886" end="01:36:06.886" style="s2">Master, the cold current is ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:36:06.976" end="01:36:08.736" style="s2">The fish are hiding deep below.</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.736" end="01:36:10.176" style="s2">Take me down for a look first.</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.726" end="01:36:12.466" style="s2">Finn, stay by the Wavecrest.</p>
<p begin="01:36:12.776" end="01:36:13.566" style="s2">If anything comes up,</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.626" end="01:36:14.696" style="s2">warn Maris right away.</p>
<p begin="01:36:17.806" end="01:36:19.406" style="s2">Boss is riding the shark down?</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.606" end="01:36:20.686" style="s2">I can go too!</p>
<p begin="01:36:20.686" end="01:36:22.066" style="s2">You&#39;re best suited for the surface.</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.426" end="01:36:23.706" style="s2">I&#39;m leaving the Wavecrest to you,</p>
<p begin="01:36:23.846" end="01:36:25.216" style="s2">so I can dive with peace of mind.</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.256" end="01:36:26.216" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Boss!</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.706" end="01:36:28.336" style="s2">Anyone who gets near the Wavecrest</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.416" end="01:36:29.806" style="s2">has to get past me first!</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.056" end="01:36:31.196" style="s2">Slate is really fast.</p>
<p begin="01:36:31.286" end="01:36:32.596" style="s2">Don&#39;t let go once you&#39;re in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.726" end="01:36:33.946" style="s2">If you&#39;re not back in twenty minutes,</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.086" end="01:36:35.566" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow the lifeline to find you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.636" end="01:36:36.606" style="s2">Twenty minutes is plenty.</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.846" end="01:36:38.026" style="s2">Once I check the fish and direction,</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.156" end="01:36:38.946" style="s2">I&#39;ll come right up.</p>
<p begin="01:36:42.786" end="01:36:43.546" style="s2">Let&#39;s go!</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.946" end="01:36:50.576" style="s2">Bigeye Snappers on top!</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.216" end="01:36:52.196" style="s2">And Tuna down below!</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.396" end="01:36:54.036" style="s2">What Slate found</p>
<p begin="01:36:54.086" end="01:36:55.136" style="s2">isn&#39;t just a small school.</p>
<p begin="01:36:55.926" end="01:36:57.686" style="s2">It&#39;s an entire deep-sea fish corridor!</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.986" end="01:37:00.446" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="01:37:00.586" end="01:37:01.636" style="s2">There&#39;s a current on the left</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.776" end="01:37:02.516" style="s2">pulling downward!</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.746" end="01:37:03.986" style="s2">We can&#39;t go straight through!</p>
<p begin="01:37:06.086" end="01:37:07.286" style="s2">Skirt along its edge.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.576" end="01:37:08.726" style="s2">I need to see where the fish</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.806" end="01:37:09.986" style="s2">enter a safe depth.</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.086" end="01:37:18.236" style="s2">They&#39;re circling the ridge.</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.406" end="01:37:19.376" style="s2">They won&#39;t leave just yet.</p>
<p begin="01:37:19.496" end="01:37:20.706" style="s2">Marking the safe depth first.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.816" end="01:37:21.866" style="s2">Then back to cast the nets.</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.946" end="01:37:27.636" style="s2">You&#39;re finally back, boss!</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.746" end="01:37:28.786" style="s2">It&#39;s pitch black down there.</p>
<p begin="01:37:28.926" end="01:37:30.266" style="s2">I almost went down after you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.936" end="01:37:32.386" style="s2">The fish are east of the marker.</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.496" end="01:37:33.416" style="s2">Depth is forty meters.</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.506" end="01:37:34.506" style="s2">We can&#39;t use regular nets.</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.596" end="01:37:35.546" style="s2">We gotta use longlines and</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.576" end="01:37:36.396" style="s2">midwater gillnets.</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.516" end="01:37:37.556" style="s2">Wavecrest sets hooks</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.606" end="01:37:38.506" style="s2">along the cold current.</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.686" end="01:37:40.186" style="s2">Sea Breeze reels in from below.</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.186" end="01:37:41.496" style="s2">Right, use live bait.</p>
<p begin="01:37:41.656" end="01:37:42.376" style="s2">Space them out.</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.526" end="01:37:43.806" style="s2">If the tuna bite at once,</p>
<p begin="01:37:43.916" end="01:37:45.226" style="s2">the lines will tangle easily.</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.716" end="01:37:54.196" style="s2">Sea Breeze is downstream.</p>
<p begin="01:37:54.356" end="01:37:55.516" style="s2">Ready to connect lines.</p>
<p begin="01:37:56.126" end="01:37:56.746" style="s2">Don&#39;t reel yet.</p>
<p begin="01:37:57.546" end="01:37:58.886" style="s2">Wait for the third buoy to sink.</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.216" end="01:38:00.146" style="s2">Then pull together.</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.986" end="01:38:03.246" style="s2">We got a bite!</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.466" end="01:38:12.376" style="s2">Three tuna hooked at once!</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.806" end="01:38:13.846" style="s2">Everyone, gloves on!</p>
<p begin="01:38:13.966" end="01:38:15.316" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the main line tangle your legs!</p>
<p begin="01:38:19.386" end="01:38:20.546" style="s2">The fish is at the boat!</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.646" end="01:38:32.376" style="s2">Red gills, perfect body.</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.776" end="01:38:33.936" style="s2">Bleed and ice it immediately!</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.986" end="01:38:35.146" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the meat go sour.</p>
<p begin="01:38:41.666" end="01:38:42.366" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.686" end="01:38:43.636" style="s2">The biggest fish</p>
<p begin="01:38:43.756" end="01:38:45.316" style="s2">swam into the downdraft.</p>
<p begin="01:38:45.450" end="01:38:47.720" style="s2">If the brake fails and we let the rope slip,</p>
<p begin="01:38:48.030" end="01:38:48.980" style="s2">the whole longline setup</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.000" end="01:38:49.990" style="s2">will get dragged away!</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.050" end="01:38:52.260" style="s2">It&#39;s not just one fish.</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.370" end="01:38:53.520" style="s2">There are at least</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.610" end="01:38:55.110" style="s2">two tunas hooked on the main line!</p>
<p begin="01:38:55.140" end="01:38:55.950" style="s2">The one in the back is huge!</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.910" end="01:39:02.550" style="s2">Finn, drag the buoy out!</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.950" end="01:39:04.690" style="s2">Slate, go down and split the two fish.</p>
<p begin="01:39:04.780" end="01:39:06.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll untangle the line from the side!</p>
<p begin="01:39:06.880" end="01:39:08.170" style="s2">The downdraft is already near!</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.290" end="01:39:09.230" style="s2">You can&#39;t do it like last time</p>
<p begin="01:39:09.420" end="01:39:10.350" style="s2">and just dive straight in!</p>
<p begin="01:39:10.350" end="01:39:12.190" style="s2">That&#39;s why I&#39;m not riding Slate this time.</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.370" end="01:39:13.830" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay near the surface with Finn</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.970" end="01:39:15.660" style="s2">and just untangle the branch line on the tail!</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.820" end="01:39:18.200" style="s2">Once fifteen minutes are up,</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.280" end="01:39:20.730" style="s2">come back, no matter how big the fish is!</p>
<p begin="01:39:21.150" end="01:39:21.920" style="s2">You got it.</p>
<p begin="01:39:45.680" end="01:39:46.600" style="s2">Careful, boss!</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.740" end="01:39:48.160" style="s2">When these big fish go crazy,</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.300" end="01:39:49.560" style="s2">they pull harder than a boat!</p>
<p begin="01:39:49.650" end="01:39:50.460" style="s2">Hold on a bit longer.</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.610" end="01:39:51.990" style="s2">Let&#39;s separate the smaller one first.</p>
<p begin="01:40:07.420" end="01:40:08.630" style="s2">Where did the rope catch you?</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.200" end="01:40:10.100" style="s2">It just grazed me.</p>
<p begin="01:40:10.210" end="01:40:11.340" style="s2">Didn&#39;t even tear my clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.350" end="01:40:12.420" style="s2">Let&#39;s pull the fish up first.</p>
<p begin="01:40:12.420" end="01:40:13.700" style="s2">The fish isn&#39;t going anywhere,</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.810" end="01:40:14.760" style="s2">and neither are you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.930" end="01:40:16.260" style="s2">I&#39;m checking you once you&#39;re on deck.</p>
<p begin="01:40:19.950" end="01:40:21.680" style="s2">This one must be 300 pounds!</p>
<p begin="01:40:21.780" end="01:40:23.330" style="s2">SeaRunner, pull up alongside!</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.430" end="01:40:24.430" style="s2">Wavecrest can&#39;t handle it!</p>
<p begin="01:40:24.510" end="01:40:25.400" style="s2">For a fish this heavy,</p>
<p begin="01:40:25.510" end="01:40:27.190" style="s2">drop it straight into SeaRunner&#39;s ice hold!</p>
<p begin="01:40:41.060" end="01:40:43.200" style="s2">Over 320 pounds, Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.540" end="01:40:44.260" style="s2">This right here is</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.420" end="01:40:45.490" style="s2">today&#39;s king catch!</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.084" end="01:41:02.714" style="s2">The county&#39;s cold storage and trucks</p>
<p begin="01:41:02.754" end="01:41:03.484" style="s2">have already signed</p>
<p begin="01:41:03.524" end="01:41:04.784" style="s2">long-term contracts with me.</p>
<p begin="01:41:04.954" end="01:41:07.334" style="s2">Ms. Dalton, no matter how good the fish,</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.534" end="01:41:08.354" style="s2">if you can&#39;t move them,</p>
<p begin="01:41:08.444" end="01:41:09.664" style="s2">they&#39;re just rotting meat.</p>
<p begin="01:41:09.934" end="01:41:11.354" style="s2">The drivers broke their contracts,</p>
<p begin="01:41:11.684" end="01:41:12.804" style="s2">they&#39;ll pay the penalty.</p>
<p begin="01:41:13.314" end="01:41:14.504" style="s2">As for how I ship my goods,</p>
<p begin="01:41:14.754" end="01:41:15.914" style="s2">that&#39;s none of your concern.</p>
<p begin="01:41:15.914" end="01:41:16.714" style="s2">Work with me.</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.804" end="01:41:18.034" style="s2">Trucks, cold storage,</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.154" end="01:41:19.644" style="s2">restaurant orders—you get it all.</p>
<p begin="01:41:19.694" end="01:41:20.714" style="s2">Just give me the fishing routes</p>
<p begin="01:41:20.744" end="01:41:21.654" style="s2">that Morgan has found.</p>
<p begin="01:41:21.744" end="01:41:22.584" style="s2">This buying station</p>
<p begin="01:41:22.634" end="01:41:23.814" style="s2">could easily triple in size.</p>
<p begin="01:41:23.814" end="01:41:25.194" style="s2">You don&#39;t even know where the fish are.</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.294" end="01:41:26.444" style="s2">You think a few trucks can steal</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.474" end="01:41:28.134" style="s2">the route someone risked their life to find?</p>
<p begin="01:41:28.134" end="01:41:29.514" style="s2">Business is all about channels,</p>
<p begin="01:41:29.644" end="01:41:31.084" style="s2">not who risks their neck at sea.</p>
<p begin="01:41:31.084" end="01:41:32.634" style="s2">Then keep your channels and wait.</p>
<p begin="01:41:32.814" end="01:41:34.284" style="s2">Not a single pound of Morgan&#39;s goods</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.424" end="01:41:36.134" style="s2">will ever go into your trucks.</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.354" end="01:41:37.534" style="s2">Without my trucks,</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.084" end="01:41:38.774" style="s2">let&#39;s see how you</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.884" end="01:41:40.084" style="s2">ship the fish out today!</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.874" end="01:41:44.124" style="s2">You went through all this trouble</p>
<p begin="01:41:44.504" end="01:41:45.884" style="s2">just to hold up two trucks?</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.934" end="01:41:47.314" style="s2">All the county&#39;s live and chilled</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.494" end="01:41:48.744" style="s2">fish trucks are in my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:41:49.094" end="01:41:49.984" style="s2">Unless you get sharks</p>
<p begin="01:41:50.114" end="01:41:51.254" style="s2">to carry fish on the highway.</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.254" end="01:41:51.914" style="s2">If the highway&#39;s out,</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.014" end="01:41:52.654" style="s2">we&#39;ll take the sea route.</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.764" end="01:41:53.584" style="s2">SeaRunner has an ice hold,</p>
<p begin="01:41:53.654" end="01:41:54.584" style="s2">and Wavecrest has a live well.</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.644" end="01:41:55.414" style="s2">The county dock is</p>
<p begin="01:41:55.474" end="01:41:56.624" style="s2">sixty nautical miles from here.</p>
<p begin="01:41:56.674" end="01:41:57.454" style="s2">We&#39;ll still make it before dark.</p>
<p begin="01:41:57.454" end="01:41:57.844" style="s2">Two boats</p>
<p begin="01:41:58.024" end="01:41:59.004" style="s2">carrying thousands of pounds of fish—</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.084" end="01:41:59.924" style="s2">they won&#39;t even make it halfway</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.954" end="01:42:00.734" style="s2">before running out of gas!</p>
<p begin="01:42:00.734" end="01:42:01.934" style="s2">SeaRunner just filled up,</p>
<p begin="01:42:02.144" end="01:42:03.304" style="s2">and we have enough backup diesel.</p>
<p begin="01:42:03.404" end="01:42:04.314" style="s2">You pay to block the trucks,</p>
<p begin="01:42:04.454" end="01:42:05.544" style="s2">I&#39;ll sail to deliver the goods.</p>
<p begin="01:42:05.984" end="01:42:07.164" style="s2">By the time you realize what&#39;s happening,</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.284" end="01:42:09.114" style="s2">this batch of fish will be in the restaurants.</p>
<p begin="01:42:09.284" end="01:42:11.144" style="s2">Dad, SeaRunner doesn&#39;t need to unload.</p>
<p begin="01:42:11.214" end="01:42:12.354" style="s2">Replenish the ice immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:42:12.354" end="01:42:13.994" style="s2">Maris, contact the county dock.</p>
<p begin="01:42:14.084" end="01:42:14.614" style="s2">Have the buyers</p>
<p begin="01:42:14.654" end="01:42:15.854" style="s2">inspect the goods right there.</p>
<p begin="01:42:15.884" end="01:42:17.084" style="s2">I&#39;ll call them now.</p>
<p begin="01:42:17.384" end="01:42:18.734" style="s2">I&#39;ll go with the boats.</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.254" end="01:42:20.914" style="s2">Have the crew watch the station.</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.584" end="01:42:24.854" style="s2">Take a speedboat and go after them!</p>
<p begin="01:42:24.914" end="01:42:25.634" style="s2">Cut the SeaRunner&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.684" end="01:42:26.134" style="s2">fuel line!</p>
<p begin="01:42:26.224" end="01:42:27.444" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how they reach the county then.</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.464" end="01:42:28.434" style="s2">The cost from the last time</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.464" end="01:42:29.894" style="s2">the speedboat hit the reef is still on me.</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.254" end="01:42:32.184" style="s2">If something else happens, I really can&#39;t pay.</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.284" end="01:42:33.984" style="s2">Won&#39;t go? Then pay me back right now!</p>
<p begin="01:42:39.284" end="01:42:39.734" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="01:42:39.944" end="01:42:40.984" style="s2">That speedboat behind us</p>
<p begin="01:42:41.014" end="01:42:41.824" style="s2">is still tailing us.</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.014" end="01:42:43.374" style="s2">The men on it smell of steel</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.434" end="01:42:44.314" style="s2">hooks and diesel.</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.894" end="01:42:46.974" style="s2">It&#39;s Giles Barrett.</p>
<p begin="01:42:47.894" end="01:42:49.784" style="s2">Finn, dive to the Sea Breeze.</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.914" end="01:42:50.834" style="s2">Guard the fuel line.</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.834" end="01:42:51.814" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him near the boat.</p>
<p begin="01:42:51.814" end="01:42:52.744" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:42:53.074" end="01:42:54.094" style="s2">If he reaches out,</p>
<p begin="01:42:54.574" end="01:42:55.814" style="s2">I&#39;ll snap him up,</p>
<p begin="01:42:56.454" end="01:42:57.954" style="s2">cutters and all!</p>
<p begin="01:43:01.424" end="01:43:02.284" style="s2">Bump their hull.</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.464" end="01:43:03.454" style="s2">Force them to slow down.</p>
<p begin="01:43:03.734" end="01:43:05.354" style="s2">I just need to cut the fuel line.</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.654" end="01:43:20.234" style="s2">Why did the engine stop?</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.284" end="01:43:22.024" style="s2">Quick, move the fuel drum!</p>
<p begin="01:43:22.354" end="01:43:23.134" style="s2">Giles Barrett.</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.684" end="01:43:24.594" style="s2">You brought bolt cutters</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.644" end="01:43:25.664" style="s2">and chased us for miles,</p>
<p begin="01:43:25.964" end="01:43:27.144" style="s2">just to do Sean Ashton&#39;s bidding</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.174" end="01:43:27.974" style="s2">and cut my fuel line?</p>
<p begin="01:43:28.984" end="01:43:30.654" style="s2">I was just heading to the next county.</p>
<p begin="01:43:31.014" end="01:43:32.214" style="s2">Passing by, right up to my boat</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.244" end="01:43:33.114" style="s2">just half a meter away?</p>
<p begin="01:43:33.554" end="01:43:34.454" style="s2">Bring out the cutters and the</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.484" end="01:43:35.614" style="s2">diesel drums from your boat.</p>
<p begin="01:43:41.164" end="01:43:42.824" style="s2">The evidence speaks for itself.</p>
<p begin="01:43:43.234" end="01:43:44.434" style="s2">How else are you gonna spin this?</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.714" end="01:43:46.084" style="s2">You&#39;re perfectly fine, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:43:46.084" end="01:43:46.964" style="s2">Just because you failed</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.004" end="01:43:47.984" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean you didn&#39;t try.</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.064" end="01:43:48.964" style="s2">You wanted to cut our fuel</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.994" end="01:43:49.914" style="s2">and leave us stranded at sea.</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.994" end="01:43:51.104" style="s2">So I&#39;ll let you taste what it&#39;s like</p>
<p begin="01:43:51.244" end="01:43:52.554" style="s2">with no fuel and no tow.</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.554" end="01:43:54.054" style="s2">You can&#39;t just leave me here!</p>
<p begin="01:43:54.244" end="01:43:54.994" style="s2">Three miles ahead</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.034" end="01:43:55.934" style="s2">is the shelter buoy.</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.974" end="01:43:57.734" style="s2">The maritime patrol passes by daily.</p>
<p begin="01:43:57.804" end="01:43:58.864" style="s2">You said it yourself,</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.964" end="01:44:00.144" style="s2">you were heading to the next county.</p>
<p begin="01:44:00.224" end="01:44:01.224" style="s2">So enjoy the float.</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.164" end="01:44:04.564" style="s2">If he floats out here all night,</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.714" end="01:44:05.504" style="s2">won&#39;t Ashton use it</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.534" end="01:44:06.374" style="s2">to make trouble for us?</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.074" end="01:44:07.994" style="s2">I&#39;ve already radioed</p>
<p begin="01:44:08.034" end="01:44:09.294" style="s2">the speedboat&#39;s location.</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.544" end="01:44:10.614" style="s2">The patrol will pick him up.</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.734" end="01:44:11.734" style="s2">He&#39;s not gonna die.</p>
<p begin="01:44:12.084" end="01:44:13.514" style="s2">As for him trying to cut our line,</p>
<p begin="01:44:13.724" end="01:44:14.974" style="s2">he&#39;ll have to explain that himself.</p>
<p begin="01:44:18.824" end="01:44:20.924" style="s2">Boss, Finn kept the fuel line safe!</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.024" end="01:44:22.714" style="s2">That guy didn&#39;t even touch the boat!</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.014" end="01:44:24.554" style="s2">You&#39;re getting extra food when we get back.</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.714" end="01:44:25.894" style="s2">Slate, keep leading the way.</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.954" end="01:44:26.964" style="s2">We can&#39;t afford a single minute</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.004" end="01:44:27.924" style="s2">of delay with this fish.</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.351" end="01:44:32.721" style="s2">The core temperature is low enough.</p>
<p begin="01:44:32.811" end="01:44:33.861" style="s2">The meat hasn&#39;t darkened either.</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.021" end="01:44:34.861" style="s2">Over 300 pounds,</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.951" end="01:44:36.141" style="s2">and it&#39;s still this fresh.</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.291" end="01:44:37.471" style="s2">It was processed right on time.</p>
<p begin="01:44:37.471" end="01:44:38.371" style="s2">The Yellowfin Tuna,</p>
<p begin="01:44:38.451" end="01:44:39.351" style="s2">Bigeye Snapper,</p>
<p begin="01:44:39.481" end="01:44:40.401" style="s2">and other live fish</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.541" end="01:44:41.411" style="s2">all meet the standard.</p>
<p begin="01:44:41.441" end="01:44:42.581" style="s2">Based on the agreed grades</p>
<p begin="01:44:42.611" end="01:44:43.121" style="s2">and pricing,</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.221" end="01:44:45.481" style="s2">the total is $68,400.</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.451" end="01:44:48.121" style="s2">This sea route was just an emergency.</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.271" end="01:44:48.821" style="s2">In the future,</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.991" end="01:44:50.121" style="s2">if we partner long-term,</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.121" end="01:44:51.091" style="s2">the SeaRunner can make</p>
<p begin="01:44:51.151" end="01:44:52.251" style="s2">two live deliveries a week.</p>
<p begin="01:44:52.251" end="01:44:53.741" style="s2">As long as the quality holds up,</p>
<p begin="01:44:53.881" end="01:44:54.951" style="s2">the dock berths and</p>
<p begin="01:44:55.021" end="01:44:55.881" style="s2">unloading crews</p>
<p begin="01:44:55.991" end="01:44:57.111" style="s2">will be reserved for you.</p>
<p begin="01:45:02.181" end="01:45:03.431" style="s2">These two sea beasts</p>
<p begin="01:45:03.601" end="01:45:05.081" style="s2">are escorting the boat.</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.251" end="01:45:05.801" style="s2">No wonder he</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.841" end="01:45:07.351" style="s2">dared to deliver deep-sea fish overnight.</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.641" end="01:45:08.831" style="s2">They have a live-well on board,</p>
<p begin="01:45:09.141" end="01:45:10.541" style="s2">and a shark leading the way.</p>
<p begin="01:45:10.771" end="01:45:12.081" style="s2">Who could block this route?</p>
<p begin="01:45:16.521" end="01:45:18.501" style="s2">Following you is awesome, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:45:18.781" end="01:45:20.121" style="s2">One trip to the open sea,</p>
<p begin="01:45:20.251" end="01:45:21.721" style="s2">and we get big fish to eat!</p>
<p begin="01:45:22.391" end="01:45:25.001" style="s2">Master, next time we hit the cold current,</p>
<p begin="01:45:25.211" end="01:45:27.181" style="s2">I can find even deeper schools of fish.</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.121" end="01:45:31.981" style="s2">Let me see.</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.051" end="01:45:34.121" style="s2">It&#39;s already bandaged.</p>
<p begin="01:45:34.121" end="01:45:35.561" style="s2">Since setting sail this afternoon,</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.651" end="01:45:37.001" style="s2">your right hand hasn&#39;t left the wheel.</p>
<p begin="01:45:37.181" end="01:45:38.521" style="s2">I bet the wound opened again.</p>
<p begin="01:45:41.701" end="01:45:42.491" style="s2">Ashton offered</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.531" end="01:45:43.481" style="s2">such a lucrative deal.</p>
<p begin="01:45:43.781" end="01:45:45.021" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you tempted at all?</p>
<p begin="01:45:46.331" end="01:45:47.691" style="s2">He can&#39;t even get his own goods.</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.781" end="01:45:49.121" style="s2">He just leeches off others&#39; routes</p>
<p begin="01:45:49.151" end="01:45:49.771" style="s2">to do business.</p>
<p begin="01:45:49.881" end="01:45:51.031" style="s2">Why would I work with him?</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.651" end="01:45:52.931" style="s2">It&#39;s not just the route.</p>
<p begin="01:45:54.021" end="01:45:54.741" style="s2">He promised you</p>
<p begin="01:45:54.791" end="01:45:56.181" style="s2">the biggest stall in the city.</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.181" end="01:45:57.791" style="s2">You trusted me with your life out there.</p>
<p begin="01:45:58.011" end="01:45:58.901" style="s2">If I betrayed you</p>
<p begin="01:45:58.951" end="01:45:59.601" style="s2">for a stall,</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.731" end="01:46:00.981" style="s2">what kind of person would I be?</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.881" end="01:46:06.521" style="s2">Stop staring, your noodles are getting soggy.</p>
<p begin="01:46:07.091" end="01:46:08.101" style="s2">I just feel like</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.481" end="01:46:10.621" style="s2">it&#39;s really nice having you around.</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.685" end="01:46:22.745" style="s2">Morgan, Maris,</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.355" end="01:46:24.555" style="s2">crunch the numbers later.</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.045" end="01:46:26.315" style="s2">Let&#39;s eat first.</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.015" end="01:46:27.895" style="s2">The county dock</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.095" end="01:46:29.555" style="s2">is holding a long-term berth for us.</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.845" end="01:46:31.355" style="s2">If anyone blocks our trucks again,</p>
<p begin="01:46:31.675" end="01:46:33.255" style="s2">we can just deliver by sea.</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.335" end="01:46:34.845" style="s2">SeaRunner makes two trips a week,</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.345" end="01:46:36.755" style="s2">while Wavecrest finds the fish.</p>
<p begin="01:46:37.225" end="01:46:38.205" style="s2">The shop and the station</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.305" end="01:46:39.545" style="s2">both have a steady supply now.</p>
<p begin="01:46:39.675" end="01:46:41.385" style="s2">We&#39;ve really opened up a new route.</p>
<p begin="01:46:41.485" end="01:46:42.865" style="s2">My son is so capable.</p>
<p begin="01:46:43.245" end="01:46:44.705" style="s2">When others get their trucks blocked,</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.775" end="01:46:46.035" style="s2">their goods just rot.</p>
<p begin="01:46:46.305" end="01:46:47.375" style="s2">Morgan took the boat</p>
<p begin="01:46:47.515" end="01:46:48.935" style="s2">and forced a new path open.</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.235" end="01:46:50.585" style="s2">After deducting fuel, ice,</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.645" end="01:46:51.525" style="s2">labor, and spoilage,</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.625" end="01:46:53.585" style="s2">we&#39;re left with $51,000 net.</p>
<p begin="01:46:53.715" end="01:46:54.535" style="s2">Like we agreed,</p>
<p begin="01:46:54.665" end="01:46:56.455" style="s2">we split the route profits fifty-fifty.</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.455" end="01:46:57.515" style="s2">We opened up this route</p>
<p begin="01:46:57.555" end="01:46:57.935" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.035" end="01:46:59.255" style="s2">It should be fifty-fifty anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.255" end="01:47:00.615" style="s2">I just contacted the buyers</p>
<p begin="01:47:00.715" end="01:47:02.005" style="s2">and tagged along for one trip.</p>
<p begin="01:47:02.015" end="01:47:03.385" style="s2">You and your guys caught the fish.</p>
<p begin="01:47:03.385" end="01:47:04.085" style="s2">Without you,</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.225" end="01:47:05.305" style="s2">no matter how good the fish are,</p>
<p begin="01:47:05.385" end="01:47:06.435" style="s2">they wouldn&#39;t leave Luna Cove.</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.555" end="01:47:07.885" style="s2">It&#39;s not about who helped who.</p>
<p begin="01:47:07.975" end="01:47:09.445" style="s2">We&#39;re in this business together.</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.385" end="01:47:20.625" style="s2">Here, have this soft one.</p>
<p begin="01:47:20.685" end="01:47:21.355" style="s2">When your mouth heals,</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.545" end="01:47:22.175" style="s2">I&#39;ll challenge you again</p>
<p begin="01:47:22.205" end="01:47:23.385" style="s2">to see who catches bigger fish.</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.415" end="01:47:27.155" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.155" end="01:47:28.265" style="s2">You eat too, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:47:28.365" end="01:47:29.215" style="s2">We brought this back</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.235" end="01:47:30.215" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:47:30.725" end="01:47:31.465" style="s2">You go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:47:32.095" end="01:47:33.565" style="s2">Maris and I have hot noodles.</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.915" end="01:47:36.475" style="s2">I used to run the station,</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.765" end="01:47:38.155" style="s2">worrying about having no stock,</p>
<p begin="01:47:38.265" end="01:47:39.875" style="s2">no trucks, and no buyers.</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.055" end="01:47:41.575" style="s2">Now the business is growing,</p>
<p begin="01:47:41.685" end="01:47:43.075" style="s2">but I&#39;m starting to worry that</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.105" end="01:47:44.955" style="s2">you&#39;ll dive into even deeper waters.</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.005" end="01:47:47.405" style="s2">I&#39;ll go to places further away.</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.575" end="01:47:48.325" style="s2">But I won&#39;t leave you</p>
<p begin="01:47:48.385" end="01:47:49.315" style="s2">alone on the shore.</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.555" end="01:47:51.005" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll keep watching over</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.045" end="01:47:52.205" style="s2">the boat and the cargo for you.</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.575" end="01:47:53.935" style="s2">Not just the boat and cargo.</p>
<p begin="01:47:54.245" end="01:47:55.345" style="s2">Whatever we want to do next,</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.455" end="01:47:56.525" style="s2">we&#39;ll figure it out together.</p>
<p begin="01:48:01.660" end="01:48:03.030" style="s2">keep SeaRunner outside the cove.</p>
<p begin="01:48:03.080" end="01:48:04.290" style="s2">Once the first batch is boxed,</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.360" end="01:48:05.840" style="s2">I&#39;ll have Finn send them out.</p>
<p begin="01:48:05.840" end="01:48:07.100" style="s2">A pound and a half each.</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.190" end="01:48:08.010" style="s2">Perfect condition.</p>
<p begin="01:48:08.070" end="01:48:09.640" style="s2">Top-grade silver pomfret!</p>
<p begin="01:48:09.640" end="01:48:10.690" style="s2">Ice and box them.</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.920" end="01:48:12.300" style="s2">This is just the first batch!</p>
<p begin="01:48:12.670" end="01:48:13.990" style="s2">Pull the boats back.</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.440" end="01:48:15.750" style="s2">Guard the open water!</p>
<p begin="01:48:16.140" end="01:48:17.260" style="s2">There&#39;s no way he</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.300" end="01:48:18.970" style="s2">can fit all those fish!</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.040" end="01:48:36.220" style="s2">Keep catching, boss!</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.340" end="01:48:37.640" style="s2">No matter how big those ships are,</p>
<p begin="01:48:37.760" end="01:48:39.360" style="s2">they can&#39;t beat my delivery speed!</p>
<p begin="01:48:44.100" end="01:48:45.910" style="s2">The fish goes on ice right out of the water.</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.020" end="01:48:47.600" style="s2">It&#39;ll still be super fresh at the dock.</p>
<p begin="01:48:47.740" end="01:48:49.370" style="s2">My son&#39;s method is rock solid.</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.970" end="01:48:54.410" style="s2">He&#39;s running fish from the shallow reef.</p>
<p begin="01:48:54.470" end="01:48:55.970" style="s2">Blocking the exit is useless.</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.970" end="01:48:56.940" style="s2">If we keep waiting,</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.050" end="01:48:58.670" style="s2">both of his boats will be full.</p>
<p begin="01:48:58.670" end="01:49:00.110" style="s2">Wait till he loads up to the waterline.</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.500" end="01:49:01.990" style="s2">Then force him to take the long way around.</p>
<p begin="01:49:02.140" end="01:49:04.160" style="s2">Once it&#39;s dark, the fish won&#39;t stay fresh.</p>
<p begin="01:49:04.530" end="01:49:05.870" style="s2">He won&#39;t get a good price for it anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.440" end="01:49:09.460" style="s2">The net is under three meters from the reef!</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.780" end="01:49:15.300" style="s2">Push the current from outside the net!</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.390" end="01:49:16.190" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch the net!</p>
<p begin="01:49:16.670" end="01:49:18.270" style="s2">Got it, you get the fish!</p>
<p begin="01:49:18.450" end="01:49:19.460" style="s2">I&#39;ll block the waves!</p>
<p begin="01:49:33.310" end="01:49:34.150" style="s2">We cleared it!</p>
<p begin="01:49:34.440" end="01:49:36.110" style="s2">The rest of the fish are still in the net!</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.520" end="01:49:39.190" style="s2">No more slow pulling.</p>
<p begin="01:49:39.400" end="01:49:41.430" style="s2">SeaRunner, pull up outside the reef.</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.520" end="01:49:43.000" style="s2">Finn, keep moving the crates.</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.250" end="01:49:44.350" style="s2">We&#39;re hauling it all up</p>
<p begin="01:49:44.380" end="01:49:45.610" style="s2">before it gets dark!</p>
<p begin="01:49:55.540" end="01:49:56.530" style="s2">Among the silver pomfrets,</p>
<p begin="01:49:56.580" end="01:49:57.670" style="s2">there&#39;s a big golden pomfret!</p>
<p begin="01:49:57.670" end="01:49:59.340" style="s2">No injuries. Put it in a live tank.</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.380" end="01:49:59.980" style="s2">We&#39;ll keep this one</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.180" end="01:50:01.360" style="s2">as a centerpiece for the Grill.</p>
<p begin="01:50:08.740" end="01:50:09.940" style="s2">We&#39;ve hit the weight limit.</p>
<p begin="01:50:09.970" end="01:50:11.320" style="s2">Let the rest go.</p>
<p begin="01:50:14.390" end="01:50:15.510" style="s2">The hull just cracked.</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.630" end="01:50:16.280" style="s2">If we keep going,</p>
<p begin="01:50:16.360" end="01:50:17.600" style="s2">we might not make it back to port.</p>
<p begin="01:50:17.600" end="01:50:18.260" style="s2">Mr. Ashton.</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.360" end="01:50:19.580" style="s2">Morgan has an orca leading the way.</p>
<p begin="01:50:19.640" end="01:50:20.720" style="s2">We can&#39;t block him here.</p>
<p begin="01:50:20.840" end="01:50:22.080" style="s2">If we can&#39;t stop him at sea,</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.330" end="01:50:23.220" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure on land</p>
<p begin="01:50:23.270" end="01:50:24.370" style="s2">that his fish won&#39;t sell!</p>
<p begin="01:50:32.740" end="01:50:34.600" style="s2">Morgan is back riding an orca!</p>
<p begin="01:50:34.640" end="01:50:35.700" style="s2">Rode a croc in the coves before.</p>
<p begin="01:50:35.700" end="01:50:37.350" style="s2">Now he rides an orca in the deep sea.</p>
<p begin="01:50:37.430" end="01:50:38.660" style="s2">Where big ships can&#39;t go,</p>
<p begin="01:50:38.750" end="01:50:39.710" style="s2">he gets in just fine.</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.190" end="01:50:42.620" style="s2">Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.690" end="01:50:43.760" style="s2">Today&#39;s fish boxes,</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.800" end="01:50:44.940" style="s2">Finn delivered them all.</p>
<p begin="01:50:44.970" end="01:50:46.360" style="s2">It just blocked a few waves.</p>
<p begin="01:50:55.910" end="01:50:56.710" style="s2">Clear eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:50:56.860" end="01:50:57.460" style="s2">Firm body.</p>
<p begin="01:50:57.810" end="01:50:58.660" style="s2">After such a long trip,</p>
<p begin="01:50:58.760" end="01:51:00.170" style="s2">the freshness is preserved so well.</p>
<p begin="01:51:00.170" end="01:51:01.340" style="s2">Large silver pomfret over one catty,</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.410" end="01:51:02.110" style="s2">I&#39;ll offer 28 dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.130" end="01:51:03.350" style="s2">For those over eight taels, 23 dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.360" end="01:51:03.900" style="s2">I&#39;ll take them all.</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.900" end="01:51:05.670" style="s2">For the large ones, I&#39;ll pay 30 dollars,</p>
<p begin="01:51:05.720" end="01:51:06.620" style="s2">plus that live golden pomfret.</p>
<p begin="01:51:06.650" end="01:51:07.570" style="s2">Save 400 catties for me.</p>
<p begin="01:51:07.570" end="01:51:09.590" style="s2">2,160 catties of silver pomfret.</p>
<p begin="01:51:09.600" end="01:51:11.450" style="s2">620 catties of premium large catch.</p>
<p begin="01:51:11.510" end="01:51:13.070" style="s2">Golden pomfret is 9.8 catties,</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.130" end="01:51:13.970" style="s2">calculated separately.</p>
<p begin="01:51:14.710" end="01:51:16.600" style="s2">Send 400 catties of premium to City Grill.</p>
<p begin="01:51:16.750" end="01:51:18.040" style="s2">The remaining large and medium</p>
<p begin="01:51:18.090" end="01:51:19.200" style="s2">go to outside buyers.</p>
<p begin="01:51:19.440" end="01:51:20.110" style="s2">The small ones</p>
<p begin="01:51:20.160" end="01:51:21.240" style="s2">go to Fisher&#39;s Seafood.</p>
<p begin="01:51:21.240" end="01:51:22.110" style="s2">Don&#39;t mix the grades.</p>
<p begin="01:51:22.570" end="01:51:23.160" style="s2">The total revenue</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.190" end="01:51:24.460" style="s2">is 67,400 dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:51:24.490" end="01:51:25.470" style="s2">Minus shipping and ice costs,</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.530" end="01:51:27.370" style="s2">the net profit is 63,800 dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:51:27.370" end="01:51:28.080" style="s2">One steamed.</p>
<p begin="01:51:28.200" end="01:51:28.980" style="s2">One braised.</p>
<p begin="01:51:29.020" end="01:51:30.870" style="s2">You guys worked hard out at sea for two days.</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.000" end="01:51:31.400" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.420" end="01:51:32.840" style="s2">let&#39;s not just focus on the money.</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.840" end="01:51:34.140" style="s2">Ashton has three boats,</p>
<p begin="01:51:34.230" end="01:51:35.190" style="s2">and they still couldn&#39;t beat</p>
<p begin="01:51:35.220" end="01:51:36.600" style="s2">my son riding an orca.</p>
<p begin="01:51:36.690" end="01:51:37.930" style="s2">That&#39;s my boy, Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:51:41.580" end="01:51:42.310" style="s2">New friend.</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.440" end="01:51:43.960" style="s2">This is my prettiest shell.</p>
<p begin="01:51:44.150" end="01:51:44.900" style="s2">For you.</p>
<p begin="01:51:44.900" end="01:51:47.720" style="s2">Thank you! If there are big waves in the deep sea,</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.850" end="01:51:48.990" style="s2">I&#39;ll block them for you too.</p>
<p begin="01:51:49.820" end="01:51:51.320" style="s2">Even the orcas block waves for you.</p>
<p begin="01:51:51.650" end="01:51:52.490" style="s2">Does this mean you&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.530" end="01:51:53.700" style="s2">going to the deep sea more?</p>
<p begin="01:51:53.710" end="01:51:54.220" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="01:51:54.510" end="01:51:55.460" style="s2">But I&#39;d never leave you</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.550" end="01:51:56.370" style="s2">alone on the shore.</p>
<p begin="01:51:57.850" end="01:51:58.580" style="s2">Ms. Dalton!</p>
<p begin="01:51:58.710" end="01:51:59.660" style="s2">The town&#39;s ice plant just</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.710" end="01:52:00.440" style="s2">canceled our order.</p>
<p begin="01:52:00.520" end="01:52:01.010" style="s2">They said they won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:52:01.020" end="01:52:02.210" style="s2">sell ice to the Fishers anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:52:08.567" end="01:52:09.997" style="s2">It&#39;s not that I don&#39;t want to sell,</p>
<p begin="01:52:10.427" end="01:52:11.597" style="s2">Mr. Ashton just booked all</p>
<p begin="01:52:11.607" end="01:52:12.957" style="s2">the crushed ice for the next two weeks,</p>
<p begin="01:52:13.277" end="01:52:14.457" style="s2">and he paid upfront.</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.097" end="01:52:15.747" style="s2">My warehouse</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.797" end="01:52:17.367" style="s2">is completely empty right now.</p>
<p begin="01:52:17.367" end="01:52:18.637" style="s2">Catch all the fish you want,</p>
<p begin="01:52:18.727" end="01:52:20.607" style="s2">without ice, they&#39;re just rotting trash.</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.697" end="01:52:21.997" style="s2">Don&#39;t you ride an orca?</p>
<p begin="01:52:22.107" end="01:52:23.207" style="s2">Have it make ice for you.</p>
<p begin="01:52:23.207" end="01:52:24.857" style="s2">How much ice you buy is up to you,</p>
<p begin="01:52:24.857" end="01:52:26.137" style="s2">but you think buying out one</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.187" end="01:52:27.467" style="s2">ice plant will stop me?</p>
<p begin="01:52:27.737" end="01:52:28.987" style="s2">This is the only place around here</p>
<p begin="01:52:29.087" end="01:52:30.187" style="s2">that makes ten tons a day.</p>
<p begin="01:52:30.257" end="01:52:31.387" style="s2">By the time you ship it in,</p>
<p begin="01:52:31.467" end="01:52:32.467" style="s2">the fish will be gone.</p>
<p begin="01:52:32.467" end="01:52:33.617" style="s2">The market in the next county</p>
<p begin="01:52:33.657" end="01:52:34.497" style="s2">has two ice plants.</p>
<p begin="01:52:34.637" end="01:52:35.627" style="s2">Land transport is pricey,</p>
<p begin="01:52:35.657" end="01:52:36.637" style="s2">but we&#39;ve already secured</p>
<p begin="01:52:36.687" end="01:52:37.287" style="s2">a shipping berth.</p>
<p begin="01:52:37.507" end="01:52:38.997" style="s2">The SeaRunner takes over half a day</p>
<p begin="01:52:39.137" end="01:52:39.957" style="s2">for a round trip.</p>
<p begin="01:52:40.037" end="01:52:41.537" style="s2">How much ice will even be left?</p>
<p begin="01:52:41.907" end="01:52:43.297" style="s2">You enjoy guarding this ice.</p>
<p begin="01:52:43.717" end="01:52:45.477" style="s2">When I get back, I hope your</p>
<p begin="01:52:45.527" end="01:52:47.107" style="s2">junk boat has fish worthy of it.</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.267" end="01:52:48.477" style="s2">A normal round trip</p>
<p begin="01:52:48.537" end="01:52:49.497" style="s2">takes seven hours.</p>
<p begin="01:52:50.207" end="01:52:51.527" style="s2">Even in an insulated hold,</p>
<p begin="01:52:51.617" end="01:52:53.167" style="s2">we&#39;ll lose at least twenty percent.</p>
<p begin="01:52:53.597" end="01:52:54.607" style="s2">Taking the standard channel</p>
<p begin="01:52:54.647" end="01:52:55.637" style="s2">does take seven hours,</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.897" end="01:52:56.737" style="s2">but the orca knows a</p>
<p begin="01:52:56.777" end="01:52:58.547" style="s2">deep-water route through the rough patch.</p>
<p begin="01:52:59.297" end="01:53:00.557" style="s2">If the SeaRunner follows it,</p>
<p begin="01:53:00.647" end="01:53:02.067" style="s2">we can cut the trip almost in half.</p>
<p begin="01:53:02.067" end="01:53:03.027" style="s2">The waves are rough out there.</p>
<p begin="01:53:03.107" end="01:53:04.387" style="s2">With the SeaRunner fully loaded,</p>
<p begin="01:53:04.477" end="01:53:05.567" style="s2">can it handle it on the way back?</p>
<p begin="01:53:05.567" end="01:53:06.767" style="s2">The boat will be empty going out,</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.857" end="01:53:08.007" style="s2">and on the way back, Odin</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.027" end="01:53:08.947" style="s2">will break the waves ahead of us.</p>
<p begin="01:53:09.037" end="01:53:09.967" style="s2">Finn guards the sides,</p>
<p begin="01:53:10.137" end="01:53:11.237" style="s2">Slate watches for underwater reefs,</p>
<p begin="01:53:11.327" end="01:53:12.297" style="s2">and I&#39;ll steer the boat myself.</p>
<p begin="01:53:12.297" end="01:53:13.337" style="s2">Wherever my boss goes,</p>
<p begin="01:53:13.417" end="01:53:14.237" style="s2">Finn follows.</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.357" end="01:53:15.637" style="s2">Never mind a few blocks of ice,</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.747" end="01:53:16.787" style="s2">I&#39;ll drag a whole iceberg</p>
<p begin="01:53:16.947" end="01:53:17.807" style="s2">back here for you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:17.807" end="01:53:18.707" style="s2">This trip is just for ice.</p>
<p begin="01:53:18.797" end="01:53:19.577" style="s2">You stay on shore and handle</p>
<p begin="01:53:19.597" end="01:53:20.367" style="s2">the next batch of orders.</p>
<p begin="01:53:20.367" end="01:53:21.247" style="s2">The plant there only takes</p>
<p begin="01:53:21.377" end="01:53:22.397" style="s2">cash and contracts.</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.397" end="01:53:23.297" style="s2">You handle the sailing,</p>
<p begin="01:53:23.407" end="01:53:24.527" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle loading the ice.</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.677" end="01:53:25.757" style="s2">Let&#39;s not waste any time.</p>
<p begin="01:53:29.447" end="01:53:30.287" style="s2">At this rate,</p>
<p begin="01:53:30.417" end="01:53:31.937" style="s2">we&#39;ll be there in two hours.</p>
<p begin="01:53:31.937" end="01:53:32.477" style="s2">Ashton paid</p>
<p begin="01:53:32.497" end="01:53:33.647" style="s2">to buy out all that ice,</p>
<p begin="01:53:33.747" end="01:53:34.807" style="s2">but he just pushed us to find</p>
<p begin="01:53:34.847" end="01:53:36.107" style="s2">an even faster shipping route.</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.107" end="01:53:36.527" style="s2">Master,</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.647" end="01:53:37.427" style="s2">driftwood ahead,</p>
<p begin="01:53:37.547" end="01:53:38.877" style="s2">and torn nets underwater to the right.</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.967" end="01:53:40.017" style="s2">Follow Odin to the left.</p>
<p begin="01:53:45.037" end="01:53:45.657" style="s2">Mr. Ashton!</p>
<p begin="01:53:45.797" end="01:53:46.767" style="s2">Morgan just went right through</p>
<p begin="01:53:46.807" end="01:53:47.387" style="s2">the rough patch!</p>
<p begin="01:53:47.567" end="01:53:48.217" style="s2">At this speed,</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.307" end="01:53:48.807" style="s2">by nightfall,</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.887" end="01:53:50.047" style="s2">he really will bring the ice back.</p>
<p begin="01:53:50.781" end="01:53:52.131" style="s2">Let&#39;s load eight tons first.</p>
<p begin="01:53:52.511" end="01:53:53.681" style="s2">Two ships a week from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:53:53.911" end="01:53:54.471" style="s2">I&#39;ll charge you</p>
<p begin="01:53:54.511" end="01:53:55.671" style="s2">the long-term client rate.</p>
<p begin="01:53:55.671" end="01:53:56.891" style="s2">Stop at six and a half tons.</p>
<p begin="01:53:57.101" end="01:53:58.871" style="s2">SeaRunner has to sail back against the waves.</p>
<p begin="01:53:58.981" end="01:54:00.451" style="s2">We can&#39;t carry a little extra</p>
<p begin="01:54:00.531" end="01:54:01.541" style="s2">and cross the safety limit.</p>
<p begin="01:54:03.371" end="01:54:05.231" style="s2">Six and a half tons is enough for Wavecrest</p>
<p begin="01:54:05.291" end="01:54:05.861" style="s2">for two trips.</p>
<p begin="01:54:05.981" end="01:54:06.781" style="s2">Prepare the rest for</p>
<p begin="01:54:06.811" end="01:54:07.701" style="s2">the next ship&#39;s schedule.</p>
<p begin="01:54:07.701" end="01:54:08.831" style="s2">Other people usually load</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.891" end="01:54:09.721" style="s2">as much as they can.</p>
<p begin="01:54:09.951" end="01:54:11.041" style="s2">But you&#39;re asking for less.</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.411" end="01:54:12.651" style="s2">Ice is meant to preserve fish.</p>
<p begin="01:54:13.021" end="01:54:14.271" style="s2">We can&#39;t have the people carrying it</p>
<p begin="01:54:14.321" end="01:54:15.241" style="s2">sink into the sea first.</p>
<p begin="01:54:16.431" end="01:54:16.801" style="s2">Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.181" end="01:54:18.751" style="s2">These white things aren&#39;t even edible.</p>
<p begin="01:54:18.751" end="01:54:19.231" style="s2">Ashton.</p>
<p begin="01:54:19.341" end="01:54:20.481" style="s2">Why&#39;d he hoard so much?</p>
<p begin="01:54:20.771" end="01:54:22.181" style="s2">We need it to keep the fish fresh.</p>
<p begin="01:54:22.671" end="01:54:23.591" style="s2">He&#39;s not after the ice.</p>
<p begin="01:54:23.931" end="01:54:25.171" style="s2">He wants to ruin our business.</p>
<p begin="01:54:25.401" end="01:54:26.671" style="s2">Then he did it for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:54:26.781" end="01:54:28.161" style="s2">You&#39;ve got orcas leading the way.</p>
<p begin="01:54:28.271" end="01:54:29.321" style="s2">And I&#39;m guarding the ship.</p>
<p begin="01:54:29.381" end="01:54:30.401" style="s2">No one&#39;s stopping us.</p>
<p begin="01:54:35.801" end="01:54:36.981" style="s2">That&#39;s my boy.</p>
<p begin="01:54:37.271" end="01:54:38.791" style="s2">Ashton bought out a whole ice plant.</p>
<p begin="01:54:39.071" end="01:54:40.101" style="s2">And Morgan just turns around</p>
<p begin="01:54:40.121" end="01:54:41.361" style="s2">and brings back over six tons.</p>
<p begin="01:54:41.441" end="01:54:42.581" style="s2">For a cheaper price, too.</p>
<p begin="01:54:42.601" end="01:54:43.321" style="s2">Mr. Ashton.</p>
<p begin="01:54:43.451" end="01:54:44.561" style="s2">There are still over 10 tons</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.741" end="01:54:45.671" style="s2">of your ice in the warehouse.</p>
<p begin="01:54:45.771" end="01:54:46.741" style="s2">You have to take it as agreed.</p>
<p begin="01:54:46.851" end="01:54:47.881" style="s2">Otherwise, we will have to</p>
<p begin="01:54:47.911" end="01:54:48.891" style="s2">charge you for the storage.</p>
<p begin="01:54:48.901" end="01:54:50.201" style="s2">Can&#39;t you see I&#39;m getting a truck?</p>
<p begin="01:54:51.711" end="01:54:52.871" style="s2">You really like hoarding ice, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:54:53.511" end="01:54:54.091" style="s2">Take your time.</p>
<p begin="01:54:54.831" end="01:54:56.021" style="s2">We&#39;ll use the County Shipping Route</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.071" end="01:54:56.521" style="s2">from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.941" end="01:54:57.871" style="s2">We won&#39;t get in your way.</p>
<p begin="01:54:57.871" end="01:54:59.041" style="s2">You saved a few bucks on ice.</p>
<p begin="01:54:59.141" end="01:55:00.291" style="s2">Is that really something to brag about?</p>
<p begin="01:55:00.461" end="01:55:01.351" style="s2">Without dock workers</p>
<p begin="01:55:01.391" end="01:55:02.311" style="s2">Without nets and fuel</p>
<p begin="01:55:02.451" end="01:55:02.991" style="s2">Your two ships</p>
<p begin="01:55:03.091" end="01:55:04.071" style="s2">Still can&#39;t go out to sea.</p>
<p begin="01:55:04.071" end="01:55:05.281" style="s2">The county ice plant agreed</p>
<p begin="01:55:05.321" end="01:55:06.181" style="s2">to a long-term supply.</p>
<p begin="01:55:06.231" end="01:55:06.971" style="s2">The dock also gave</p>
<p begin="01:55:07.001" end="01:55:08.141" style="s2">SeaRunner a permanent berth.</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.141" end="01:55:08.831" style="s2">Block us once,</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.931" end="01:55:10.101" style="s2">and we&#39;ll open a new path.</p>
<p begin="01:55:10.121" end="01:55:10.831" style="s2">Keep doing it,</p>
<p begin="01:55:10.961" end="01:55:12.171" style="s2">and all of Luna Cove&#39;s business</p>
<p begin="01:55:12.371" end="01:55:13.541" style="s2">will fall right into our laps.</p>
<p begin="01:55:15.441" end="01:55:17.311" style="s2">Mr. Ashton, Morgan has two ships.</p>
<p begin="01:55:17.411" end="01:55:18.331" style="s2">And orcas leading the way!</p>
<p begin="01:55:18.401" end="01:55:19.301" style="s2">We really can&#39;t stop him.</p>
<p begin="01:55:19.301" end="01:55:19.931" style="s2">Shut up!</p>
<p begin="01:55:20.591" end="01:55:21.321" style="s2">You couldn&#39;t even keep</p>
<p begin="01:55:21.351" end="01:55:21.941" style="s2">your own ship!</p>
<p begin="01:55:22.201" end="01:55:23.371" style="s2">Who are you to tell me what to do?</p>
<p begin="01:55:32.641" end="01:55:33.691" style="s2">In a month, at the</p>
<p begin="01:55:33.761" end="01:55:34.641" style="s2">annual Supply Meeting,</p>
<p begin="01:55:34.721" end="01:55:36.421" style="s2">whoever delivers three batches</p>
<p begin="01:55:36.481" end="01:55:38.201" style="s2">of premium deep-sea catch</p>
<p begin="01:55:38.541" end="01:55:39.481" style="s2">will secure next year&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:55:39.511" end="01:55:40.241" style="s2">major contract.</p>
<p begin="01:55:40.841" end="01:55:42.491" style="s2">It&#39;s not just about one lucky catch.</p>
<p begin="01:55:42.721" end="01:55:43.671" style="s2">It&#39;s about finding the fish,</p>
<p begin="01:55:43.801" end="01:55:45.341" style="s2">preserving, and transporting them.</p>
<p begin="01:55:45.441" end="01:55:47.101" style="s2">Sounds perfect for us.</p>
<p begin="01:55:47.961" end="01:55:49.181" style="s2">Dare to make a bet with me?</p>
<p begin="01:55:49.591" end="01:55:50.231" style="s2">In a month,</p>
<p begin="01:55:50.651" end="01:55:52.631" style="s2">whoever loses the annual contract</p>
<p begin="01:55:53.171" end="01:55:54.521" style="s2">will have to leave Luna Cove&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:55:54.631" end="01:55:55.521" style="s2">deep-sea business.</p>
<p begin="01:55:56.511" end="01:55:58.121" style="s2">Contracts always speak for themselves.</p>
<p begin="01:55:58.801" end="01:55:59.771" style="s2">If you want to risk your pride</p>
<p begin="01:55:59.801" end="01:56:00.271" style="s2">on this too,</p>
<p begin="01:56:00.411" end="01:56:01.341" style="s2">I have no problem with that.</p>
<p begin="01:56:06.651" end="01:56:07.491" style="s2">Even a dumb animal</p>
<p begin="01:56:07.681" end="01:56:08.711" style="s2">dares to mess with me!</p>
<p begin="01:56:09.071" end="01:56:10.591" style="s2">Don&#39;t get cocky, Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:56:10.941" end="01:56:12.261" style="s2">At the Supply Meeting in a month,</p>
<p begin="01:56:12.641" end="01:56:13.801" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you and your ships</p>
<p begin="01:56:13.901" end="01:56:15.381" style="s2">get the hell out of Luna Cove!</p>
<p begin="01:56:16.641" end="01:56:17.461" style="s2">Go deal with your</p>
<p begin="01:56:17.511" end="01:56:18.621" style="s2">melting ice first.</p>
<p begin="01:56:19.211" end="01:56:20.401" style="s2">Then you can talk big.</p>
<p begin="01:56:22.871" end="01:56:23.351" style="s2">Maris.</p>
<p begin="01:56:24.251" end="01:56:25.461" style="s2">Get ready for the next trip.</p>
<p begin="01:56:26.541" end="01:56:28.011" style="s2">Since Ashton wants to bet,</p>
<p begin="01:56:28.721" end="01:56:29.711" style="s2">let&#39;s make sure we beat him</p>
<p begin="01:56:29.771" end="01:56:30.471" style="s2">fair and square.</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.451" end="01:56:40.281" style="s2">Live fish depend on volume and transport.</p>
<p begin="01:56:40.721" end="01:56:42.301" style="s2">I got three boats and six live wells.</p>
<p begin="01:56:42.411" end="01:56:43.561" style="s2">How will you compete with me?</p>
<p begin="01:56:43.871" end="01:56:45.311" style="s2">More wells don&#39;t mean better fish.</p>
<p begin="01:56:45.891" end="01:56:46.971" style="s2">Find the fish first.</p>
<p begin="01:56:47.271" end="01:56:48.301" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll talk about volume.</p>
<p begin="01:56:48.301" end="01:56:49.261" style="s2">This time you ain&#39;t riding</p>
<p begin="01:56:49.291" end="01:56:50.481" style="s2">a croc to pick up some crabs.</p>
<p begin="01:56:50.661" end="01:56:52.551" style="s2">If you can&#39;t deliver 500 pounds in three days,</p>
<p begin="01:56:52.701" end="01:56:53.961" style="s2">you won&#39;t even make it to the finals.</p>
<p begin="01:56:53.961" end="01:56:54.571" style="s2">When have my goods</p>
<p begin="01:56:54.601" end="01:56:55.291" style="s2">ever disappointed you?</p>
<p begin="01:56:55.541" end="01:56:56.861" style="s2">But that well full of ice you just bought</p>
<p begin="01:56:56.891" end="01:56:57.461" style="s2">is still melting.</p>
<p begin="01:56:57.471" end="01:56:58.851" style="s2">Worry about your own stuff first.</p>
<p begin="01:57:04.281" end="01:57:05.181" style="s2">Sea bass is easy</p>
<p begin="01:57:05.211" end="01:57:05.811" style="s2">to get the weight,</p>
<p begin="01:57:05.991" end="01:57:06.891" style="s2">but they&#39;re not worth much.</p>
<p begin="01:57:07.661" end="01:57:08.741" style="s2">To pull ahead of Ashton,</p>
<p begin="01:57:08.881" end="01:57:10.221" style="s2">we should find large groupers.</p>
<p begin="01:57:11.601" end="01:57:12.591" style="s2">The orca heard it last night,</p>
<p begin="01:57:12.731" end="01:57:13.591" style="s2">out in the southeast sea,</p>
<p begin="01:57:13.681" end="01:57:14.661" style="s2">there&#39;s a hollow echo.</p>
<p begin="01:57:14.731" end="01:57:16.171" style="s2">Could be some sea caves down there.</p>
<p begin="01:57:16.491" end="01:57:17.211" style="s2">Groupers really love</p>
<p begin="01:57:17.241" end="01:57:18.251" style="s2">hiding in places like that.</p>
<p begin="01:57:18.471" end="01:57:20.491" style="s2">Air hoses, live bags, and</p>
<p begin="01:57:20.651" end="01:57:22.371" style="s2">backup pumps are all set.</p>
<p begin="01:57:22.661" end="01:57:24.661" style="s2">Morgan, I know your skills,</p>
<p begin="01:57:25.111" end="01:57:26.901" style="s2">but be careful in deep caves.</p>
<p begin="01:57:27.161" end="01:57:29.011" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;ll scout ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:57:29.071" end="01:57:30.031" style="s2">If things look off,</p>
<p begin="01:57:30.081" end="01:57:31.371" style="s2">I won&#39;t go in for any fish.</p>
<p begin="01:57:31.371" end="01:57:32.881" style="s2">One for you, and one for Maris.</p>
<p begin="01:57:33.011" end="01:57:34.611" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget to eat when you get busy.</p>
<p begin="01:57:44.401" end="01:57:45.601" style="s2">Wavecrest will search nearby.</p>
<p begin="01:57:45.691" end="01:57:47.121" style="s2">SeaRunner stays out to receive goods.</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.181" end="01:57:48.281" style="s2">The two boats won&#39;t crowd into</p>
<p begin="01:57:48.301" end="01:57:49.301" style="s2">the same dangerous waters.</p>
<p begin="01:57:49.301" end="01:57:50.071" style="s2">Same rules as always.</p>
<p begin="01:57:50.071" end="01:57:51.171" style="s2">If the radio cuts out,</p>
<p begin="01:57:51.301" end="01:57:52.621" style="s2">Sea Breeze will immediately retreat</p>
<p begin="01:57:52.671" end="01:57:53.241" style="s2">to safe waters.</p>
<p begin="01:57:56.711" end="01:57:57.301" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="01:57:57.581" end="01:57:59.111" style="s2">Take your time finding your groupers.</p>
<p begin="01:57:59.191" end="01:57:59.971" style="s2">By the time you do,</p>
<p begin="01:58:00.071" end="01:58:01.261" style="s2">Mr. Ashton&#39;s live wells</p>
<p begin="01:58:01.291" end="01:58:02.271" style="s2">will already be full!</p>
<p begin="01:58:04.471" end="01:58:05.201" style="s2">Let him go.</p>
<p begin="01:58:06.211" end="01:58:07.131" style="s2">On the wrong path,</p>
<p begin="01:58:07.681" end="01:58:08.851" style="s2">his three boats will just end up</p>
<p begin="01:58:08.901" end="01:58:09.881" style="s2">empty faster than ours.</p>
<p begin="01:58:12.721" end="01:58:13.751" style="s2">The hollow echoes</p>
<p begin="01:58:13.801" end="01:58:15.241" style="s2">are under a distant reef.</p>
<p begin="01:58:15.441" end="01:58:16.921" style="s2">The water there pulls down.</p>
<p begin="01:58:17.021" end="01:58:17.971" style="s2">Boats can&#39;t enter.</p>
<p begin="01:58:18.011" end="01:58:19.341" style="s2">It&#39;s good they can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:58:19.371" end="01:58:20.581" style="s2">Finn, stay with Wavecrest.</p>
<p begin="01:58:20.641" end="01:58:21.941" style="s2">I&#39;ll ride the orca to scout ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:58:25.295" end="01:58:27.045" style="s2">Lots of heavy echoes inside.</p>
<p begin="01:58:28.015" end="01:58:29.415" style="s2">They&#39;re hiding behind the rocks.</p>
<p begin="01:58:29.655" end="01:58:30.575" style="s2">Hearing me approach,</p>
<p begin="01:58:30.915" end="01:58:32.135" style="s2">they dart into the cave.</p>
<p begin="01:58:32.135" end="01:58:32.925" style="s2">Big groupers.</p>
<p begin="01:58:33.895" end="01:58:35.165" style="s2">Rough waves and a deep cave.</p>
<p begin="01:58:35.315" end="01:58:36.615" style="s2">Normal divers can&#39;t make it down here.</p>
<p begin="01:58:36.975" end="01:58:38.075" style="s2">No wonder they&#39;re untouched.</p>
<p begin="01:58:40.795" end="01:58:41.945" style="s2">There&#39;s a downcurrent below.</p>
<p begin="01:58:42.115" end="01:58:42.765" style="s2">Once the catch bag</p>
<p begin="01:58:42.805" end="01:58:43.655" style="s2">gets sucked to the bottom,</p>
<p begin="01:58:43.875" end="01:58:44.855" style="s2">it&#39;ll drag you down too.</p>
<p begin="01:58:44.855" end="01:58:45.795" style="s2">So we won&#39;t catch them yet.</p>
<p begin="01:58:46.475" end="01:58:46.855" style="s2">Slate and I</p>
<p begin="01:58:46.865" end="01:58:47.745" style="s2">will go scout the entrance.</p>
<p begin="01:58:47.905" end="01:58:48.875" style="s2">Finn will watch the rope up top.</p>
<p begin="01:58:49.125" end="01:58:49.835" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:58:49.935" end="01:58:50.635" style="s2">If the rope snaps,</p>
<p begin="01:58:50.825" end="01:58:51.475" style="s2">I&#39;ll go right down</p>
<p begin="01:58:51.495" end="01:58:52.375" style="s2">and drag you back up.</p>
<p begin="01:58:56.895" end="01:58:57.825" style="s2">Around thirty pounds.</p>
<p begin="01:58:58.045" end="01:58:58.795" style="s2">Perfectly intact.</p>
<p begin="01:58:59.005" end="01:58:59.925" style="s2">If we get them back alive,</p>
<p begin="01:59:00.055" end="01:59:01.545" style="s2">each sells for thousands of dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:59:02.265" end="01:59:02.645" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="01:59:02.745" end="01:59:03.575" style="s2">It connects further in.</p>
<p begin="01:59:03.775" end="01:59:04.955" style="s2">There are lots of big fat fish.</p>
<p begin="01:59:05.095" end="01:59:06.015" style="s2">But the roof is very low.</p>
<p begin="01:59:06.135" end="01:59:06.705" style="s2">You won&#39;t fit.</p>
<p begin="01:59:12.435" end="01:59:12.935" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="01:59:13.145" end="01:59:14.005" style="s2">Every so often,</p>
<p begin="01:59:14.135" end="01:59:15.005" style="s2">the current gets stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:59:15.245" end="01:59:16.475" style="s2">We can&#39;t stay right in front.</p>
<p begin="01:59:18.615" end="01:59:18.985" style="s2">Odin,</p>
<p begin="01:59:19.375" end="01:59:20.165" style="s2">stop your sonar for now.</p>
<p begin="01:59:20.475" end="01:59:21.565" style="s2">These fish get spooked easily.</p>
<p begin="01:59:21.645" end="01:59:23.085" style="s2">The louder you are, the more they&#39;ll hide.</p>
<p begin="01:59:23.235" end="01:59:23.865" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="01:59:24.305" end="01:59:25.535" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait outside the reef.</p>
<p begin="01:59:28.295" end="01:59:29.755" style="s2">The downcurrent isn&#39;t constant.</p>
<p begin="01:59:30.635" end="01:59:31.885" style="s2">When waves hit the left crevice,</p>
<p begin="01:59:32.405" end="01:59:33.885" style="s2">water gets sucked down the cave.</p>
<p begin="01:59:34.705" end="01:59:35.545" style="s2">When the waves recede,</p>
<p begin="01:59:35.965" end="01:59:37.265" style="s2">there are five or six seconds of calm.</p>
<p begin="01:59:37.435" end="01:59:38.465" style="s2">That&#39;s only enough time</p>
<p begin="01:59:38.495" end="01:59:39.315" style="s2">to snag one fish.</p>
<p begin="01:59:39.705" end="01:59:40.975" style="s2">Going in is too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:59:41.065" end="01:59:41.965" style="s2">I don&#39;t have to go in.</p>
<p begin="01:59:41.985" end="01:59:43.185" style="s2">Dexter will herd them from behind.</p>
<p begin="01:59:43.295" end="01:59:43.955" style="s2">I&#39;ll guard the front.</p>
<p begin="01:59:44.115" end="01:59:44.785" style="s2">Once the fish come out,</p>
<p begin="01:59:44.925" end="01:59:45.775" style="s2">Slate blocks the deep end,</p>
<p begin="01:59:45.865" end="01:59:46.925" style="s2">and Finn catches them up top.</p>
<p begin="01:59:55.172" end="01:59:56.242" style="s2">First one caught.</p>
<p begin="02:00:00.032" end="02:00:00.732" style="s2">Master!</p>
<p begin="02:00:01.042" end="02:00:02.202" style="s2">It&#39;s stronger than all</p>
<p begin="02:00:02.432" end="02:00:03.602" style="s2">eight of my arms!</p>
<p begin="02:00:14.092" end="02:00:15.192" style="s2">Only a few scales missing.</p>
<p begin="02:00:15.542" end="02:00:16.112" style="s2">Very lively.</p>
<p begin="02:00:16.912" end="02:00:17.482" style="s2">Twenty more,</p>
<p begin="02:00:17.852" end="02:00:19.452" style="s2">and we&#39;ll have enough for the first batch.</p>
<p begin="02:00:20.862" end="02:00:21.682" style="s2">We can&#39;t let the next one</p>
<p begin="02:00:21.712" end="02:00:22.402" style="s2">charge us head-on.</p>
<p begin="02:00:22.492" end="02:00:24.072" style="s2">Dexter, stick to the small holes.</p>
<p begin="02:00:24.232" end="02:00:25.862" style="s2">Leave the big fish in the big holes alone for now.</p>
<p begin="02:00:34.952" end="02:00:36.102" style="s2">The tank&#39;s almost full.</p>
<p begin="02:00:36.402" end="02:00:37.072" style="s2">If we add more,</p>
<p begin="02:00:37.242" end="02:00:38.792" style="s2">they&#39;ll rub against each other and get hurt.</p>
<p begin="02:00:38.942" end="02:00:39.852" style="s2">The SeaRunner&#39;s live well</p>
<p begin="02:00:40.032" end="02:00:41.142" style="s2">can hold another 200 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:00:41.302" end="02:00:41.962" style="s2">I&#39;ll catch five more.</p>
<p begin="02:00:42.032" end="02:00:43.542" style="s2">Once we hit 500 pounds, we&#39;ll stop.</p>
<p begin="02:00:43.922" end="02:00:45.482" style="s2">Three big ships approaching.</p>
<p begin="02:00:46.052" end="02:00:47.202" style="s2">Engines sound frantic.</p>
<p begin="02:00:47.402" end="02:00:48.222" style="s2">It&#39;s those ships</p>
<p begin="02:00:48.262" end="02:00:49.202" style="s2">from earlier today.</p>
<p begin="02:00:52.362" end="02:00:53.022" style="s2">He actually found</p>
<p begin="02:00:53.062" end="02:00:53.852" style="s2">the large groupers.</p>
<p begin="02:00:54.602" end="02:00:56.002" style="s2">He&#39;s got over a dozen in the tank.</p>
<p begin="02:00:56.242" end="02:00:56.992" style="s2">Drop the lines!</p>
<p begin="02:00:57.142" end="02:00:58.312" style="s2">Sink the bait to the holes.</p>
<p begin="02:00:58.552" end="02:00:59.972" style="s2">I bet we can catch &#39;em too.</p>
<p begin="02:00:59.972" end="02:01:01.352" style="s2">Dropping hooks blindly like this</p>
<p begin="02:01:01.462" end="02:01:02.422" style="s2">will just scare the fish</p>
<p begin="02:01:02.582" end="02:01:03.412" style="s2">back into their holes.</p>
<p begin="02:01:03.412" end="02:01:04.152" style="s2">Worse than that.</p>
<p begin="02:01:04.562" end="02:01:05.822" style="s2">The windward side has a downdraft.</p>
<p begin="02:01:06.192" end="02:01:07.472" style="s2">Three ships dropping heavy lines</p>
<p begin="02:01:07.572" end="02:01:08.522" style="s2">their lines will all get sucked</p>
<p begin="02:01:08.562" end="02:01:09.442" style="s2">into the exact same hole.</p>
<p begin="02:01:09.442" end="02:01:10.312" style="s2">Stop the engines!</p>
<p begin="02:01:10.402" end="02:01:11.662" style="s2">We&#39;re about to crash!</p>
<p begin="02:01:13.542" end="02:01:14.162" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="02:01:14.652" end="02:01:14.852" style="s2">Did you</p>
<p begin="02:01:14.992" end="02:01:16.442" style="s2">mess with my lines down there?</p>
<p begin="02:01:16.682" end="02:01:17.232" style="s2">You didn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="02:01:17.272" end="02:01:18.232" style="s2">read the currents right.</p>
<p begin="02:01:18.822" end="02:01:19.852" style="s2">Three ships dropping lines</p>
<p begin="02:01:19.902" end="02:01:20.872" style="s2">into the exact same hole,</p>
<p begin="02:01:21.202" end="02:01:22.172" style="s2">and you blame me?</p>
<p begin="02:01:27.119" end="02:01:28.079" style="s2">At least sixty pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:01:28.429" end="02:01:29.189" style="s2">The value of this one</p>
<p begin="02:01:29.369" end="02:01:30.699" style="s2">is worth several normal groupers.</p>
<p begin="02:01:34.459" end="02:01:35.269" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="02:01:35.449" end="02:01:36.389" style="s2">Even if it&#39;s a whale</p>
<p begin="02:01:36.429" end="02:01:37.109" style="s2">in the bag today,</p>
<p begin="02:01:37.269" end="02:01:38.459" style="s2">I&#39;ll pull it up for you.</p>
<p begin="02:01:43.849" end="02:01:44.599" style="s2">With this one,</p>
<p begin="02:01:44.799" end="02:01:46.169" style="s2">it&#39;s over five hundred pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:01:46.339" end="02:01:47.809" style="s2">That&#39;s enough for the first batch.</p>
<p begin="02:01:50.339" end="02:01:50.969" style="s2">Seal the tank.</p>
<p begin="02:01:51.289" end="02:01:51.869" style="s2">Head back to port.</p>
<p begin="02:01:52.379" end="02:01:53.029" style="s2">Every extra hour</p>
<p begin="02:01:53.069" end="02:01:53.809" style="s2">the fish stay on board,</p>
<p begin="02:01:53.969" end="02:01:54.939" style="s2">their condition drops a bit.</p>
<p begin="02:01:55.739" end="02:01:57.079" style="s2">Three boats caught less</p>
<p begin="02:01:57.109" end="02:01:58.139" style="s2">than his one boat!</p>
<p begin="02:01:58.649" end="02:01:59.469" style="s2">Cut the lines!</p>
<p begin="02:01:59.879" end="02:02:00.969" style="s2">Go fish elsewhere!</p>
<p begin="02:02:01.309" end="02:02:02.509" style="s2">They need 90% alive.</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.049" end="02:02:03.579" style="s2">Our fish here</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.609" end="02:02:04.399" style="s2">are full of hook marks.</p>
<p begin="02:02:04.849" end="02:02:05.869" style="s2">They might not pass.</p>
<p begin="02:02:07.079" end="02:02:08.319" style="s2">If you didn&#39;t call the wrong spot,</p>
<p begin="02:02:08.469" end="02:02:09.399" style="s2">would the lines be tangled?</p>
<p begin="02:02:09.829" end="02:02:10.429" style="s2">Keep talking,</p>
<p begin="02:02:10.729" end="02:02:11.939" style="s2">and I&#39;ll dock your pay!</p>
<p begin="02:02:16.509" end="02:02:18.459" style="s2">Total weight 546 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:02:18.819" end="02:02:20.819" style="s2">Twenty-one with no visible injuries.</p>
<p begin="02:02:21.129" end="02:02:22.599" style="s2">One with minor scale damage.</p>
<p begin="02:02:22.809" end="02:02:24.389" style="s2">100% survival rate.</p>
<p begin="02:02:24.689" end="02:02:25.659" style="s2">A 63-pound</p>
<p begin="02:02:25.709" end="02:02:26.729" style="s2">live red spotted grouper!</p>
<p begin="02:02:27.059" end="02:02:27.989" style="s2">You might not see one of these</p>
<p begin="02:02:28.039" end="02:02:28.939" style="s2">in the city for years.</p>
<p begin="02:02:29.269" end="02:02:29.979" style="s2">For this one alone,</p>
<p begin="02:02:30.069" end="02:02:31.529" style="s2">I&#39;ll offer 12,000 dollars!</p>
<p begin="02:02:33.759" end="02:02:34.369" style="s2">Five dead.</p>
<p begin="02:02:34.469" end="02:02:35.639" style="s2">Nine severely injured.</p>
<p begin="02:02:35.739" end="02:02:37.269" style="s2">Survival rate is under 90%.</p>
<p begin="02:02:37.329" end="02:02:38.369" style="s2">We have to deduct the dead</p>
<p begin="02:02:38.439" end="02:02:39.569" style="s2">and severely injured ones.</p>
<p begin="02:02:39.569" end="02:02:40.749" style="s2">My total weight is more than Morgan&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="02:02:40.889" end="02:02:41.709" style="s2">Why are you deducting it?</p>
<p begin="02:02:41.709" end="02:02:42.529" style="s2">The notice clearly states</p>
<p begin="02:02:42.609" end="02:02:43.649" style="s2">that they want live deep-sea fish,</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.799" end="02:02:44.749" style="s2">not the weight of half-dead ones.</p>
<p begin="02:02:44.789" end="02:02:45.669" style="s2">The first batch&#39;s overall score:</p>
<p begin="02:02:45.749" end="02:02:46.739" style="s2">Morgan is currently in first place.</p>
<p begin="02:02:46.819" end="02:02:47.509" style="s2">Morgan is currently in</p>
<p begin="02:02:47.509" end="02:02:48.709" style="s2">Nice.</p>
<p begin="02:02:49.359" end="02:02:50.409" style="s2">More boats and more fish</p>
<p begin="02:02:50.819" end="02:02:51.819" style="s2">don&#39;t mean better quality.</p>
<p begin="02:02:52.419" end="02:02:53.669" style="s2">You can&#39;t even keep the first batch of fish</p>
<p begin="02:02:53.709" end="02:02:53.999" style="s2">alive,</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.109" end="02:02:55.229" style="s2">and you still want the one-year order?</p>
<p begin="02:02:56.539" end="02:02:58.379" style="s2">This is only the first batch.</p>
<p begin="02:02:59.359" end="02:03:00.769" style="s2">The final results will be based</p>
<p begin="02:03:00.799" end="02:03:01.549" style="s2">on the total value.</p>
<p begin="02:03:02.549" end="02:03:03.739" style="s2">Don&#39;t get ahead of yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:03:04.149" end="02:03:04.809" style="s2">Then make sure your boat</p>
<p begin="02:03:04.839" end="02:03:05.469" style="s2">is fixed up right.</p>
<p begin="02:03:06.089" end="02:03:06.539" style="s2">Next time,</p>
<p begin="02:03:06.999" end="02:03:07.549" style="s2">it might not just be</p>
<p begin="02:03:07.589" end="02:03:08.509" style="s2">a few tangled lines.</p>
<p begin="02:03:11.409" end="02:03:13.109" style="s2">Who left this empty box here?!</p>
<p begin="02:03:13.169" end="02:03:14.309" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="02:03:14.373" end="02:03:15.473" style="s2">These past few days,</p>
<p begin="02:03:15.653" end="02:03:17.053" style="s2">you&#39;re either out at sea</p>
<p begin="02:03:17.243" end="02:03:18.533" style="s2">or watching the tanks.</p>
<p begin="02:03:18.823" end="02:03:20.513" style="s2">No looking at ledgers tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:03:21.103" end="02:03:21.943" style="s2">Eat first.</p>
<p begin="02:03:22.143" end="02:03:22.513" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="02:03:23.003" end="02:03:24.333" style="s2">the first batch for the supply meeting</p>
<p begin="02:03:24.383" end="02:03:24.863" style="s2">just finished.</p>
<p begin="02:03:25.043" end="02:03:26.353" style="s2">If Maris doesn&#39;t settle the accounts,</p>
<p begin="02:03:26.493" end="02:03:27.633" style="s2">she won&#39;t eat in peace.</p>
<p begin="02:03:27.663" end="02:03:28.593" style="s2">Your mom&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="02:03:28.753" end="02:03:29.353" style="s2">The first batch</p>
<p begin="02:03:29.453" end="02:03:30.903" style="s2">sold for 38,000 dollars.</p>
<p begin="02:03:30.993" end="02:03:32.393" style="s2">We&#39;re temporarily in the lead.</p>
<p begin="02:03:32.703" end="02:03:33.773" style="s2">We can rest tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:03:34.143" end="02:03:35.763" style="s2">I knew my boy could do it.</p>
<p begin="02:03:35.943" end="02:03:37.103" style="s2">Ashton has three ships,</p>
<p begin="02:03:37.333" end="02:03:38.363" style="s2">but his catch was a mess.</p>
<p begin="02:03:38.803" end="02:03:39.793" style="s2">Morgan goes down once,</p>
<p begin="02:03:40.073" end="02:03:41.883" style="s2">and brings back a 60-pound grouper</p>
<p begin="02:03:41.973" end="02:03:42.473" style="s2">alive!</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.583" end="02:03:44.183" style="s2">Your dad and I know you&#39;re capable.</p>
<p begin="02:03:44.323" end="02:03:45.713" style="s2">But no matter how much you earn,</p>
<p begin="02:03:45.913" end="02:03:46.693" style="s2">you can&#39;t just keep</p>
<p begin="02:03:46.713" end="02:03:48.153" style="s2">diving into dangerous caves.</p>
<p begin="02:03:48.153" end="02:03:48.533" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="02:03:49.823" end="02:03:50.823" style="s2">the route at Lone Reef,</p>
<p begin="02:03:50.953" end="02:03:51.763" style="s2">I&#39;ve got it figured out.</p>
<p begin="02:03:52.753" end="02:03:53.173" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t risk</p>
<p begin="02:03:53.223" end="02:03:54.183" style="s2">catching one extra fish</p>
<p begin="02:03:54.403" end="02:03:55.443" style="s2">just to get trapped in a cave.</p>
<p begin="02:03:58.863" end="02:03:59.973" style="s2">The organizers think</p>
<p begin="02:04:00.023" end="02:04:01.363" style="s2">three batches take too long.</p>
<p begin="02:04:01.693" end="02:04:03.293" style="s2">In seven days, it changes to</p>
<p begin="02:04:03.343" end="02:04:04.353" style="s2">a final supply match.</p>
<p begin="02:04:04.493" end="02:04:05.333" style="s2">We head out that day</p>
<p begin="02:04:05.403" end="02:04:06.433" style="s2">and return by sunset.</p>
<p begin="02:04:06.493" end="02:04:07.733" style="s2">The total value of the catch</p>
<p begin="02:04:07.843" end="02:04:09.173" style="s2">determines the annual contract.</p>
<p begin="02:04:09.263" end="02:04:10.603" style="s2">Ashton has three big ships.</p>
<p begin="02:04:10.753" end="02:04:12.403" style="s2">Are we really competing on total daily value?</p>
<p begin="02:04:12.463" end="02:04:13.813" style="s2">He has the advantage in numbers.</p>
<p begin="02:04:13.943" end="02:04:14.573" style="s2">So we can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:04:14.573" end="02:04:16.243" style="s2">compete with him on ordinary fish.</p>
<p begin="02:04:16.573" end="02:04:17.333" style="s2">We need to find</p>
<p begin="02:04:17.463" end="02:04:18.993" style="s2">something we can win with fewer ships:</p>
<p begin="02:04:19.153" end="02:04:20.423" style="s2">high-value schools of fish.</p>
<p begin="02:04:20.573" end="02:04:21.303" style="s2">Seven days</p>
<p begin="02:04:21.533" end="02:04:22.833" style="s2">is enough time to inspect the ship,</p>
<p begin="02:04:22.873" end="02:04:24.513" style="s2">stock up on ice, and change the nets.</p>
<p begin="02:04:24.793" end="02:04:26.443" style="s2">I&#39;m going out to sea with you on this last trip.</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.563" end="02:04:27.353" style="s2">How to sort the catch,</p>
<p begin="02:04:27.423" end="02:04:28.153" style="s2">how to keep it fresh—</p>
<p begin="02:04:28.323" end="02:04:29.403" style="s2">I can decide right on the boat.</p>
<p begin="02:04:29.403" end="02:04:30.173" style="s2">The final match.</p>
<p begin="02:04:30.303" end="02:04:32.083" style="s2">The waves and the people won&#39;t be easy to deal with.</p>
<p begin="02:04:32.093" end="02:04:33.703" style="s2">You can receive the goods on shore just fine.</p>
<p begin="02:04:33.703" end="02:04:34.623" style="s2">The last few times,</p>
<p begin="02:04:34.743" end="02:04:36.073" style="s2">you trusted me with the safety rope.</p>
<p begin="02:04:36.173" end="02:04:37.203" style="s2">This time is no different.</p>
<p begin="02:04:37.883" end="02:04:38.963" style="s2">If you dare to go deep,</p>
<p begin="02:04:39.403" end="02:04:40.543" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay and guard the boat.</p>
<p begin="02:04:48.953" end="02:04:49.553" style="s2">Boss says</p>
<p begin="02:04:49.683" end="02:04:50.973" style="s2">you worked the hardest out there.</p>
<p begin="02:04:51.053" end="02:04:52.003" style="s2">This one&#39;s for you.</p>
<p begin="02:04:52.003" end="02:04:53.493" style="s2">But when the final match comes,</p>
<p begin="02:04:53.623" end="02:04:55.123" style="s2">this croc isn&#39;t gonna lose.</p>
<p begin="02:04:55.773" end="02:04:57.733" style="s2">You take the shallows and the boat.</p>
<p begin="02:04:58.143" end="02:04:59.473" style="s2">The open waves are mine.</p>
<p begin="02:05:01.773" end="02:05:02.913" style="s2">Eat up, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="02:05:02.943" end="02:05:04.753" style="s2">Get full before hitting the deep.</p>
<p begin="02:05:05.083" end="02:05:05.513" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="02:05:05.963" end="02:05:06.973" style="s2">I won&#39;t say no to this.</p>
<p begin="02:05:09.183" end="02:05:09.623" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="02:05:09.963" end="02:05:11.793" style="s2">the deep water is getting warmer lately.</p>
<p begin="02:05:11.923" end="02:05:13.173" style="s2">A lot of big fish are moving</p>
<p begin="02:05:13.213" end="02:05:14.373" style="s2">towards the distant canyon.</p>
<p begin="02:05:15.043" end="02:05:16.063" style="s2">I&#39;ve been there.</p>
<p begin="02:05:16.263" end="02:05:17.983" style="s2">Very dense echoes outside the canyon.</p>
<p begin="02:05:18.183" end="02:05:19.323" style="s2">But the underwater currents</p>
<p begin="02:05:19.383" end="02:05:20.503" style="s2">change three times a day.</p>
<p begin="02:05:20.633" end="02:05:22.603" style="s2">Big ships easily get dragged into the reefs.</p>
<p begin="02:05:23.703" end="02:05:24.633" style="s2">High-value fish.</p>
<p begin="02:05:24.963" end="02:05:25.773" style="s2">Complex currents.</p>
<p begin="02:05:25.923" end="02:05:26.983" style="s2">Big ships wouldn&#39;t dare enter.</p>
<p begin="02:05:27.563" end="02:05:28.253" style="s2">This is exactly where</p>
<p begin="02:05:28.263" end="02:05:29.343" style="s2">we&#39;re heading for the final match.</p>
<p begin="02:05:34.903" end="02:05:36.213" style="s2">Morgan thinks he can beat me</p>
<p begin="02:05:36.243" end="02:05:37.293" style="s2">with a few rare fish.</p>
<p begin="02:05:38.033" end="02:05:39.153" style="s2">On the day of the final match,</p>
<p begin="02:05:39.653" end="02:05:41.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll trawl the whole fishing ground empty.</p>
<p begin="02:05:41.703" end="02:05:42.633" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how he competes</p>
<p begin="02:05:42.683" end="02:05:43.543" style="s2">against three ships.</p>
<p begin="02:05:49.270" end="02:05:51.130" style="s2">Return to the dock before sunset.</p>
<p begin="02:05:51.170" end="02:05:52.340" style="s2">Based on the legal catch&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:05:52.340" end="02:05:53.240" style="s2">total market value,</p>
<p begin="02:05:53.350" end="02:05:55.090" style="s2">we will decide the annual supplier.</p>
<p begin="02:05:55.280" end="02:05:56.670" style="s2">Overtime, illegal fishing,</p>
<p begin="02:05:56.750" end="02:05:58.190" style="s2">and catches of unknown origin</p>
<p begin="02:05:58.270" end="02:05:59.870" style="s2">will be strictly disqualified.</p>
<p begin="02:05:59.870" end="02:06:00.510" style="s2">You hear that?</p>
<p begin="02:06:00.770" end="02:06:02.260" style="s2">It&#39;s all about total value.</p>
<p begin="02:06:02.730" end="02:06:04.080" style="s2">Your two old boats combined</p>
<p begin="02:06:04.110" end="02:06:05.440" style="s2">hold less than just one of mine.</p>
<p begin="02:06:05.720" end="02:06:06.790" style="s2">A big cargo hold</p>
<p begin="02:06:06.840" end="02:06:07.280" style="s2">only matters</p>
<p begin="02:06:07.350" end="02:06:08.270" style="s2">if you have fish to fill it.</p>
<p begin="02:06:08.360" end="02:06:09.410" style="s2">Just make sure you don&#39;t return</p>
<p begin="02:06:09.440" end="02:06:10.420" style="s2">with three empty boats.</p>
<p begin="02:06:17.820" end="02:06:18.640" style="s2">Mr. Ashton,</p>
<p begin="02:06:18.900" end="02:06:19.350" style="s2">that orca</p>
<p begin="02:06:19.400" end="02:06:20.530" style="s2">can find the fish first.</p>
<p begin="02:06:20.830" end="02:06:21.680" style="s2">Sailing around like this,</p>
<p begin="02:06:21.860" end="02:06:22.780" style="s2">clueless about the fish,</p>
<p begin="02:06:22.940" end="02:06:23.650" style="s2">is useless!</p>
<p begin="02:06:24.110" end="02:06:25.140" style="s2">I&#39;ve already got people</p>
<p begin="02:06:25.230" end="02:06:26.270" style="s2">tailing the Wavecrest.</p>
<p begin="02:06:27.030" end="02:06:27.830" style="s2">Wherever he goes,</p>
<p begin="02:06:28.510" end="02:06:29.570" style="s2">we&#39;ll take the perimeter</p>
<p begin="02:06:29.730" end="02:06:30.640" style="s2">and intercept the fish.</p>
<p begin="02:06:31.090" end="02:06:32.640" style="s2">We tested both boats last night.</p>
<p begin="02:06:32.940" end="02:06:34.230" style="s2">Oil pressure and temp are good.</p>
<p begin="02:06:34.710" end="02:06:35.570" style="s2">I can&#39;t go with you,</p>
<p begin="02:06:35.860" end="02:06:36.970" style="s2">but I&#39;ll hold down the dock.</p>
<p begin="02:06:38.380" end="02:06:38.800" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="02:06:39.720" end="02:06:40.530" style="s2">Wait for me to get back.</p>
<p begin="02:06:40.710" end="02:06:41.650" style="s2">We&#39;ll open the hold together.</p>
<p begin="02:06:42.010" end="02:06:43.450" style="s2">I don&#39;t care if you win.</p>
<p begin="02:06:43.900" end="02:06:44.960" style="s2">I just want you and Maris</p>
<p begin="02:06:45.010" end="02:06:45.800" style="s2">to come back safe.</p>
<p begin="02:06:46.140" end="02:06:47.200" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Mrs. Fisher.</p>
<p begin="02:06:47.720" end="02:06:48.660" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep an eye on him.</p>
<p begin="02:06:49.850" end="02:06:51.040" style="s2">You hear that, Mom?</p>
<p begin="02:06:51.140" end="02:06:51.990" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a supervisor.</p>
<p begin="02:06:52.150" end="02:06:53.650" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t act up even if I tried.</p>
<p begin="02:07:07.070" end="02:07:08.380" style="s2">The canyon is far from here.</p>
<p begin="02:07:08.500" end="02:07:09.790" style="s2">Ride me to scout ahead.</p>
<p begin="02:07:09.860" end="02:07:11.210" style="s2">The boats can follow behind.</p>
<p begin="02:07:12.570" end="02:07:13.500" style="s2">Just what I had in mind!</p>
<p begin="02:07:13.670" end="02:07:15.130" style="s2">Finn, keep an eye on the boats.</p>
<p begin="02:07:15.220" end="02:07:16.710" style="s2">We&#39;ll meet at the canyon entrance.</p>
<p begin="02:07:17.730" end="02:07:18.520" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, boss.</p>
<p begin="02:07:18.850" end="02:07:20.370" style="s2">If anyone gets close to the Wavecrest,</p>
<p begin="02:07:20.680" end="02:07:21.940" style="s2">I&#39;ll ram them right back.</p>
<p begin="02:07:26.950" end="02:07:28.340" style="s2">Others sail boats to compete.</p>
<p begin="02:07:28.600" end="02:07:30.310" style="s2">Morgan just rides an orca out!</p>
<p begin="02:07:30.570" end="02:07:31.800" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how two boats</p>
<p begin="02:07:31.840" end="02:07:32.530" style="s2">can beat three</p>
<p begin="02:07:32.700" end="02:07:33.830" style="s2">But with a departure like that,</p>
<p begin="02:07:33.960" end="02:07:35.360" style="s2">Ashton&#39;s already lost his edge.</p>
<p begin="02:07:51.480" end="02:07:53.030" style="s2">SeaRunner, keep twenty meters!</p>
<p begin="02:07:53.130" end="02:07:53.830" style="s2">Don&#39;t lose the orca!</p>
<p begin="02:07:54.000" end="02:07:54.810" style="s2">Stay in its wake!</p>
<p begin="02:07:58.030" end="02:07:59.600" style="s2">Boss went ahead to find fish.</p>
<p begin="02:07:59.780" end="02:08:01.410" style="s2">I&#39;ll hold the boat steady!</p>
<p begin="02:08:16.040" end="02:08:16.960" style="s2">Mr. Ashton,</p>
<p begin="02:08:17.180" end="02:08:18.310" style="s2">If we follow the orca</p>
<p begin="02:08:18.440" end="02:08:19.660" style="s2">and stay in its wake,</p>
<p begin="02:08:19.680" end="02:08:21.210" style="s2">the waves will be smaller.</p>
<p begin="02:08:21.210" end="02:08:23.050" style="s2">I&#39;m not eating Morgan&#39;s wake!</p>
<p begin="02:08:23.370" end="02:08:24.840" style="s2">Pass him on the left!</p>
<p begin="02:08:29.740" end="02:08:31.370" style="s2">The net latch came loose!</p>
<p begin="02:08:36.140" end="02:08:37.450" style="s2">Waves are getting rougher ahead.</p>
<p begin="02:08:37.950" end="02:08:38.940" style="s2">How far to the canyon?</p>
<p begin="02:08:38.940" end="02:08:40.330" style="s2">Two deep currents away.</p>
<p begin="02:08:40.530" end="02:08:41.730" style="s2">Left has big waves,</p>
<p begin="02:08:41.850" end="02:08:43.040" style="s2">but no hidden reefs.</p>
<p begin="02:08:43.180" end="02:08:44.310" style="s2">The right looks calm,</p>
<p begin="02:08:44.310" end="02:08:45.840" style="s2">but it&#39;s full of sharp rocks.</p>
<p begin="02:08:46.070" end="02:08:47.010" style="s2">Go left!</p>
<p begin="02:08:47.570" end="02:08:48.940" style="s2">Keep the boat close!</p>
<p begin="02:09:06.960" end="02:09:07.820" style="s2">Hold the throttle!</p>
<p begin="02:09:08.080" end="02:09:09.510" style="s2">There&#39;s flat water after the wave!</p>
<p begin="02:09:09.570" end="02:09:10.940" style="s2">Don&#39;t slow down at the crest!</p>
<p begin="02:09:11.020" end="02:09:12.470" style="s2">Got it, you lead the way!</p>
<p begin="02:09:12.670" end="02:09:13.740" style="s2">Don&#39;t look back at me!</p>
<p begin="02:09:22.620" end="02:09:24.580" style="s2">We&#39;re here. Lots of fish below,</p>
<p begin="02:09:24.880" end="02:09:25.970" style="s2">but the biggest echoes</p>
<p begin="02:09:26.290" end="02:09:27.570" style="s2">aren&#39;t near the surface yet.</p>
<p begin="02:09:27.790" end="02:09:28.570" style="s2">The quieter it is,</p>
<p begin="02:09:28.680" end="02:09:29.890" style="s2">the deeper the big fish hide.</p>
<p begin="02:09:30.340" end="02:09:31.130" style="s2">Don&#39;t cast the net yet.</p>
<p begin="02:09:31.220" end="02:09:32.420" style="s2">Let&#39;s map out the currents first.</p>
<p begin="02:09:42.310" end="02:09:44.020" style="s2">He really found the spot.</p>
<p begin="02:09:44.370" end="02:09:45.560" style="s2">Follow them at full speed!</p>
<p begin="02:09:45.960" end="02:09:47.360" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him cast his net first!</p>
<p begin="02:09:52.557" end="02:09:53.897" style="s2">Surface water enters the canyon.</p>
<p begin="02:09:54.457" end="02:09:55.587" style="s2">Mid-level forms a backflow.</p>
<p begin="02:09:56.447" end="02:09:57.397" style="s2">The bottom flows outwards.</p>
<p begin="02:09:58.497" end="02:09:59.667" style="s2">The fish are in three layers.</p>
<p begin="02:10:00.127" end="02:10:00.947" style="s2">Casting nets blindly</p>
<p begin="02:10:01.077" end="02:10:02.497" style="s2">only catches surface trash fish.</p>
<p begin="02:10:06.617" end="02:10:07.127" style="s2">Master.</p>
<p begin="02:10:07.617" end="02:10:08.847" style="s2">There are big fish at the bottom</p>
<p begin="02:10:08.917" end="02:10:10.027" style="s2">swimming along the reef wall.</p>
<p begin="02:10:10.517" end="02:10:11.437" style="s2">There&#39;s an even bigger</p>
<p begin="02:10:11.507" end="02:10:12.207" style="s2">echo in the middle.</p>
<p begin="02:10:12.477" end="02:10:13.347" style="s2">But it&#39;s hidden deep.</p>
<p begin="02:10:13.937" end="02:10:15.347" style="s2">Left side is all small fish.</p>
<p begin="02:10:15.577" end="02:10:16.437" style="s2">There&#39;s a long line of</p>
<p begin="02:10:16.457" end="02:10:17.457" style="s2">big fish chasing them.</p>
<p begin="02:10:17.927" end="02:10:19.067" style="s2">The strongest echo</p>
<p begin="02:10:19.207" end="02:10:20.427" style="s2">is deep in the canyon.</p>
<p begin="02:10:20.427" end="02:10:21.507" style="s2">Moving very slowly.</p>
<p begin="02:10:22.297" end="02:10:23.487" style="s2">The fast fish outside</p>
<p begin="02:10:23.707" end="02:10:24.837" style="s2">were just chased out by them.</p>
<p begin="02:10:24.917" end="02:10:25.697" style="s2">The truly valuable</p>
<p begin="02:10:25.777" end="02:10:27.197" style="s2">main school hasn&#39;t come out yet.</p>
<p begin="02:10:27.977" end="02:10:29.397" style="s2">We&#39;ll guard the bottom exit first.</p>
<p begin="02:10:30.117" end="02:10:31.537" style="s2">Wait for them to ride the backflow up.</p>
<p begin="02:10:37.277" end="02:10:38.457" style="s2">The sea is full of fish!</p>
<p begin="02:10:38.577" end="02:10:40.257" style="s2">Trawl with three boats side-by-side.</p>
<p begin="02:10:40.387" end="02:10:41.707" style="s2">Sweep the canyon mouth first!</p>
<p begin="02:10:43.217" end="02:10:44.457" style="s2">Morgan hasn&#39;t made a move.</p>
<p begin="02:10:44.777" end="02:10:45.337" style="s2">He&#39;s definitely</p>
<p begin="02:10:45.377" end="02:10:46.437" style="s2">waiting for a bigger catch.</p>
<p begin="02:10:46.757" end="02:10:47.877" style="s2">He only has two boats.</p>
<p begin="02:10:48.557" end="02:10:49.997" style="s2">He&#39;s afraid he can&#39;t hold a full net.</p>
<p begin="02:10:50.547" end="02:10:51.057" style="s2">Ignore him.</p>
<p begin="02:10:51.397" end="02:10:51.717" style="s2">Trawl!</p>
<p begin="02:11:00.007" end="02:11:01.737" style="s2">Over two thousand pounds in the first net!</p>
<p begin="02:11:01.767" end="02:11:02.307" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="02:11:02.647" end="02:11:03.227" style="s2">See that?</p>
<p begin="02:11:03.557" end="02:11:04.827" style="s2">You&#39;re still staring at the water</p>
<p begin="02:11:04.957" end="02:11:06.537" style="s2">while my fish are already on board!</p>
<p begin="02:11:06.787" end="02:11:08.037" style="s2">They&#39;re only $3 a pound,</p>
<p begin="02:11:08.127" end="02:11:08.847" style="s2">just common fish.</p>
<p begin="02:11:09.177" end="02:11:10.657" style="s2">With three boats running full throttle,</p>
<p begin="02:11:11.217" end="02:11:12.387" style="s2">you&#39;d better calculate if this catch</p>
<p begin="02:11:12.437" end="02:11:13.337" style="s2">even covers your gas.</p>
<p begin="02:11:13.637" end="02:11:15.597" style="s2">I&#39;ll still beat you with sheer volume!</p>
<p begin="02:11:15.807" end="02:11:16.827" style="s2">Cast the second net!</p>
<p begin="02:11:18.907" end="02:11:20.207" style="s2">They&#39;ve got nearly five thousand pounds</p>
<p begin="02:11:20.227" end="02:11:20.787" style="s2">in two nets.</p>
<p begin="02:11:21.037" end="02:11:21.907" style="s2">Even if the price is low,</p>
<p begin="02:11:22.087" end="02:11:23.317" style="s2">the total value won&#39;t be small.</p>
<p begin="02:11:23.477" end="02:11:24.017" style="s2">That&#39;s why we</p>
<p begin="02:11:24.057" end="02:11:25.627" style="s2">can&#39;t follow them and catch small fish.</p>
<p begin="02:11:26.317" end="02:11:27.027" style="s2">Ashton&#39;s trawling</p>
<p begin="02:11:27.157" end="02:11:28.347" style="s2">scatters the surface fish.</p>
<p begin="02:11:28.627" end="02:11:30.037" style="s2">The big fish hiding below will instead</p>
<p begin="02:11:30.077" end="02:11:30.847" style="s2">move along the canyon</p>
<p begin="02:11:30.997" end="02:11:31.737" style="s2">towards the exit.</p>
<p begin="02:11:32.937" end="02:11:34.007" style="s2">The big echo is moving.</p>
<p begin="02:11:34.437" end="02:11:35.507" style="s2">They&#39;re coming from the deep</p>
<p begin="02:11:35.637" end="02:11:37.037" style="s2">towards the right reef wall!</p>
<p begin="02:11:46.617" end="02:11:47.697" style="s2">Just what we&#39;ve been waiting for.</p>
<p begin="02:11:48.057" end="02:11:48.337" style="s2">Maris,</p>
<p begin="02:11:48.877" end="02:11:50.247" style="s2">steer the Wavecrest to the right reef.</p>
<p begin="02:11:50.607" end="02:11:51.917" style="s2">Ashton is busy catching small fry.</p>
<p begin="02:11:52.227" end="02:11:53.227" style="s2">The real money-makers</p>
<p begin="02:11:53.257" end="02:11:54.077" style="s2">are ours for the taking!</p>
<p begin="02:12:07.781" end="02:12:08.291" style="s2">Maris,</p>
<p begin="02:12:08.981" end="02:12:10.071" style="s2">Only drop the net halfway.</p>
<p begin="02:12:10.681" end="02:12:11.971" style="s2">The canyon&#39;s backflow</p>
<p begin="02:12:12.001" end="02:12:13.211" style="s2">will seal the other side for us.</p>
<p begin="02:12:25.511" end="02:12:26.011" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="02:12:26.331" end="02:12:28.271" style="s2">these red guys are all in.</p>
<p begin="02:12:35.611" end="02:12:36.911" style="s2">Only four meters left on the right.</p>
<p begin="02:12:36.981" end="02:12:38.371" style="s2">If they keep pulling, we&#39;ll hit the reef!</p>
<p begin="02:12:38.371" end="02:12:39.111" style="s2">Ease off first.</p>
<p begin="02:12:39.171" end="02:12:39.851" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it.</p>
<p begin="02:12:40.031" end="02:12:41.541" style="s2">Orcas, support the stern.</p>
<p begin="02:12:41.631" end="02:12:41.901" style="s2">Finn,</p>
<p begin="02:12:42.051" end="02:12:43.411" style="s2">pull the left net wing out.</p>
<p begin="02:12:49.461" end="02:12:50.661" style="s2">The fish are tiring out.</p>
<p begin="02:12:51.071" end="02:12:52.461" style="s2">Dexter, check the bottom of the net.</p>
<p begin="02:12:52.701" end="02:12:53.351" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the Bigeye</p>
<p begin="02:12:53.421" end="02:12:54.471" style="s2">Snapper slip through the reef.</p>
<p begin="02:13:01.541" end="02:13:02.571" style="s2">They&#39;re all over 20 pounds!</p>
<p begin="02:13:02.641" end="02:13:03.451" style="s2">Red King Snappers!</p>
<p begin="02:13:03.551" end="02:13:04.371" style="s2">The value of this catch</p>
<p begin="02:13:04.461" end="02:13:05.461" style="s2">is already more than Ashton&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:13:05.481" end="02:13:06.771" style="s2">thousands of pounds of trash fish.</p>
<p begin="02:13:09.041" end="02:13:10.011" style="s2">No bruises on the fish.</p>
<p begin="02:13:10.091" end="02:13:11.021" style="s2">Give them separate oxygen.</p>
<p begin="02:13:11.131" end="02:13:11.931" style="s2">Get them to port alive.</p>
<p begin="02:13:12.151" end="02:13:13.211" style="s2">Each is worth thousands.</p>
<p begin="02:13:17.311" end="02:13:17.781" style="s2">They&#39;re catching</p>
<p begin="02:13:17.831" end="02:13:19.271" style="s2">King Snappers and Imperial Groupers!</p>
<p begin="02:13:19.611" end="02:13:21.441" style="s2">One pound of that is worth ten of our trash fish!</p>
<p begin="02:13:21.501" end="02:13:22.061" style="s2">I told you,</p>
<p begin="02:13:22.331" end="02:13:24.041" style="s2">he was waiting for the big deep-water fish.</p>
<p begin="02:13:24.041" end="02:13:24.551" style="s2">Shut up!</p>
<p begin="02:13:25.501" end="02:13:26.921" style="s2">All three boats, pull in the nets!</p>
<p begin="02:13:27.191" end="02:13:28.271" style="s2">Head to the right reef pass!</p>
<p begin="02:13:32.341" end="02:13:33.331" style="s2">Ashton&#39;s heading our way.</p>
<p begin="02:13:33.671" end="02:13:34.411" style="s2">If he keeps this heading,</p>
<p begin="02:13:34.581" end="02:13:35.771" style="s2">he&#39;s gonna cut our net.</p>
<p begin="02:13:37.801" end="02:13:39.291" style="s2">Don&#39;t haul the last batch up just yet.</p>
<p begin="02:13:40.311" end="02:13:41.301" style="s2">Release the right net wing.</p>
<p begin="02:13:41.961" end="02:13:43.411" style="s2">Create a fake exit for the fish.</p>
<p begin="02:13:53.471" end="02:13:54.481" style="s2">He wants to steal our catch?</p>
<p begin="02:13:54.841" end="02:13:55.691" style="s2">Then let him get a taste of</p>
<p begin="02:13:55.721" end="02:13:56.921" style="s2">the backflow at the bottom of the canyon.</p>
<p begin="02:13:59.491" end="02:14:00.361" style="s2">The fish are escaping</p>
<p begin="02:14:00.401" end="02:14:00.991" style="s2">from his net!</p>
<p begin="02:14:01.351" end="02:14:03.341" style="s2">Drop the nets! Catch those King Snappers!</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.731" end="02:14:04.881" style="s2">The water on the right is dark!</p>
<p begin="02:14:05.271" end="02:14:06.181" style="s2">There might be an undertow!</p>
<p begin="02:14:06.991" end="02:14:08.081" style="s2">Let&#39;s test the current first!</p>
<p begin="02:14:08.481" end="02:14:10.541" style="s2">The fish will be gone by then!</p>
<p begin="02:14:10.781" end="02:14:12.441" style="s2">Three boats, seal the exit!</p>
<p begin="02:14:16.911" end="02:14:18.131" style="s2">The nets are drifting to the center!</p>
<p begin="02:14:18.281" end="02:14:19.001" style="s2">If we keep going,</p>
<p begin="02:14:19.231" end="02:14:20.671" style="s2">the three nets will get tangled!</p>
<p begin="02:14:20.941" end="02:14:21.971" style="s2">Speed up and pull away!</p>
<p begin="02:14:22.151" end="02:14:23.581" style="s2">Whoever hauls the fish up first</p>
<p begin="02:14:23.701" end="02:14:24.841" style="s2">gets double the bonus!</p>
<p begin="02:14:26.271" end="02:14:27.361" style="s2">Tighten the left net wing!</p>
<p begin="02:14:27.741" end="02:14:28.711" style="s2">Herd the rest of the fish</p>
<p begin="02:14:28.941" end="02:14:29.701" style="s2">back into Reef Bay!</p>
<p begin="02:14:30.091" end="02:14:31.391" style="s2">Ashton&#39;s nets are perfectly</p>
<p begin="02:14:31.431" end="02:14:33.111" style="s2">blocking the trench exit for us.</p>
<p begin="02:14:37.581" end="02:14:38.761" style="s2">He thought he stole the route.</p>
<p begin="02:14:38.931" end="02:14:39.711" style="s2">But his three nets</p>
<p begin="02:14:39.751" end="02:14:41.171" style="s2">got tangled in the undertow.</p>
<p begin="02:14:41.331" end="02:14:43.421" style="s2">Keep hauling. By the time he realizes,</p>
<p begin="02:14:43.491" end="02:14:45.151" style="s2">his nets will be snagged on the bottom.</p>
<p begin="02:14:49.121" end="02:14:49.901" style="s2">Stop the engine!</p>
<p begin="02:14:50.511" end="02:14:52.511" style="s2">The boats will crash if you keep pulling!</p>
<p begin="02:14:52.511" end="02:14:53.981" style="s2">The fish are right there in the net.</p>
<p begin="02:14:54.141" end="02:14:55.091" style="s2">If we stop now,</p>
<p begin="02:14:55.261" end="02:14:57.161" style="s2">thousands of pounds of King Snapper</p>
<p begin="02:14:57.261" end="02:14:58.171" style="s2">will be gone!</p>
<p begin="02:15:03.001" end="02:15:04.971" style="s2">Ashton, if we don&#39;t cut the nets,</p>
<p begin="02:15:05.201" end="02:15:07.041" style="s2">all three boats will sink here!</p>
<p begin="02:15:09.141" end="02:15:10.221" style="s2">Hoist the nets up!</p>
<p begin="02:15:10.481" end="02:15:11.631" style="s2">As long as we get the fish,</p>
<p begin="02:15:11.801" end="02:15:13.211" style="s2">who cares about the rails!</p>
<p begin="02:15:15.311" end="02:15:16.501" style="s2">The net snagged a reef pillar.</p>
<p begin="02:15:16.671" end="02:15:17.741" style="s2">The cables will snap soon!</p>
<p begin="02:15:17.741" end="02:15:19.521" style="s2">Your nets are snagged! Stop the winch!</p>
<p begin="02:15:19.751" end="02:15:21.081" style="s2">Everyone get away from the stern!</p>
<p begin="02:15:21.081" end="02:15:22.101" style="s2">Quit bluffing me!</p>
<p begin="02:15:22.261" end="02:15:23.451" style="s2">You&#39;re just afraid I&#39;ll steal</p>
<p begin="02:15:23.501" end="02:15:24.041" style="s2">this catch!</p>
<p begin="02:15:24.111" end="02:15:25.231" style="s2">I gave you a warning.</p>
<p begin="02:15:25.461" end="02:15:26.981" style="s2">If you gamble with your boats and lives,</p>
<p begin="02:15:27.211" end="02:15:28.021" style="s2">that&#39;s your funeral.</p>
<p begin="02:15:29.121" end="02:15:30.521" style="s2">Maris, keep hauling.</p>
<p begin="02:15:30.741" end="02:15:32.001" style="s2">Finn, hold the net wings!</p>
<p begin="02:15:32.141" end="02:15:32.921" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them wreck</p>
<p begin="02:15:32.981" end="02:15:33.541" style="s2">our nets!</p>
<p begin="02:15:33.741" end="02:15:35.341" style="s2">Go cut the sub-cable at the stern!</p>
<p begin="02:15:35.381" end="02:15:36.321" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch the main net!</p>
<p begin="02:15:36.321" end="02:15:37.631" style="s2">The cable is at its limit!</p>
<p begin="02:15:38.151" end="02:15:39.641" style="s2">Going there now is suicide!</p>
<p begin="02:15:39.781" end="02:15:41.051" style="s2">You still owe me money.</p>
<p begin="02:15:41.501" end="02:15:41.961" style="s2">If you don&#39;t go,</p>
<p begin="02:15:42.141" end="02:15:43.641" style="s2">I&#39;ll throw you overboard right now!</p>
<p begin="02:15:56.761" end="02:15:57.531" style="s2">My arm!</p>
<p begin="02:15:58.051" end="02:15:59.141" style="s2">Pull me up!</p>
<p begin="02:16:02.871" end="02:16:03.711" style="s2">This is what happens</p>
<p begin="02:16:03.761" end="02:16:04.541" style="s2">when you risk your life</p>
<p begin="02:16:04.591" end="02:16:05.271" style="s2">for Ashton.</p>
<p begin="02:16:07.775" end="02:16:08.515" style="s2">Pull me up!</p>
<p begin="02:16:09.335" end="02:16:10.745" style="s2">The rope&#39;s gonna snap!</p>
<p begin="02:16:17.025" end="02:16:17.985" style="s2">His arm might be broken.</p>
<p begin="02:16:18.305" end="02:16:19.305" style="s2">We gotta head back to port now.</p>
<p begin="02:16:19.305" end="02:16:20.115" style="s2">Ignore him for now.</p>
<p begin="02:16:20.195" end="02:16:21.125" style="s2">The main cable is still holding.</p>
<p begin="02:16:21.285" end="02:16:22.155" style="s2">The King Snapper in the net</p>
<p begin="02:16:22.175" end="02:16:23.035" style="s2">can still be pulled up.</p>
<p begin="02:16:23.035" end="02:16:24.295" style="s2">I almost died out there!</p>
<p begin="02:16:24.965" end="02:16:26.105" style="s2">And you didn&#39;t even bat an eye!</p>
<p begin="02:16:26.275" end="02:16:27.675" style="s2">You&#39;re still alive, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="02:16:27.785" end="02:16:28.635" style="s2">If the fish aren&#39;t on board,</p>
<p begin="02:16:28.765" end="02:16:29.555" style="s2">nobody gets paid!</p>
<p begin="02:16:31.375" end="02:16:33.175" style="s2">If we don&#39;t cut the connecting cable now,</p>
<p begin="02:16:33.325" end="02:16:34.575" style="s2">all three boats are going down!</p>
<p begin="02:16:38.865" end="02:16:40.235" style="s2">Who told you to cut the cable?</p>
<p begin="02:16:40.685" end="02:16:42.905" style="s2">Come back! My fish are still down there!</p>
<p begin="02:16:56.035" end="02:16:56.405" style="s2">Boss!</p>
<p begin="02:16:56.585" end="02:16:58.115" style="s2">The rest of the big fish are in the net!</p>
<p begin="02:16:58.465" end="02:17:00.145" style="s2">I guarded them, none got away.</p>
<p begin="02:17:00.305" end="02:17:01.495" style="s2">Wavecrest is near the safety limit!</p>
<p begin="02:17:01.645" end="02:17:02.465" style="s2">SeaRunner can still take some,</p>
<p begin="02:17:02.555" end="02:17:03.445" style="s2">the last three hundred pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:17:03.445" end="02:17:05.145" style="s2">Transfer the intact live fish to SeaRunner!</p>
<p begin="02:17:05.215" end="02:17:06.175" style="s2">Put the scraped ones on ice!</p>
<p begin="02:17:06.405" end="02:17:07.825" style="s2">Stop immediately once we hit the limit!</p>
<p begin="02:17:10.045" end="02:17:10.735" style="s2">Mr. Ashton!</p>
<p begin="02:17:10.835" end="02:17:12.045" style="s2">The hull is taking on water!</p>
<p begin="02:17:12.045" end="02:17:13.925" style="s2">Get lost! If we don&#39;t pull those fish up,</p>
<p begin="02:17:14.015" end="02:17:15.055" style="s2">nobody&#39;s leaving!</p>
<p begin="02:17:21.585" end="02:17:22.845" style="s2">If you want to hold on to that net of fish</p>
<p begin="02:17:22.875" end="02:17:23.455" style="s2">and sink with it,</p>
<p begin="02:17:24.575" end="02:17:25.875" style="s2">you&#39;re on your own.</p>
<p begin="02:17:35.205" end="02:17:38.275" style="s2">My boat! My fish!</p>
<p begin="02:17:39.085" end="02:17:39.775" style="s2">I warned you.</p>
<p begin="02:17:40.615" end="02:17:41.705" style="s2">You just wouldn&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="02:17:42.215" end="02:17:43.685" style="s2">Gambled your boat and lives for fish.</p>
<p begin="02:17:43.845" end="02:17:44.895" style="s2">You only have yourself to blame.</p>
<p begin="02:17:46.665" end="02:17:47.915" style="s2">The fish hold is at its safety limit.</p>
<p begin="02:17:48.325" end="02:17:49.355" style="s2">We can&#39;t load another pound.</p>
<p begin="02:17:49.955" end="02:17:51.135" style="s2">Reel in the net and head back.</p>
<p begin="02:17:51.705" end="02:17:52.775" style="s2">Let&#39;s take what we&#39;ve earned</p>
<p begin="02:17:53.035" end="02:17:53.985" style="s2">and bring it back safely!</p>
<p begin="02:18:01.579" end="02:18:02.079" style="s2">There&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="02:18:02.129" end="02:18:03.159" style="s2">two hours and forty minutes</p>
<p begin="02:18:03.189" end="02:18:04.229" style="s2">until the sunset deadline.</p>
<p begin="02:18:04.359" end="02:18:05.509" style="s2">A normal return trip takes</p>
<p begin="02:18:05.559" end="02:18:06.069" style="s2">two hours.</p>
<p begin="02:18:06.329" end="02:18:07.059" style="s2">We have enough time.</p>
<p begin="02:18:07.289" end="02:18:08.609" style="s2">But the wind and waves from the west</p>
<p begin="02:18:08.639" end="02:18:09.149" style="s2">are picking up.</p>
<p begin="02:18:13.739" end="02:18:14.019" style="s2">Morgan,</p>
<p begin="02:18:14.189" end="02:18:14.949" style="s2">Ashton&#39;s remaining two boats</p>
<p begin="02:18:14.979" end="02:18:16.019" style="s2">have already been towed back to the dock.</p>
<p begin="02:18:16.159" end="02:18:17.339" style="s2">The legal catch they got before the accident</p>
<p begin="02:18:17.369" end="02:18:17.999" style="s2">is being weighed right now.</p>
<p begin="02:18:18.099" end="02:18:19.939" style="s2">It&#39;s currently estimated at $118,000.</p>
<p begin="02:18:19.939" end="02:18:20.589" style="s2">Our King Snapper and</p>
<p begin="02:18:20.629" end="02:18:21.829" style="s2">Imperial Grouper are definitely worth</p>
<p begin="02:18:21.849" end="02:18:22.269" style="s2">more than his.</p>
<p begin="02:18:22.409" end="02:18:23.529" style="s2">As long as we get back to port on time,</p>
<p begin="02:18:23.639" end="02:18:24.439" style="s2">first place is ours.</p>
<p begin="02:18:24.439" end="02:18:25.379" style="s2">I know you can win.</p>
<p begin="02:18:25.539" end="02:18:26.609" style="s2">But don&#39;t risk it for time.</p>
<p begin="02:18:26.739" end="02:18:27.819" style="s2">Stay out of dangerous channels.</p>
<p begin="02:18:28.009" end="02:18:29.239" style="s2">We won&#39;t gamble, Dad.</p>
<p begin="02:18:29.509" end="02:18:30.439" style="s2">We&#39;ll check the boats first.</p>
<p begin="02:18:30.549" end="02:18:31.559" style="s2">Then decide our route.</p>
<p begin="02:18:39.099" end="02:18:40.769" style="s2">Master, the filter&#39;s clogged.</p>
<p begin="02:18:40.889" end="02:18:41.729" style="s2">If we don&#39;t clear it,</p>
<p begin="02:18:41.889" end="02:18:43.739" style="s2">more water will flood the bilge.</p>
<p begin="02:18:47.449" end="02:18:48.919" style="s2">Both boats are structurally sound.</p>
<p begin="02:18:49.009" end="02:18:50.239" style="s2">Engine temp is normal too.</p>
<p begin="02:18:50.319" end="02:18:52.289" style="s2">West Reef Channel saves 20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="02:18:52.509" end="02:18:53.739" style="s2">But it&#39;s rocky and rough.</p>
<p begin="02:18:53.849" end="02:18:55.259" style="s2">We&#39;ll avoid the narrow inner channel.</p>
<p begin="02:18:55.369" end="02:18:56.689" style="s2">Let&#39;s take the outer deep water line.</p>
<p begin="02:18:56.819" end="02:18:58.409" style="s2">Have the Orcas break the waves ahead.</p>
<p begin="02:18:58.509" end="02:19:00.009" style="s2">Slate, check for hidden reefs.</p>
<p begin="02:19:02.039" end="02:19:02.809" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, boss.</p>
<p begin="02:19:02.909" end="02:19:04.349" style="s2">I&#39;ve got the waves on the right.</p>
<p begin="02:19:04.599" end="02:19:06.099" style="s2">I won&#39;t let them push the boat off course.</p>
<p begin="02:19:07.879" end="02:19:08.879" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight the big waves.</p>
<p begin="02:19:08.979" end="02:19:09.579" style="s2">Follow the boat.</p>
<p begin="02:19:15.539" end="02:19:17.719" style="s2">Master, there&#39;s a floating log ahead.</p>
<p begin="02:19:17.839" end="02:19:19.729" style="s2">The current is pushing it into our path.</p>
<p begin="02:19:20.939" end="02:19:22.179" style="s2">SeaRunner, slow down.</p>
<p begin="02:19:22.299" end="02:19:24.469" style="s2">Wavecrest, steer right 15 degrees.</p>
<p begin="02:19:27.829" end="02:19:28.979" style="s2">Thirty-eight minutes left.</p>
<p begin="02:19:29.479" end="02:19:30.389" style="s2">Keep this speed up,</p>
<p begin="02:19:30.619" end="02:19:31.359" style="s2">and we&#39;ll make it.</p>
<p begin="02:19:36.279" end="02:19:37.839" style="s2">The cooling system is down!</p>
<p begin="02:19:39.879" end="02:19:41.479" style="s2">Only ten minutes left until the deadline.</p>
<p begin="02:19:44.429" end="02:19:46.099" style="s2">Master, it&#39;s not clogged.</p>
<p begin="02:19:46.279" end="02:19:47.819" style="s2">A piece inside is broken.</p>
<p begin="02:19:48.209" end="02:19:49.439" style="s2">I can&#39;t fix it right now.</p>
<p begin="02:19:50.629" end="02:19:51.809" style="s2">Nine and a half minutes left.</p>
<p begin="02:19:52.099" end="02:19:53.339" style="s2">We&#39;re still at least a mile and a half</p>
<p begin="02:19:53.529" end="02:19:54.769" style="s2">away from the finish line.</p>
<p begin="02:19:55.189" end="02:19:56.149" style="s2">Give me the rope.</p>
<p begin="02:19:56.239" end="02:19:57.379" style="s2">The water&#39;s not too rough.</p>
<p begin="02:19:57.579" end="02:19:58.959" style="s2">I can tow the boat back.</p>
<p begin="02:20:05.039" end="02:20:06.569" style="s2">SeaRunner, escort from the rear left.</p>
<p begin="02:20:06.629" end="02:20:07.629" style="s2">Don&#39;t hit our stern directly.</p>
<p begin="02:20:07.719" end="02:20:09.199" style="s2">Help us pull with the auxiliary towline.</p>
<p begin="02:20:14.819" end="02:20:16.789" style="s2">Boss, leave the boat to Finn.</p>
<p begin="02:20:17.029" end="02:20:18.099" style="s2">Nobody is stopping us</p>
<p begin="02:20:18.129" end="02:20:19.159" style="s2">from getting home today!</p>
<p begin="02:20:19.329" end="02:20:20.479" style="s2">Five minutes left</p>
<p begin="02:20:20.559" end="02:20:21.999" style="s2">before the supply meeting ends!</p>
<p begin="02:20:25.079" end="02:20:26.159" style="s2">The towline is holding!</p>
<p begin="02:20:26.299" end="02:20:28.059" style="s2">SeaRunner, shift half a meter out!</p>
<p begin="02:20:28.139" end="02:20:29.929" style="s2">Don&#39;t get caught in Wavecrest&#39;s wake!</p>
<p begin="02:20:36.589" end="02:20:37.819" style="s2">His engine is dead.</p>
<p begin="02:20:38.129" end="02:20:39.579" style="s2">There&#39;s no way he makes it back.</p>
<p begin="02:20:39.609" end="02:20:42.139" style="s2">One minute left until weigh-in closes!</p>
<p begin="02:20:44.979" end="02:20:46.129" style="s2">It&#39;s the Wavecrest!</p>
<p begin="02:20:46.259" end="02:20:47.439" style="s2">An orca is towing</p>
<p begin="02:20:47.479" end="02:20:48.539" style="s2">the Wavecrest back!</p>
<p begin="02:20:48.539" end="02:20:49.479" style="s2">Even a dead engine</p>
<p begin="02:20:49.549" end="02:20:50.579" style="s2">can&#39;t stop Morgan!</p>
<p begin="02:20:51.039" end="02:20:52.319" style="s2">The sea beasts really</p>
<p begin="02:20:52.369" end="02:20:53.779" style="s2">treat him as one of their own!</p>
<p begin="02:20:53.939" end="02:20:56.739" style="s2">Thirty seconds, twenty-nine, twenty-eight!</p>
<p begin="02:20:58.679" end="02:21:00.179" style="s2">Twenty-seven seconds left!</p>
<p begin="02:21:00.179" end="02:21:01.309" style="s2">Wavecrest and SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="02:21:01.379" end="02:21:02.759" style="s2">have returned to port on time!</p>
<p begin="02:21:02.889" end="02:21:04.309" style="s2">All their catches are eligible</p>
<p begin="02:21:04.489" end="02:21:05.369" style="s2">for the weigh-in!</p>
<p begin="02:21:07.959" end="02:21:08.799" style="s2">A filthy beast</p>
<p begin="02:21:08.909" end="02:21:10.339" style="s2">dares to cross me?</p>
<p begin="02:21:10.339" end="02:21:11.139" style="s2">He just didn&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="02:21:11.249" end="02:21:11.969" style="s2">He just didn&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="02:21:12.109" end="02:21:12.879" style="s2">the real good stuff</p>
<p begin="02:21:12.919" end="02:21:13.749" style="s2">to lose to your boats</p>
<p begin="02:21:13.919" end="02:21:14.979" style="s2">full of cheap trash fish.</p>
<p begin="02:21:22.746" end="02:21:24.036" style="s2">All over 20 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:21:24.166" end="02:21:25.146" style="s2">Giant King Snappers!</p>
<p begin="02:21:25.436" end="02:21:26.086" style="s2">Bled properly.</p>
<p begin="02:21:26.226" end="02:21:27.146" style="s2">Packed with enough ice.</p>
<p begin="02:21:27.286" end="02:21:28.626" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay top dollar for these.</p>
<p begin="02:21:29.546" end="02:21:31.116" style="s2">The Imperial Grouper is alive!</p>
<p begin="02:21:31.226" end="02:21:32.216" style="s2">No hook marks on it.</p>
<p begin="02:21:32.276" end="02:21:33.206" style="s2">Don&#39;t unload it yet.</p>
<p begin="02:21:33.346" end="02:21:34.706" style="s2">I&#39;ll buy it as live catch.</p>
<p begin="02:21:35.546" end="02:21:36.196" style="s2">Let me weigh them.</p>
<p begin="02:21:40.746" end="02:21:41.376" style="s2">King Snappers.</p>
<p begin="02:21:41.506" end="02:21:43.096" style="s2">1,560 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:21:43.216" end="02:21:45.186" style="s2">Bigeye Snappers, 720 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:21:45.366" end="02:21:46.956" style="s2">Imperial Grouper and other live fish.</p>
<p begin="02:21:47.086" end="02:21:48.046" style="s2">210 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:21:48.046" end="02:21:49.526" style="s2">King Snappers at $78 a pound.</p>
<p begin="02:21:49.606" end="02:21:50.236" style="s2">That&#39;s a total of</p>
<p begin="02:21:50.386" end="02:21:52.246" style="s2">$121,680.</p>
<p begin="02:21:52.246" end="02:21:54.286" style="s2">Bigeye Snappers at $32 a pound.</p>
<p begin="02:21:54.336" end="02:21:56.046" style="s2">That&#39;s $23,040.</p>
<p begin="02:21:56.046" end="02:21:57.356" style="s2">Imperial Grouper as live catch,</p>
<p begin="02:21:57.496" end="02:21:58.546" style="s2">$190 a pound.</p>
<p begin="02:21:58.596" end="02:22:00.206" style="s2">That&#39;s $39,900.</p>
<p begin="02:22:00.206" end="02:22:00.756" style="s2">Total weight,</p>
<p begin="02:22:00.836" end="02:22:02.156" style="s2">2,490 pounds.</p>
<p begin="02:22:02.256" end="02:22:02.816" style="s2">Total payout,</p>
<p begin="02:22:02.916" end="02:22:04.916" style="s2">$184,620.</p>
<p begin="02:22:05.006" end="02:22:05.646" style="s2">$20.</p>
<p begin="02:22:07.446" end="02:22:08.386" style="s2">Ashton&#39;s ten thousand pounds</p>
<p begin="02:22:08.416" end="02:22:09.166" style="s2">of common fish only made</p>
<p begin="02:22:09.226" end="02:22:10.286" style="s2">$118,000.</p>
<p begin="02:22:10.436" end="02:22:11.676" style="s2">Morgan&#39;s two thousand pounds of prime catch</p>
<p begin="02:22:11.716" end="02:22:13.076" style="s2">sold for over 180,000!</p>
<p begin="02:22:13.076" end="02:22:14.416" style="s2">Now I get it.</p>
<p begin="02:22:14.726" end="02:22:16.426" style="s2">More boats and fish mean nothing.</p>
<p begin="02:22:16.566" end="02:22:17.806" style="s2">Without the valuable stuff,</p>
<p begin="02:22:17.856" end="02:22:18.526" style="s2">a day&#39;s work</p>
<p begin="02:22:18.586" end="02:22:20.116" style="s2">is just paying for gas.</p>
<p begin="02:22:23.066" end="02:22:24.406" style="s2">I had over ten thousand pounds!</p>
<p begin="02:22:24.916" end="02:22:25.586" style="s2">How did I lose to</p>
<p begin="02:22:25.616" end="02:22:26.346" style="s2">his two thousand?!</p>
<p begin="02:22:26.506" end="02:22:27.976" style="s2">Your catch is mostly jack mackerel,</p>
<p begin="02:22:28.146" end="02:22:28.866" style="s2">small abalones,</p>
<p begin="02:22:29.016" end="02:22:30.076" style="s2">and common sea bass.</p>
<p begin="02:22:30.246" end="02:22:31.536" style="s2">Morgan brought Giant King Snappers,</p>
<p begin="02:22:31.636" end="02:22:33.396" style="s2">live Bigeye Snappers, and Imperial Grouper.</p>
<p begin="02:22:33.566" end="02:22:34.716" style="s2">The prices aren&#39;t even comparable.</p>
<p begin="02:22:34.716" end="02:22:36.046" style="s2">Per the Supply Meeting rules,</p>
<p begin="02:22:36.466" end="02:22:37.676" style="s2">Morgan&#39;s legal catch</p>
<p begin="02:22:37.806" end="02:22:38.746" style="s2">has a total value</p>
<p begin="02:22:38.786" end="02:22:40.036" style="s2">of 184,000</p>
<p begin="02:22:40.126" end="02:22:41.276" style="s2">and 620 dollars.</p>
<p begin="02:22:41.366" end="02:22:42.266" style="s2">He takes first place.</p>
<p begin="02:22:43.896" end="02:22:45.076" style="s2">The annual Luna Cove</p>
<p begin="02:22:45.136" end="02:22:46.506" style="s2">deep-sea supply rights</p>
<p begin="02:22:46.686" end="02:22:48.166" style="s2">go to Morgan and Maris&#39;</p>
<p begin="02:22:48.406" end="02:22:49.676" style="s2">purchasing station!</p>
<p begin="02:22:49.776" end="02:22:50.546" style="s2">Awesome!</p>
<p begin="02:22:51.006" end="02:22:52.186" style="s2">That&#39;s my boy!</p>
<p begin="02:22:52.326" end="02:22:52.866" style="s2">Ashton has</p>
<p begin="02:22:52.896" end="02:22:54.666" style="s2">three big boats chasing fish around.</p>
<p begin="02:22:54.786" end="02:22:56.206" style="s2">Morgan used two old boats</p>
<p begin="02:22:56.236" end="02:22:57.846" style="s2">and still got the best catch!</p>
<p begin="02:22:57.846" end="02:22:59.196" style="s2">Winning isn&#39;t as important</p>
<p begin="02:22:59.256" end="02:22:59.956" style="s2">as your safety.</p>
<p begin="02:23:00.626" end="02:23:01.396" style="s2">Don&#39;t ever cut it</p>
<p begin="02:23:01.566" end="02:23:03.346" style="s2">that close again.</p>
<p begin="02:23:03.406" end="02:23:03.986" style="s2">Mom can&#39;t take it.</p>
<p begin="02:23:04.326" end="02:23:04.606" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="02:23:05.326" end="02:23:05.946" style="s2">the engine just</p>
<p begin="02:23:06.036" end="02:23:07.016" style="s2">acted up this time.</p>
<p begin="02:23:07.126" end="02:23:08.386" style="s2">Whatever needs replacing on the boat,</p>
<p begin="02:23:08.516" end="02:23:09.116" style="s2">I&#39;ll replace it all.</p>
<p begin="02:23:09.256" end="02:23:10.286" style="s2">I won&#39;t make you wait like that again.</p>
<p begin="02:23:11.076" end="02:23:12.096" style="s2">You tracked the fish down,</p>
<p begin="02:23:12.266" end="02:23:13.036" style="s2">and you led us all</p>
<p begin="02:23:13.166" end="02:23:14.006" style="s2">through the rough seas.</p>
<p begin="02:23:14.206" end="02:23:15.736" style="s2">We truly earned this win.</p>
<p begin="02:23:15.746" end="02:23:16.656" style="s2">Without you on the lead boat,</p>
<p begin="02:23:16.876" end="02:23:17.826" style="s2">watching the catch and time,</p>
<p begin="02:23:18.266" end="02:23:19.136" style="s2">even riding an orca back,</p>
<p begin="02:23:19.546" end="02:23:21.046" style="s2">I&#39;d just see a boat of spoiled fish.</p>
<p begin="02:23:30.313" end="02:23:31.533" style="s2">We told him to stop the winch,</p>
<p begin="02:23:31.653" end="02:23:32.443" style="s2">but he refused!</p>
<p begin="02:23:32.913" end="02:23:34.083" style="s2">Even after the stern took on water,</p>
<p begin="02:23:34.363" end="02:23:35.843" style="s2">he forced us to haul the catch in!</p>
<p begin="02:23:36.643" end="02:23:38.023" style="s2">He&#39;s the one who pushed Giles</p>
<p begin="02:23:38.103" end="02:23:39.253" style="s2">to go cut the steel cable!</p>
<p begin="02:23:39.423" end="02:23:41.143" style="s2">That&#39;s why the snapped cable knocked him off!</p>
<p begin="02:23:41.403" end="02:23:42.543" style="s2">You took my pay,</p>
<p begin="02:23:43.073" end="02:23:44.613" style="s2">and now you all turn on me!</p>
<p begin="02:23:44.723" end="02:23:46.073" style="s2">We earned our pay by working hard!</p>
<p begin="02:23:46.463" end="02:23:47.613" style="s2">Not by selling our lives!</p>
<p begin="02:23:49.873" end="02:23:50.843" style="s2">Your main vessel sank.</p>
<p begin="02:23:50.893" end="02:23:51.853" style="s2">The remaining two fishing boats</p>
<p begin="02:23:51.883" end="02:23:52.863" style="s2">are impounded for inspection.</p>
<p begin="02:23:52.943" end="02:23:53.633" style="s2">You forcefully dragged</p>
<p begin="02:23:53.673" end="02:23:54.753" style="s2">a snagged net in the reef area,</p>
<p begin="02:23:54.853" end="02:23:56.023" style="s2">refused an emergency shutdown,</p>
<p begin="02:23:56.143" end="02:23:57.023" style="s2">caused a ship collision,</p>
<p begin="02:23:57.143" end="02:23:58.343" style="s2">and resulted in personal injuries.</p>
<p begin="02:23:58.463" end="02:24:00.373" style="s2">You bear full responsibility for the accident.</p>
<p begin="02:24:00.373" end="02:24:01.713" style="s2">I already lost one ship,</p>
<p begin="02:24:02.143" end="02:24:03.513" style="s2">and you&#39;re taking the other two?!</p>
<p begin="02:24:03.633" end="02:24:05.203" style="s2">The sunken ship might obstruct the channel,</p>
<p begin="02:24:05.303" end="02:24:06.723" style="s2">and we need to survey the damaged reef.</p>
<p begin="02:24:07.103" end="02:24:08.373" style="s2">Medical bills, towing fees,</p>
<p begin="02:24:08.573" end="02:24:10.173" style="s2">and clearance costs will all be calculated</p>
<p begin="02:24:10.273" end="02:24:11.563" style="s2">once the investigation is complete.</p>
<p begin="02:24:11.853" end="02:24:12.953" style="s2">You gave us the wrong route!</p>
<p begin="02:24:13.313" end="02:24:14.673" style="s2">That&#39;s why I lost my ship!</p>
<p begin="02:24:16.513" end="02:24:17.973" style="s2">I gave the route, sure.</p>
<p begin="02:24:18.353" end="02:24:19.313" style="s2">But forcing the net down</p>
<p begin="02:24:19.333" end="02:24:20.283" style="s2">and making us haul the rope,</p>
<p begin="02:24:20.483" end="02:24:21.713" style="s2">those were your own orders!</p>
<p begin="02:24:21.913" end="02:24:23.323" style="s2">How dare you talk back!</p>
<p begin="02:24:23.743" end="02:24:25.783" style="s2">One, just to steal what&#39;s mine,</p>
<p begin="02:24:25.973" end="02:24:27.423" style="s2">sold his life to Ashton.</p>
<p begin="02:24:27.593" end="02:24:29.403" style="s2">The other gambled his crew&#39;s lives for fish.</p>
<p begin="02:24:29.983" end="02:24:31.673" style="s2">Now you&#39;re at each other&#39;s throats,</p>
<p begin="02:24:32.303" end="02:24:33.313" style="s2">and you both deserve it.</p>
<p begin="02:24:34.013" end="02:24:37.643" style="s2">Ship&#39;s gone, money&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="02:24:37.853" end="02:24:39.343" style="s2">Now even my arm is broken.</p>
<p begin="02:24:40.443" end="02:24:41.483" style="s2">When you swapped the contracts</p>
<p begin="02:24:41.523" end="02:24:43.163" style="s2">and took my $120,000,</p>
<p begin="02:24:43.553" end="02:24:44.863" style="s2">you thought you could steal anything.</p>
<p begin="02:24:46.733" end="02:24:47.873" style="s2">Now the boat is back to me,</p>
<p begin="02:24:47.903" end="02:24:49.283" style="s2">and you still owe $22,000</p>
<p begin="02:24:49.413" end="02:24:50.253" style="s2">plus the repair fees.</p>
<p begin="02:24:50.403" end="02:24:51.333" style="s2">This is exactly the outcome</p>
<p begin="02:24:51.363" end="02:24:52.083" style="s2">you chose for yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:24:54.063" end="02:24:56.203" style="s2">Don&#39;t think winning once, Morgan,</p>
<p begin="02:24:56.353" end="02:24:57.663" style="s2">means you&#39;ll always be on top!</p>
<p begin="02:24:58.143" end="02:24:59.863" style="s2">You lost all three of your ships.</p>
<p begin="02:25:00.023" end="02:25:01.913" style="s2">Better think about how to pay up first.</p>
<p begin="02:25:09.743" end="02:25:11.203" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t towed the boat today,</p>
<p begin="02:25:11.623" end="02:25:12.783" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t have made the weigh-in.</p>
<p begin="02:25:13.433" end="02:25:14.583" style="s2">The biggest piece goes to you.</p>
<p begin="02:25:14.903" end="02:25:16.583" style="s2">Next time the sea gets rough,</p>
<p begin="02:25:16.873" end="02:25:18.413" style="s2">I&#39;ll clear the way for you again.</p>
<p begin="02:25:21.873" end="02:25:23.043" style="s2">Hey, eight-legs!</p>
<p begin="02:25:23.183" end="02:25:24.703" style="s2">We all did our part today.</p>
<p begin="02:25:24.803" end="02:25:26.043" style="s2">You trying to take extra?</p>
<p begin="02:25:26.043" end="02:25:27.663" style="s2">I was just checking for the master,</p>
<p begin="02:25:27.753" end="02:25:28.873" style="s2">to see if it&#39;s fresh.</p>
<p begin="02:25:29.073" end="02:25:30.463" style="s2">Take your time eating.</p>
<p begin="02:25:30.673" end="02:25:31.743" style="s2">Shelly eats first!</p>
<p begin="02:25:31.943" end="02:25:33.153" style="s2">Morgan eats too!</p>
<p begin="02:25:34.503" end="02:25:35.363" style="s2">We won today,</p>
<p begin="02:25:35.623" end="02:25:36.803" style="s2">so let&#39;s feast together!</p>
<p begin="02:25:38.777" end="02:25:40.197" style="s2">Three city restaurants and two</p>
<p begin="02:25:40.297" end="02:25:41.037" style="s2">seafood markets</p>
<p begin="02:25:41.157" end="02:25:42.457" style="s2">for their annual deep-sea supply</p>
<p begin="02:25:42.537" end="02:25:43.817" style="s2">will prioritize sourcing from you.</p>
<p begin="02:25:43.887" end="02:25:45.247" style="s2">Prices will vary by quality.</p>
<p begin="02:25:45.327" end="02:25:46.747" style="s2">No strict quotas are required.</p>
<p begin="02:25:46.747" end="02:25:48.507" style="s2">In case of typhoons or fish runs,</p>
<p begin="02:25:48.637" end="02:25:49.847" style="s2">supply delays are acceptable.</p>
<p begin="02:25:50.057" end="02:25:51.777" style="s2">Live and chilled goods inspected separately.</p>
<p begin="02:25:51.887" end="02:25:52.997" style="s2">All these conditions are written</p>
<p begin="02:25:53.037" end="02:25:54.377" style="s2">exactly as discussed yesterday.</p>
<p begin="02:25:54.377" end="02:25:55.007" style="s2">No problem.</p>
<p begin="02:25:55.477" end="02:25:57.217" style="s2">Please review and sign here.</p>
<p begin="02:25:57.707" end="02:25:58.547" style="s2">The catch from the sea</p>
<p begin="02:25:58.607" end="02:25:59.387" style="s2">was brought in by you.</p>
<p begin="02:25:59.837" end="02:26:01.307" style="s2">Let&#39;s sign this together.</p>
<p begin="02:26:03.747" end="02:26:04.577" style="s2">The contract is in effect.</p>
<p begin="02:26:04.667" end="02:26:05.857" style="s2">The $100,000 deposit</p>
<p begin="02:26:05.917" end="02:26:06.677" style="s2">will hit your account today.</p>
<p begin="02:26:06.677" end="02:26:08.727" style="s2">Let&#39;s head home for dinner now.</p>
<p begin="02:26:09.297" end="02:26:10.247" style="s2">I made some ribs.</p>
<p begin="02:26:10.767" end="02:26:11.187" style="s2">Today,</p>
<p begin="02:26:11.377" end="02:26:12.207" style="s2">nobody is allowed</p>
<p begin="02:26:12.237" end="02:26:13.697" style="s2">to talk business at the table.</p>
<p begin="02:26:13.877" end="02:26:15.397" style="s2">From Morgan getting kicked off a boat,</p>
<p begin="02:26:15.487" end="02:26:16.807" style="s2">to now securing annual orders</p>
<p begin="02:26:16.957" end="02:26:18.037" style="s2">for multiple restaurants</p>
<p begin="02:26:18.177" end="02:26:19.177" style="s2">it&#39;s only been a few months.</p>
<p begin="02:26:19.257" end="02:26:20.647" style="s2">Who can say my son can&#39;t survive</p>
<p begin="02:26:20.667" end="02:26:21.577" style="s2">without the SeaRunner?</p>
<p begin="02:26:21.577" end="02:26:23.567" style="s2">Dad, if you keep praising me,</p>
<p begin="02:26:23.797" end="02:26:24.297" style="s2">they won&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="02:26:24.337" end="02:26:25.087" style="s2">dare to leave.</p>
<p begin="02:26:31.647" end="02:26:33.237" style="s2">You were out at sea for two days.</p>
<p begin="02:26:33.337" end="02:26:34.717" style="s2">Get your strength back first.</p>
<p begin="02:26:35.247" end="02:26:37.147" style="s2">The money isn&#39;t going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="02:26:39.657" end="02:26:40.407" style="s2">Listen to her.</p>
<p begin="02:26:40.547" end="02:26:41.607" style="s2">No business talk today.</p>
<p begin="02:26:42.097" end="02:26:42.937" style="s2">Yesterday you stayed at</p>
<p begin="02:26:42.957" end="02:26:43.707" style="s2">the helm the whole time,</p>
<p begin="02:26:43.797" end="02:26:44.957" style="s2">didn&#39;t even touch your lunchbox.</p>
<p begin="02:26:45.867" end="02:26:46.307" style="s2">Eat up!</p>
<p begin="02:26:48.807" end="02:26:50.247" style="s2">You noticed I didn&#39;t eat?</p>
<p begin="02:26:50.317" end="02:26:51.627" style="s2">You watched two boats for me.</p>
<p begin="02:26:51.927" end="02:26:52.927" style="s2">The least I could do is notice</p>
<p begin="02:26:52.977" end="02:26:53.827" style="s2">if you&#39;re hungry or not.</p>
<p begin="02:26:57.747" end="02:26:58.007" style="s2">The catch</p>
<p begin="02:26:58.137" end="02:26:59.957" style="s2">brought in $184,620.</p>
<p begin="02:27:00.017" end="02:27:01.327" style="s2">Plus the $100,000 deposit,</p>
<p begin="02:27:01.437" end="02:27:02.937" style="s2">after deducting gas, ice, labor,</p>
<p begin="02:27:03.137" end="02:27:03.897" style="s2">and engine repairs,</p>
<p begin="02:27:03.987" end="02:27:05.367" style="s2">we have over $200,000 left.</p>
<p begin="02:27:05.367" end="02:27:06.457" style="s2">Wavecrest and SeaRunner</p>
<p begin="02:27:06.497" end="02:27:07.097" style="s2">are fine for now.</p>
<p begin="02:27:07.607" end="02:27:08.137" style="s2">But for a real</p>
<p begin="02:27:08.227" end="02:27:09.037" style="s2">deep-sea fish run,</p>
<p begin="02:27:09.387" end="02:27:10.647" style="s2">they lack capacity and power.</p>
<p begin="02:27:11.147" end="02:27:12.017" style="s2">City Harbor Brokers</p>
<p begin="02:27:12.047" end="02:27:13.157" style="s2">has a used deep-sea boat.</p>
<p begin="02:27:13.217" end="02:27:14.467" style="s2">The owner wants to change careers.</p>
<p begin="02:27:14.617" end="02:27:16.207" style="s2">The price is $280,000.</p>
<p begin="02:27:16.337" end="02:27:17.847" style="s2">We can put down $180,000,</p>
<p begin="02:27:17.997" end="02:27:18.527" style="s2">and pay the rest</p>
<p begin="02:27:18.677" end="02:27:20.377" style="s2">in installments from the annual orders.</p>
<p begin="02:27:20.377" end="02:27:21.637" style="s2">What about the hull and engine?</p>
<p begin="02:27:21.717" end="02:27:22.777" style="s2">What condition are they in?</p>
<p begin="02:27:23.437" end="02:27:24.867" style="s2">They agreed to lift it to check the hull.</p>
<p begin="02:27:24.997" end="02:27:26.237" style="s2">We can also take it for a test run.</p>
<p begin="02:27:26.547" end="02:27:28.647" style="s2">If we don&#39;t like it, we don&#39;t pay a cent.</p>
<p begin="02:27:29.947" end="02:27:31.107" style="s2">Let&#39;s go see it, then.</p>
<p begin="02:27:31.187" end="02:27:32.547" style="s2">If it&#39;s safe for the deep sea,</p>
<p begin="02:27:32.737" end="02:27:33.707" style="s2">and the price is right,</p>
<p begin="02:27:34.307" end="02:27:35.007" style="s2">we&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="02:27:39.637" end="02:27:40.767" style="s2">The hull&#39;s been patched twice,</p>
<p begin="02:27:40.927" end="02:27:42.067" style="s2">but the main keel is fine.</p>
<p begin="02:27:42.757" end="02:27:43.817" style="s2">The tail shaft is straight too.</p>
<p begin="02:27:44.047" end="02:27:45.087" style="s2">Just the cooling pipes and</p>
<p begin="02:27:45.127" end="02:27:46.447" style="s2">two bearings need replacing.</p>
<p begin="02:27:46.827" end="02:27:47.937" style="s2">Test it out after replacing,</p>
<p begin="02:27:48.007" end="02:27:48.687" style="s2">keep up the maintenance,</p>
<p begin="02:27:48.807" end="02:27:49.947" style="s2">and it&#39;s good for the open sea.</p>
<p begin="02:27:49.947" end="02:27:51.167" style="s2">$280,000.</p>
<p begin="02:27:51.297" end="02:27:51.897" style="s2">The anchor winch</p>
<p begin="02:27:51.937" end="02:27:53.137" style="s2">and backup generator stay.</p>
<p begin="02:27:53.217" end="02:27:54.307" style="s2">I won&#39;t go any lower.</p>
<p begin="02:27:54.307" end="02:27:55.907" style="s2">We&#39;ll pay $180,000 upfront.</p>
<p begin="02:27:55.997" end="02:27:57.047" style="s2">The remaining $100,000</p>
<p begin="02:27:57.097" end="02:27:57.987" style="s2">will be paid in installments.</p>
<p begin="02:27:58.097" end="02:27:59.027" style="s2">Monthly payments and penalty</p>
<p begin="02:27:59.087" end="02:28:00.337" style="s2">terms must be in the contract.</p>
<p begin="02:28:00.337" end="02:28:01.477" style="s2">We agreed on it yesterday.</p>
<p begin="02:28:01.697" end="02:28:02.647" style="s2">We&#39;ll go by the contract.</p>
<p begin="02:28:11.017" end="02:28:11.657" style="s2">The boat&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="02:28:11.797" end="02:28:13.097" style="s2">Replace the cooling pipes and bearings,</p>
<p begin="02:28:13.567" end="02:28:14.797" style="s2">and restock the life-saving equipment.</p>
<p begin="02:28:14.967" end="02:28:16.217" style="s2">$180,000 today.</p>
<p begin="02:28:19.777" end="02:28:20.617" style="s2">Wavecrest is</p>
<p begin="02:28:20.647" end="02:28:21.637" style="s2">the one you earned yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:28:21.967" end="02:28:23.307" style="s2">SeaRunner is the one you won back.</p>
<p begin="02:28:24.657" end="02:28:25.577" style="s2">And this deep-sea boat</p>
<p begin="02:28:26.027" end="02:28:26.787" style="s2">is the one you and Maris</p>
<p begin="02:28:26.827" end="02:28:27.767" style="s2">got by expanding the business</p>
<p begin="02:28:27.807" end="02:28:28.117" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="02:28:29.437" end="02:28:30.137" style="s2">Hold onto it.</p>
<p begin="02:28:30.977" end="02:28:31.787" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Dad.</p>
<p begin="02:28:32.557" end="02:28:33.327" style="s2">Our family&#39;s fleet</p>
<p begin="02:28:33.727" end="02:28:34.747" style="s2">will only get bigger.</p>
<p begin="02:28:38.327" end="02:28:39.547" style="s2">Boss, this boat</p>
<p begin="02:28:39.607" end="02:28:40.847" style="s2">is way bigger than before!</p>
<p begin="02:28:41.027" end="02:28:42.027" style="s2">Even thousands of pounds</p>
<p begin="02:28:42.067" end="02:28:43.677" style="s2">of fish won&#39;t sink us now!</p>
<p begin="02:28:49.747" end="02:28:51.077" style="s2">Giles Barrett stole one</p>
<p begin="02:28:51.127" end="02:28:51.837" style="s2">of Morgan&#39;s boats.</p>
<p begin="02:28:51.967" end="02:28:52.987" style="s2">Morgan rode his croc</p>
<p begin="02:28:53.027" end="02:28:53.977" style="s2">and built up from scratch.</p>
<p begin="02:28:54.157" end="02:28:55.807" style="s2">Now, Wavecrest, SeaRunner,</p>
<p begin="02:28:56.027" end="02:28:56.637" style="s2">and Windrider.</p>
<p begin="02:28:56.727" end="02:28:58.017" style="s2">He&#39;s got three boats now!</p>
<p begin="02:28:58.907" end="02:28:59.677" style="s2">The boat is bigger,</p>
<p begin="02:29:00.277" end="02:29:01.597" style="s2">and you&#39;re going further out.</p>
<p begin="02:29:02.117" end="02:29:03.007" style="s2">Before setting sail,</p>
<p begin="02:29:03.157" end="02:29:04.177" style="s2">everything that needs checking</p>
<p begin="02:29:04.217" end="02:29:05.277" style="s2">must be thoroughly checked.</p>
<p begin="02:29:05.297" end="02:29:05.567" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="02:29:06.167" end="02:29:07.027" style="s2">before Windrider&#39;s first</p>
<p begin="02:29:07.077" end="02:29:07.657" style="s2">official voyage,</p>
<p begin="02:29:08.007" end="02:29:08.827" style="s2">I&#39;ll have Dad and the guys</p>
<p begin="02:29:08.857" end="02:29:09.677" style="s2">check it three times.</p>
<p begin="02:29:10.327" end="02:29:11.047" style="s2">With me watching,</p>
<p begin="02:29:11.267" end="02:29:12.487" style="s2">if it&#39;s missing one spare rope,</p>
<p begin="02:29:12.577" end="02:29:13.497" style="s2">he&#39;s not leaving port.</p>
<p begin="02:29:17.667" end="02:29:18.427" style="s2">You sail the boat.</p>
<p begin="02:29:18.697" end="02:29:19.877" style="s2">I handle the books and orders.</p>
<p begin="02:29:20.877" end="02:29:22.157" style="s2">To head out to the deep sea,</p>
<p begin="02:29:22.357" end="02:29:23.707" style="s2">get gas money from me first.</p>
<p begin="02:29:24.677" end="02:29:26.037" style="s2">Then whenever I return safely,</p>
<p begin="02:29:26.257" end="02:29:27.017" style="s2">I&#39;ll settle up with you.</p>
<p begin="02:29:33.347" end="02:29:35.047" style="s2">Boss, the new boat is home!</p>
<p begin="02:29:37.881" end="02:29:39.111" style="s2">One at a time.</p>
<p begin="02:29:39.491" end="02:29:40.731" style="s2">The new boat&#39;s home today.</p>
<p begin="02:29:40.961" end="02:29:42.011" style="s2">And no cheating!</p>
<p begin="02:29:42.341" end="02:29:43.731" style="s2">I&#39;m just helping the boss</p>
<p begin="02:29:43.781" end="02:29:44.781" style="s2">see if the fish is fresh.</p>
<p begin="02:29:45.111" end="02:29:46.351" style="s2">Take your time checking.</p>
<p begin="02:29:46.691" end="02:29:48.181" style="s2">I&#39;ll just go ahead and eat.</p>
<p begin="02:29:51.181" end="02:29:52.711" style="s2">This little guy even knows</p>
<p begin="02:29:52.741" end="02:29:53.881" style="s2">to save a bite for me.</p>
<p begin="02:29:57.441" end="02:29:59.841" style="s2">Dad, the Windrider won&#39;t sail tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="02:29:59.891" end="02:30:01.861" style="s2">We&#39;re testing the backup pump, life raft,</p>
<p begin="02:30:01.941" end="02:30:03.311" style="s2">and radios all over again first.</p>
<p begin="02:30:03.581" end="02:30:04.951" style="s2">Now that sounds like a real captain.</p>
<p begin="02:30:05.451" end="02:30:06.621" style="s2">Making money at sea takes skill,</p>
<p begin="02:30:06.691" end="02:30:08.111" style="s2">but coming home safely takes prep.</p>
<p begin="02:30:08.111" end="02:30:09.521" style="s2">Have some more, Maris.</p>
<p begin="02:30:09.801" end="02:30:11.221" style="s2">When Morgan runs off to sea,</p>
<p begin="02:30:11.321" end="02:30:12.871" style="s2">we count on you to watch the boat.</p>
<p begin="02:30:12.921" end="02:30:13.321" style="s2">Auntie,</p>
<p begin="02:30:13.701" end="02:30:14.961" style="s2">he knows when to quit now.</p>
<p begin="02:30:15.071" end="02:30:16.461" style="s2">He comes back once the hold is full.</p>
<p begin="02:30:16.521" end="02:30:18.271" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t push it in bad weather either.</p>
<p begin="02:30:18.271" end="02:30:19.181" style="s2">With someone watching me,</p>
<p begin="02:30:19.261" end="02:30:20.331" style="s2">you think I&#39;d dare not listen?</p>
<p begin="02:30:21.241" end="02:30:22.371" style="s2">Think I&#39;m too bossy?</p>
<p begin="02:30:23.011" end="02:30:24.971" style="s2">It&#39;s nice having someone who cares.</p>
<p begin="02:30:33.981" end="02:30:34.781" style="s2">What happened?</p>
<p begin="02:30:35.011" end="02:30:37.191" style="s2">I just passed the Deepwater Trench.</p>
<p begin="02:30:37.381" end="02:30:38.521" style="s2">There&#39;s something down there</p>
<p begin="02:30:38.591" end="02:30:40.421" style="s2">a giant creature I&#39;ve never seen.</p>
<p begin="02:30:40.571" end="02:30:42.741" style="s2">It has lots of really long tentacles.</p>
<p begin="02:30:43.041" end="02:30:43.991" style="s2">The vibrations it makes</p>
<p begin="02:30:44.031" end="02:30:45.311" style="s2">are heavier than a fishing boat&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="02:30:45.511" end="02:30:46.881" style="s2">It stays really deep down.</p>
<p begin="02:30:46.911" end="02:30:47.861" style="s2">It didn&#39;t chase us.</p>
<p begin="02:30:48.291" end="02:30:49.261" style="s2">But after it passed,</p>
<p begin="02:30:49.451" end="02:30:51.011" style="s2">all the big fish nearby ran off.</p>
<p begin="02:31:00.781" end="02:31:02.611" style="s2">Boss, who cares how many legs it has!</p>
<p begin="02:31:02.731" end="02:31:03.581" style="s2">If it dares to bully you,</p>
<p begin="02:31:03.711" end="02:31:04.871" style="s2">I&#39;ll be the first to charge!</p>
<p begin="02:31:04.871" end="02:31:05.671" style="s2">We&#39;re not going tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:31:06.041" end="02:31:07.291" style="s2">We don&#39;t know the currents in the trench</p>
<p begin="02:31:07.321" end="02:31:08.041" style="s2">or the habits of that</p>
<p begin="02:31:08.081" end="02:31:08.611" style="s2">big guy.</p>
<p begin="02:31:08.691" end="02:31:09.741" style="s2">Pushing through with a new boat</p>
<p begin="02:31:09.871" end="02:31:10.681" style="s2">would just be stupid.</p>
<p begin="02:31:10.681" end="02:31:11.571" style="s2">It didn&#39;t follow us.</p>
<p begin="02:31:11.891" end="02:31:12.541" style="s2">I&#39;ll have the pod</p>
<p begin="02:31:12.631" end="02:31:13.531" style="s2">keep an eye on that area.</p>
<p begin="02:31:13.701" end="02:31:14.871" style="s2">If we see it near Luna Cove,</p>
<p begin="02:31:14.971" end="02:31:15.941" style="s2">we&#39;ll come back and tell you.</p>
<p begin="02:31:15.941" end="02:31:16.771" style="s2">Morgan!</p>
<p begin="02:31:17.661" end="02:31:20.441" style="s2">Maris, the food&#39;s getting cold!</p>
<p begin="02:31:22.081" end="02:31:23.581" style="s2">Are you done looking at the sea?</p>
<p begin="02:31:23.771" end="02:31:25.091" style="s2">A giant creature we&#39;ve never seen</p>
<p begin="02:31:25.171" end="02:31:25.531" style="s2">showed up.</p>
<p begin="02:31:26.021" end="02:31:27.071" style="s2">But we&#39;ll worry about that later.</p>
<p begin="02:31:27.181" end="02:31:28.011" style="s2">Let&#39;s just eat for now.</p>
<p begin="02:31:32.481" end="02:31:34.441" style="s2">You&#39;re back! Eat while it&#39;s hot.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
